download, Gradio UI usage, API integration, or troubleshooting issues like VRAM problems, CUDA errors, or model loading failures.","bodyPreview":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|---","body":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md) | Web UI usage guide |\n| [INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md) | Inference parameters tuning |\n| [GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md) | GPU/VRAM configuration, hardware recommendations |\n| [ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md) | Environment detection, uv installation, python_embeded setup (Windows/Linux/macOS) |\n| [SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md) | Configuring launch scripts: .bat (Windows) and .sh (Linux/macOS) |\n| [UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md) | Git updates, file backup, conflict resolution (all platforms) |\n\n### API (for developers)\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [API.md](api/API.md) | REST API documentation |\n| [Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md) | OpenRouter API integration |\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Installation questions → read [getting-started/README.md](getting-started/README.md)\n2. General usage / best practices → read [getting-started/Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md)\n3. Project overview / architecture → read [getting-started/ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md)\n4. Web UI questions → read [guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md)\n5. Inference parameter tuning → read [guides/INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md)\n6. GPU/VRAM issues → read [guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md)\n7. Environment setup (uv, python_embeded) → read [guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md)\n8. Launch script configuration (.bat/.sh) → read [guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md)\n9. Updates and backup → read [guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md)\n10. API development → read [api/API.md](api/API.md) or [api/Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md)\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Installation problems**: See getting-started/README.md\n- **VRAM insufficient**: See guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md\n- **Model download failed**: See getting-started/README.md or guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **uv not found**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **Environment detection issues**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **BAT/SH script configuration**: See guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **Update and backup**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Update conflicts**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Inference quality issues**: See guides/INFERENCE.md\n- **Gradio UI not starting**: See guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:35:00.391Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Music Generation Agents needing comprehensive documentation for the ACE-Step music generation system.","zh":"适合需要ACE-Step音乐生成系统全面文档的音乐生成代理。","ja":"ACE-Step音楽生成システムの包括的なドキュメントが必要な音楽生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템에 대한 포괄적인 문서가 필요한 음악 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de música que necesitan documentación completa para el sistema de generación de música ACE-Step.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de musique ayant besoin d''une documentation complète pour le système de génération de musique ACE-Step.","de":"Perfekt für Musik-Generierungs-Agents, die umfassende Dokumentation für das ACE-Step-Musik-Generierungssystem benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Música que precisam de documentação abrangente para o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации музыки, которым требуется всеобъемлющая документация для системы генерации музыки ACE-Step.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الموسيقى الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق شامل لنظام توليد الموسيقى ACE-Step."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate the ACE-Step documentation, providing access to guides, tutorials, and model information, including README.md, Tutorial.md, and ABOUT.md files, supporting Mac, AMD, Intel, and CUDA devices.","zh":"赋予代理浏览ACE-Step文档的能力，提供访问指南、教程和模型信息的权限，包括README.md、Tutorial.md和ABOUT.md文件，支持Mac、AMD、Intel和CUDA设备。","ja":"エージェントがACE-Stepのドキュメントをナビゲートする能力を提供し、ガイド、チュートリアル、およびモデル情報へのアクセスを提供します。README.md、Tutorial.md、およびABOUT.mdファイルを含み、Mac、AMD、Intel、CUDAデバイスをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 ACE-Step 문서를 탐색할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 가이드, 튜토리얼 및 모델 정보에 대한 액세스를 제공하며 README.md, Tutorial.md 및 ABOUT.md 파일을 포함하며 Mac, AMD, Intel 및 CUDA 기기를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por la documentación de ACE-Step, proporcionando acceso a guías, tutoriales e información de modelos, incluyendo archivos README.md, Tutorial.md y ABOUT.md, compatibles con dispositivos Mac, AMD, Intel y CUDA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans la documentation ACE-Step, en fournissant un accès à des guides, des didacticiels et des informations de modèle, y compris des fichiers README.md, Tutorial.md et ABOUT.md, compatibles avec les appareils Mac, AMD, Intel et CUDA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die ACE-Step-Dokumentation zu navigieren und Zugang zu Anleitungen, Tutorials und Modellinformationen zu erhalten, einschließlich README.md-, Tutorial.md- und ABOUT.md-Dateien, die mit Mac-, AMD-, Intel- und CUDA-Geräten kompatibel sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pela documentação do ACE-Step, fornecendo acesso a guias, tutoriais e informações de modelo, incluindo arquivos README.md, Tutorial.md e ABOUT.md, suportando dispositivos Mac, AMD, Intel e CUDA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навигации по документации ACE-Step, обеспечивая доступ к руководствам, учебным пособиям и информации о модели, включая файлы README.md, Tutorial.md и ABOUT.md, поддерживающие устройства Mac, AMD, Intel и CUDA.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من التنقل في وثائق ACE-Step، وتوفير الوصول إلى الدلائل والتعليمات والمعلومات المتعلقة بالنماذج، بما في ذلك الملفات README.md و Tutorial.md و ABOUT.md، ودعم أجهزة Mac و AMD و Intel و CUDA."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ACE-Step model installations","Generating music with ACE-Step tutorials","Exploring ACE-Step project architecture"],"zh":["调试ACE-Step模型安装","使用ACE-Step教程生成音乐","探索ACE-Step项目架构"],"ja":["ACE-Stepモデルのインストールをデバッグする","ACE-Stepのチュートリアルで音楽を生成する","ACE-Stepプロジェクトのアーキテクチャを調査する"],"ko":["ACE-Step 모델 설치 디버깅","ACE-Step 튜토리얼을 사용한 음악 생성","ACE-Step 프로젝트 아키텍처 탐색"],"es":["Depuración de instalaciones de modelos ACE-Step","Generación de música con tutoriales ACE-Step","Exploración de la arquitectura del proyecto ACE-Step"],"fr":["Débogage des installations de modèles ACE-Step","Génération de musique avec des didacticiels ACE-Step","Exploration de l''architecture du projet ACE-Step"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei der Installation von ACE-Step-Modellen","Erzeugung von Musik mit ACE-Step-Tutorials","Erforschung der Projektkarchitektur von ACE-Step"],"pt":["Depuração de instalações de modelo ACE-Step","Geração de música com tutoriais ACE-Step","Exploração da arquitetura do projeto ACE-Step"],"ru":["Отладка установки модели ACE-Step","Генерация музыки с помощью учебников ACE-Step","Изучение архитектуры проекта ACE-Step"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تثبيت نموذج ACE-Step","توليد الموسيقى باستخدام تعليمات ACE-Step","استكشاف هيئة بناء مشروع ACE-Step"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ACE-Step documentation files","Specific to ACE-Step music generation system"],"zh":["需要访问ACE-Step文档文件","特定于ACE-Step音乐生成系统"],"ja":["ACE-Stepのドキュメントファイルへのアクセスが必要","ACE-Step音楽生成システムに特有"],"ko":["ACE-Step 문서 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de documentación de ACE-Step","Específico del sistema de generación de música ACE-Step"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de documentation ACE-Step","Spécifique au système de génération de musique ACE-Step"],"de":["Erfordert Zugang zu den Dokumentationsdateien von ACE-Step","Spezifisch für das ACE-Step-Musik-Generierungssystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de documentação do ACE-Step","Específico para o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам документации ACE-Step","Специфичен для системы генерации музыки ACE-Step"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات وثائق ACE-Step","محدد لنظام توليد الموسيقى ACE-Step"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"32f02c5a183ae7026c1e3adc85604589d2b1430ebd799d554fb07be9dc0f3356","qualityScore":44}');
