],"fr":["Synchronisation des compétences dans les outils de ligne de commande IA","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, OpenClaw et OpenCode","Simplification du partage d''équipe","Utilisation d''une seule commande pour synchroniser les compétences","Prise en charge de plusieurs outils de ligne de commande IA"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten in KI-Befehlszeilentools","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, OpenClaw und OpenCode","Vereinfachung des Team-Sharings","Verwendung eines einzigen Befehls zur Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten","Unterstützung für mehrere KI-Befehlszeilentools"],"pt":["Sincronização de habilidades em todas as ferramentas CLI de IA","Compartilhamento simplificado em equipe","Suporte a Claude Code, OpenClaw e OpenCode","Uso de um comando para sincronizar habilidades","Ferramenta de desenvolvedor para agentes de IA"],"ru":["Синхронизация навыков во всех ИИ CLI инструментах","Упрощение обмена командой","Поддержка Claude Code, OpenClaw и OpenCode","Использование одной команды для синхронизации навыков","Инструмент для разработчиков ИИ агентов"],"ar":["مزامنة المهارات على جميع أدوات CLI للذكاء الاصطناعي","تبسيط المشاركة الفريقية","دعم Claude Code و OpenClaw و OpenCode","استخدام أمر واحد لمزامنة المهارات","أداة مطور لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Skillshare","什么是 AI 智能工具","Skillshare 替代品","Skillshare 与其他工具的比较","Skillshare 安装","Skillshare 设置指南","AI CLI 工具","团队分享工具"],"ja":["Skillshare の使用方法","AI エージェントとは","Skillshare の代替","Skillshare と他のツールの比較","Skillshare のインストール","Skillshare の設定ガイド","AI CLI ツール","チームの共有ツール"],"ko":["Skillshare 를 사용하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","Skillshare 대체","Skillshare 와 다른 도구의 비교","Skillshare 설치","Skillshare 설정 가이드","AI CLI 도구","팀 공유 도구"],"es":["cómo usar skillshare","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","instalación de skillshare","guía de configuración de skillshare","herramientas de línea de comandos de IA","sincronización de habilidades en IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser skillshare","quoi est un Agent IA","alternatives à Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","installation de skillshare","guide de configuration de skillshare","outils de ligne de commande IA","synchronisation de compétences en IA"],"de":["wie man skillshare verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","Installation von skillshare","Konfigurationsanleitung für skillshare","KI-Befehlszeilentools","Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten in KI"],"pt":["como usar skillshare","o que é skillshare","ferramentas cli de ia","alternativas ao openclaw","skillshare vs opencode","instalar skillshare","guia de configuração do skillshare"],"ru":["как использовать skillshare","что такое skillshare","ИИ CLI инструменты","альтернативы openclaw","skillshare vs opencode","установить skillshare","руководство по настройке skillshare"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام skillshare","ما هي skillshare","أدوات cli للذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل openclaw","skillshare مقابل opencode","تثبيت skillshare","دليل إعداد skillshare"]}},"owner":"runkids","repo":"skillshare","repoPath":"runkids/skillshare","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.955Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skillshare","description":"|","version":"v0.16.10","bodyPreview":"# Skillshare CLI\n\nGlobal: `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` → all AI CLIs. Project: `.skillshare/skills/` → repo-local.\nAuto-detects project mode when `.skillshare/config.yaml` exists. Force with `-p` or `-g`.\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Getting Started\n```bash\nskillshare init --no-copy --all-targets --git --skill  # Fresh global setup\nskillshare init -p --targets \"claude,cursor\"            # Fresh project setup\nskillshare init --copy-from claude --all-targets --git  # Import from existing CLI\nskillshare init","body":"# Skillshare CLI\n\nGlobal: `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` → all AI CLIs. Project: `.skillshare/skills/` → repo-local.\nAuto-detects project mode when `.skillshare/config.yaml` exists. Force with `-p` or `-g`.\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Getting Started\n```bash\nskillshare init --no-copy --all-targets --git --skill  # Fresh global setup\nskillshare init -p --targets \"claude,cursor\"            # Fresh project setup\nskillshare init --copy-from claude --all-targets --git  # Import from existing CLI\nskillshare init --discover --select \"windsurf\"          # Add new AI tool later\n```\n### Installing Skills\n```bash\nskillshare install user/repo -s pdf,commit       # Select specific skills\nskillshare install user/repo --all               # Install everything\nskillshare install user/repo --into frontend     # Place in subdirectory\nskillshare install gitlab.com/team/repo          # Any Git host\nskillshare install user/repo --track             # Enable `update` later\nskillshare install user/repo -s pdf -p           # Install to project\nskillshare install                               # Reinstall all tracked remotes from config\nskillshare sync                                  # Always sync after install\nskillshare sync extras                           # Sync non-skill extras (rules, commands)\nskillshare sync --all                            # Sync skills + extras together\n```\n### Creating & Discovering Skills\n```bash\nskillshare new my-skill                          # Create a new skill from template\nskillshare search \"react testing\"                # Search GitHub for skills\nskillshare collect                               # Pull target-local changes back to source\n```\n### Removing Skills\n```bash\nskillshare uninstall my-skill                    # Remove one (moves to trash)\nskillshare uninstall skill-a skill-b             # Remove multiple\nskillshare uninstall -G frontend                 # Remove entire group\nskillshare sync                                  # Always sync after uninstall\n```\n### Team / Organization\n```bash\n# Creator: init project (see Getting Started) → add skills → commit .skillshare/\nskillshare install -p && skillshare sync                  # Member: clone → install → sync\nskillshare install github.com/team/repo --track -p        # Track shared repo\nskillshare push                                           # Cross-machine: push on A\nskillshare pull                                           # Cross-machine: pull on B\n```\n### Controlling Where Skills Go\n```bash\n# SKILL.md frontmatter: targets: [claude]        → only syncs to Claude\nskillshare target claude --add-include \"team-*\"   # glob filter\nskillshare target claude --add-exclude \"_legacy*\"  # exclude pattern\nskillshare target codex --mode copy && skillshare sync --force  # copy mode\n```\nSee [targets.md](references/targets.md) for details.\n### Updates & Maintenance\n```bash\nskillshare check                              # See what has updates\nskillshare update my-skill && skillshare sync  # Update one\nskillshare update --all && skillshare sync     # Update all\nskillshare update --all --diff                 # Show what changed\n```\n### Recovery & Troubleshooting\n```bash\nskillshare trash restore <name> && skillshare sync  # Undo delete\nskillshare sync                                     # Skill missing? Re-sync\nskillshare doctor && skillshare status              # Diagnose issues\nskillshare install user/repo --force                 # Override audit block\nskillshare install user/repo --skip-audit            # Bypass scan entirely\n```\nSee [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) for more.\n\n## Quick Lookup\n| Commands | Project? |\n|----------|:--------:|\n| `status`, `diff`, `list`, `doctor` | ✓ (auto) |\n| `sync`, `collect` | ✓ (auto) |\n| `install`, `uninstall`, `update`, `check`, `search`, `new` | ✓ (`-p`) |\n| `target`, `audit`, `trash`, `log` | ✓ (`-p`) |\n| `push`, `pull`, `backup`, `restore` | ✗ |\n| `tui`, `ui`, `upgrade` | ✓ |\n\n## AI Caller Rules\n1. **Non-interactive** — AI cannot answer prompts. Use `--force`, `--all`, `-s`, `--targets`, `--no-copy`, `--all-targets`, `--yes`.\n2. **Sync after mutations** — `install`, `uninstall`, `update`, `collect`, `target` all need `sync`.\n3. **Audit** — `install` auto-scans; CRITICAL blocks. `--force` to override, `--skip-audit` to bypass.\n4. **Uninstall safely** — moves to trash (7 days). `trash restore <name>` to undo. **NEVER** `rm -rf` symlinks.\n5. **Output** — `--json` for structured data, `--no-tui` for plain text, `tui off` to disable TUI globally, `--dry-run` to preview.\n\n## References\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| Init flags | [init.md](references/init.md) |\n| Sync/collect/push/pull | [sync.md](references/sync.md) |\n| Install/update/uninstall/new | [install.md](references/install.md) |\n| Status/diff/list/search/check | [status.md](references/status.md) |\n| Security audit | [audit.md](references/audit.md) |\n| Trash | [trash.md](references/trash.md) |\n| Operation log | [log.md](references/log.md) |\n| Targets | [targets.md](references/targets.md) |\n| Backup/restore | [backup.md](references/backup.md) |\n| Troubleshooting | [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:16.988Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI CLI Agents needing synchronized skill management across multiple tools like Claude Code and Cursor","zh":"非常适合需要在多个工具（如 Claude Code 和 Cursor）中同步技能管理的 AI CLI Agent","ja":"Claude Code や Cursor などの複数のツールでスキル管理を同期する必要がある AI CLI エージェントに最適","ko":"클라우드 코드와 커서 등 여러 도구에서 스킬 관리를 동기화해야 하는 AI CLI 에이전트에 완벽한","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI de IA que necesitan una gestión de habilidades sincronizada en varias herramientas como Claude Code y Cursor","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI IA nécessitant une gestion de compétences synchronisée sur plusieurs outils comme Claude Code et Cursor","de":"Perfekt für AI-CLI-Agents, die eine synchronisierte Fähigkeitsverwaltung über mehrere Tools wie Claude Code und Cursor benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI de IA que precisam de gestão de habilidades sincronizadas em várias ferramentas como Claude Code e Cursor","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI ИИ, которым требуется синхронизированное управление навыками в нескольких инструментах, таких как Claude Code и Cursor","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء CLI الإصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة المهارات المتزامنة عبر أدوات متعددة مثل Claude Code و Cursor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync skills across all AI CLI tools with one command, simplifying team sharing and supporting various tools like OpenClaw and OpenCode through YAML configuration files and project-local repositories","zh":"使得代理能够使用一条命令在所有 AI CLI 工具中同步技能，简化团队共享，并通过 YAML 配置文件和项目本地仓库支持 OpenClaw 和 OpenCode 等多种工具","ja":"エージェントが 1 つのコマンドですべての AI CLI ツールでスキルを同期できるようにし、チームの共有を簡素化し、YAML 構成ファイルとプロジェクトローカルリポジトリを介して OpenClaw や OpenCode などのさまざまなツールをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 하나의 명령으로 모든 AI CLI 도구에서 스킬을 동기화할 수 있도록 해주어 팀 공유를 간소화하고 YAML 구성 파일 및 프로젝트 로컬 저장소를 통해 오픈클로 및 오픈코드 등 다양한 도구를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sincronizar habilidades en todas las herramientas de CLI de IA con un solo comando, simplificando el intercambio en equipo y soportando varias herramientas como OpenClaw y OpenCode a través de archivos de configuración YAML y repositorios locales de proyectos","fr":"Autorise les agents à synchroniser les compétences sur tous les outils CLI IA avec une seule commande, simplifiant le partage d''équipe et prenant en charge divers outils comme OpenClaw et OpenCode via des fichiers de configuration YAML et des référentiels de projets locaux","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Fähigkeiten über alle AI-CLI-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl zu synchronisieren, vereinfacht das Teilen im Team und unterstützt verschiedene Tools wie OpenClaw und OpenCode über YAML-Konfigurationsdateien und projektlokale Repositorys","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar habilidades em todas as ferramentas CLI de IA com um único comando, simplificando o compartilhamento da equipe e suportando várias ferramentas como OpenClaw e OpenCode por meio de arquivos de configuração YAML e repositórios locais de projeto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать навыки во всех инструментах CLI ИИ с помощью одной команды, упрощая обмен командой и поддерживая различные инструменты, такие как OpenClaw и OpenCode, через файлы конфигурации YAML и локальные репозитории проекта","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مزامنة المهارات في جميع أدوات CLI الإصطناعي باستخدام أمر واحد ، مما يبسط مشاركة الفريق ودعم أدوات متعددة مثل OpenClaw و OpenCode من خلال ملفات تكوين YAML ومستودعات المشروع المحلية"},"useCases":{"en":["Syncing skills globally with a single command","Automating project-local skill setup with `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Importing skills from existing CLIs like Claude Code"],"zh":["使用一条命令全局同步技能","使用 `.skillshare/config.yaml` 自动设置项目本地技能","从现有的 CLI（如 Claude Code）导入技能"],"ja":["1 つのコマンドでグローバルにスキルを同期する","`.skillshare/config.yaml` を使用してプロジェクトローカルのスキル設定を自動化する","既存の CLI（たとえば Claude Code）からスキルをインポートする"],"ko":["하나의 명령으로 글로벌하게 스킬을 동기화","`.skillshare/config.yaml`을 사용하여 프로젝트 로컬 스킬 설정을 자동화","기존 CLI(예: 클라우드 코드)에서 스킬을 가져오기"],"es":["Sincronizar habilidades a nivel global con un solo comando","Automatizar la configuración de habilidades locales del proyecto con `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Importar habilidades desde CLIs existentes como Claude Code"],"fr":["Synchroniser les compétences à l''échelle mondiale avec une seule commande","Automatiser la configuration des compétences locales du projet avec `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Importer des compétences à partir de CLIs existants comme Claude Code"],"de":["Fähigkeiten global mit einem einzigen Befehl synchronisieren","Automatisieren der projektlollen Fähigkeitskonfiguration mit `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Fähigkeiten von bestehenden CLIs wie Claude Code importieren"],"pt":["Sincronizar habilidades globalmente com um único comando","Automatizar a configuração de habilidades locais do projeto com `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Importar habilidades de CLIs existentes como Claude Code"],"ru":["Синхронизировать навыки глобально с помощью одной команды","Автоматизировать настройку навыков проекта с помощью `.skillshare/config.yaml`","Импортировать навыки из существующих CLI, таких как Claude Code"],"ar":["مزامنة المهارات على مستوى العالم بأمر واحد","توفير إعدادات المهارات المحلية للمشروع مع `.skillshare/config.yaml`","استيراد المهارات من واجهات CLI الحالية مثل Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` directory for global setup","Project mode auto-detection relies on `.skillshare/config.yaml` presence"],"zh":["需要 `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` 目录进行全局设置","项目模式自动检测依赖于 `.skillshare/config.yaml` 的存在"],"ja":["グローバル設定には `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` ディレクトリが必要","プロジェクトモードの自動検出は `.skillshare/config.yaml` の存在に依存"],"ko":["글로벌 설정을 위해 `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` 디렉토리가 필요","프로젝트 모드 자동 감지는 `.skillshare/config.yaml`의 존재에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el directorio `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` para la configuración global","La detección automática del modo de proyecto depende de la presencia de `.skillshare/config.yaml`"],"fr":["Nécessite le répertoire `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` pour la configuration globale","La détection automatique du mode de projet dépend de la présence de `.skillshare/config.yaml`"],"de":["Benötigt das Verzeichnis `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` für die globale Konfiguration","Die automatische Projektmodus-Erkennung hängt von der Anwesenheit von `.skillshare/config.yaml` ab"],"pt":["Requer o diretório `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` para configuração global","A detecção automática do modo de projeto depende da presença de `.skillshare/config.yaml`"],"ru":["Требует каталога `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` для глобальной настройки","Автоматическое обнаружение режима проекта зависит от наличия `.skillshare/config.yaml`"],"ar":["يتطلب دليل `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` للإعداد العالمي","كشف التلقائي عن وضع المشروع يعتمد على وجود `.skillshare/config.yaml`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e290d45e4a1019ab5d50c170954732b99a63695a239dd0127fd736c1ee4b707c","qualityScore":44}');
