list und ask","Visuelle Komponenten wie code, table und markdown","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Komponenten mit awb run","Wartefunktion zum Lesen von JSON-Antworten","Titelvoraussetzung für jede Ausführung von awb run"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento interativo com componentes","Criação de experiências personalizadas","Suporte a componentes como confirm, checklist e ask","Integração com Claude Code","Interface de usuário personalizável"],"ru":["Интерактивная разработка с компонентами","Создание персонализированных trải nghiệm","Поддержка компонентов như confirm, checklist и ask","Интеграция с Claude Code","Настраиваемый интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["التطوير التفاعلي مع المكونات","إنشاء تجارب مخصصة","دعم المكونات مثل confirm و checklist و ask","التكامل مع Claude Code","واجهة مستخدم قابلة للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWB","交互式开发环境","Claude Code","快速开发","代码测试","组件化开发"],"ja":["AWB","インタラクティブ開発環境","Claude Code","迅速な開発","コードテスト","コンポーネント化開発"],"ko":["AWB","인터랙티브 개발 환경","Claude Code","빠른 개발","코드 테스트","컴포넌트화 개발"],"es":["awb","entorno de desarrollo interactivo","Claude Code","componentes interactivos","visualización de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["awb","environnement de développement interactif","Claude Code","composants interactifs","visualisation de données","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","technologies de développement"],"de":["awb","interaktive Entwicklungsumgebung","Claude Code","interaktive Komponenten","Datenvisualisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungstechnologien"],"pt":["AWB","Desenvolvimento interativo","Claude Code","Componentes","Experiências personalizadas","Tecnologia de desenvolvimento","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["AWB","Интерактивная разработка","Claude Code","Компоненты","Персонализированные trải nghiệm","Технология разработки","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["AWB","التطوير التفاعلي","Claude Code","المكونات","التجارب المخصصة","تكنولوجيا التطوير","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"termos-dev","repo":"agent-workbench","repoPath":"termos-dev/agent-workbench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.665Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"awb","description":"Run Agent Workbench (awb) interactive UI components from Codex or the CLI. Use when the user needs a confirmation, checklist, input, table, code or markdown view, or a visual playground. Always follow interactive runs with awb wait and the returned ID. Use tmux for long-running commands (see awb --help).","bodyPreview":"# Agent Workbench (awb)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Ensure the user has the playground open with `awb ui`.\n2. Run a component with `awb run --title \"...\" <component> [args]`.\n3. Always call `awb wait <id>` and read the JSON response.\n\n## Components\n\nInteractive: `confirm`, `checklist`, `ask`\nDisplay: `code`, `table`, `markdown`, `plan-viewer`, `html`\n\n## Essential Rules\n\n- Require `--title` for every `awb run`.\n- Run `awb run --help` before using a component you are unsure about.\n- If `awb` is not on PA","body":"# Agent Workbench (awb)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Ensure the user has the playground open with `awb ui`.\n2. Run a component with `awb run --title \"...\" <component> [args]`.\n3. Always call `awb wait <id>` and read the JSON response.\n\n## Components\n\nInteractive: `confirm`, `checklist`, `ask`\nDisplay: `code`, `table`, `markdown`, `plan-viewer`, `html`\n\n## Essential Rules\n\n- Require `--title` for every `awb run`.\n- Run `awb run --help` before using a component you are unsure about.\n- If `awb` is not on PATH, ask the user to install or run the local CLI.\n\n## Interactive Runs (Always wait)\n\n`awb run` returns immediately with an ID. Always call `awb wait <id>` to get the response.\n\n```bash\nID=$(awb run --title \"Q1\" confirm --prompt \"Approve?\")\nawb wait $ID\n```\n\nFire multiple at once, then wait for each:\n\n```bash\nID1=$(awb run --title \"Q1\" confirm --prompt \"Approve?\")\nID2=$(awb run --title \"Q2\" checklist --items \"A,B,C\")\nawb wait $ID1\nawb wait $ID2\n```\n\n## Wait Results\n\n`awb wait <id>` returns JSON with the user''s response:\n\n```json\n{\"confirmed\": true}\n{\"items\": [{\"text\":\"A\",\"checked\":true}]}\n{\"answers\": {\"key\": \"value\"}}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nconfirm\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Deploy\" confirm --prompt \"Deploy to production?\"\n```\n\nchecklist\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Tasks\" checklist --items \"Build,Test,Deploy\"\n```\n\nask (1-4 questions)\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Name\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Your name?\",\"header\":\"name\"}]''\nawb run --title \"Pick\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Language?\",\"header\":\"lang\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"TypeScript\"},{\"label\":\"Python\"}]}]''\nawb run --title \"Features\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Enable?\",\"header\":\"feat\",\"multiSelect\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Auth\"},{\"label\":\"API\"}]}]''\n```\n\ntable\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Data\" table --data ''[{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"age\":30},{\"name\":\"Bob\",\"age\":25}]''\n```\n\ncode (file only)\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Source\" code --file ./src/index.ts\n```\n\nmarkdown\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Docs\" markdown --file ./README.md\nawb run --title \"Notes\" markdown --content \"# Hello\\n\\nWorld\"\n```\n\nhtml\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Config\" html --content ''<html>...</html>''\n```\n\nplan-viewer\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Plan\" plan-viewer --file ./plan.md\n```\n\n## Background Processes with tmux\n\nUse tmux for long-running processes. Run `awb --help` to see your tmux session name.\n\n```bash\ntmux new-session -A -d -s <session-name>\ntmux new-window -t <session-name> -n \"dev\" \"npm run dev\"\ntmux capture-pane -t <session-name>:dev -p\ntmux send-keys -t <session-name>:dev \"npm test\" Enter\ntmux kill-window -t <session-name>:dev\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:11.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing interactive development and debugging capabilities with JSON response handling.","zh":"非常适合需要交互式开发和调试功能以及JSON响应处理的Claude Code Agents。","ja":"Claude Code Agentsが対話型の開発とデバッグ機能、およびJSONレスポンスの処理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대화형 개발 및 디버깅 기능과 JSON 응답 처리가 필요한 Claude Code 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Código Claude que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y depuración interactivas con manejo de respuestas JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de code Claude nécessitant des capacités de développement et de débogage interactif avec une gestion de réponses JSON.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-Code-Agents, die interaktive Entwicklung- und Debugging-Funktionen mit JSON-Antwortenverarbeitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento e depuração interativas com tratamento de respostas JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Claude Code, которым необходимы интерактивные возможности разработки и отладки с обработкой ответов JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعميل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير وتصحيح أخطاء تفاعلية مع معالجة استجابة JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interactively run and debug components like confirm, checklist, and ask, with features like code, table, and markdown display, utilizing the awb run and awb wait commands with JSON responses.","zh":"赋予代理交互式运行和调试confirm、checklist和ask等组件的能力，具有代码、表格和markdown显示等功能，利用awb run和awb wait命令以JSON响应。","ja":"confirm、checklist、askなどのコンポーネントを対話的に実行およびデバッグするエージェントの能力を提供し、コード、テーブル、markdownの表示などの機能を備え、awb runおよびawb waitコマンドを使用してJSONレスポンスを利用します。","ko":"확인, 체크리스트 및 질문 等의 구성 요소를 대화형으로 실행 및 디버깅 할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 코드, 테이블, 마크 다운 표시 등의 기능을 갖추고 awb 실행 및 awb 대기 명령을 사용하여 JSON 응답을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar y depurar de forma interactiva componentes como confirmar, lista de verificación y preguntar, con características como visualización de código, tabla y markdown, utilizando los comandos awb run y awb wait con respuestas JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter et de déboguer de manière interactive des composants tels que confirmer, liste de vérification et demander, avec des fonctionnalités telles que l''affichage de code, de tableaux et de markdown, en utilisant les commandes awb run et awb wait avec des réponses JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Komponenten wie Bestätigen, Checkliste und Fragen interaktiv auszuführen und zu debuggen, mit Funktionen wie Code-, Tabelle- und Markdown-Anzeige, unter Verwendung der Befehle awb run und awb wait mit JSON-Antworten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar e depurar de forma interativa componentes como confirmar, lista de verifica e perguntar, com recursos como exibição de código, tabela e markdown, utilizando os comandos awb executar e awb aguardar com respostas JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интерактивного запуска и отладки компонентов, таких как подтверждение, список проверки и запрос, с функциями, такими как отображение кода, таблицы и markdown, используя команды awb запустить и awb подождать с ответами JSON.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية تشغيل وتصحيح أخطاء مكونات مثل التأكيد والقائمة والاستعلام بشكل تفاعلي، مع ميزات مثل عرض الكود والجدول وتنسيق markdown، باستخدام أوامر awb تشغيل وawb انتظار مع استجابات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging interactive components with awb wait and JSON output","Developing and testing checklist and confirm components","Displaying code and markdown content within the Agent Workbench"],"zh":["使用awb wait和JSON输出调试交互式组件","开发和测试检查列表和确认组件","在Agent Workbench中显示代码和markdown内容"],"ja":["awb waitおよびJSON出力を使用した対話型コンポーネントのデバッグ","チェックリストおよび確認コンポーネントの開発およびテスト","エージェントワークベンチ内でコードおよびmarkdownコンテンツを表示"],"ko":["awb 대기 및 JSON 출력을 사용한 대화형 구성 요소 디버깅","체크리스트 및 확인 구성 요소 개발 및 테스트","에이전트 작업 ベンチ 내에서 코드 및 마크 다운 콘텐츠 표시"],"es":["Depuración de componentes interactivos con awb wait y salida JSON","Desarrollo y prueba de componentes de lista de verificación y confirmación","Visualización de contenido de código y markdown dentro del Agent Workbench"],"fr":["Débogage de composants interactifs avec awb wait et sortie JSON","Développement et test de composants de liste de vérification et de confirmation","Affichage de contenu de code et de markdown à l''intérieur de l''Agent Workbench"],"de":["Debugging interaktiver Komponenten mit awb wait und JSON-Ausgabe","Entwicklung und Testen von Checkliste- und Bestätigungskomponenten","Anzeige von Code- und Markdown-Inhalten innerhalb des Agent Workbench"],"pt":["Depuração de componentes interativos com awb aguardar e saída JSON","Desenvolvimento e teste de componentes de lista de verifica e confirmar","Exibição de conteúdo de código e markdown dentro do Agent Workbench"],"ru":["Отладка интерактивных компонентов с awb подождать и выводом JSON","Разработка и тестирование компонентов списка проверки и подтверждения","Отображение содержимого кода и markdown внутри Agent Workbench"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء المكونات التفاعلية مع awb انتظار ومخرجات JSON","تطوير واختبار مكونات القائمة والتأكيد","عرض محتوى الكود وتنسيق markdown داخل Agent Workbench"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires awb ui to be open","Must call awb wait for each component run"],"zh":["需要awb ui打开","必须为每个组件运行调用awb wait"],"ja":["awb uiが開いている必要がある","各コンポーネントの実行ごとにawb waitを呼び出す必要がある"],"ko":["awb ui가 열려 있어야 함","각 구성 요소 실행 시 awb 대기 호출 필요"],"es":["Requiere que awb ui esté abierto","Debe llamar a awb wait para cada ejecución de componente"],"fr":["Nécessite que awb ui soit ouvert","Doit appeler awb wait pour chaque exécution de composant"],"de":["Benötigt, dass awb ui geöffnet ist","Muss awb wait für jeden Komponentenlauf aufrufen"],"pt":["Exige que a interface do usuário awb esteja aberta","Deve chamar awb aguardar para cada execução de componente"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы интерфейс пользователя awb был открыт","Должно вызывать awb подождать для каждого запуска компонента"],"ar":["يتطلب أن تكون واجهة المستخدم awb مفتوحة","يجب استدعاء awb انتظار لكل تشغيل لمكون"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"04fd26f1dac60b864f405eb83f18c2c09f3cf3c75b605f189d85d0c34a55b2b2","qualityScore":43}');
