hon et d''autres langages de programmation","Analyse de données avancée pour une meilleure prise de décision"],"de":["Agregator für KI-Forschungsintelligenz","Genaue Daten für die Verbesserung von Entwicklungsprojekten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für eine einfache Integration","Kompatibilität mit Python und anderen Programmiersprachen","Erweiterte Datenanalyse für eine bessere Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Agregação de inteligência de pesquisa de IA","Melhoria das habilidades de desenvolvimento","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para facilitar a utilização","Suporte a agentes de IA"],"ru":["Агрегатор исследований ИИ","Улучшение навыков разработки","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для облегчения использования","Поддержка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["جامع استخبارات البحث الاصطناعي","تحسين مهارات التطوير","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI لتسهيل الاستخدام","دعم وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用prediction-tracking","什么是AI智能跟踪预测","prediction-tracking替代品","prediction-tracking vs 其他工具","prediction-tracking安装","prediction-tracking设置指南","AI智能跟踪预测工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["prediction-trackingの使い方","AIエージェントの予測追跡とは","prediction-trackingの代替","prediction-tracking vs 他のツール","prediction-trackingのインストール","prediction-trackingの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの予測追跡ツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["prediction-tracking 사용법","AI 에이전트 예측 추적이란","prediction-tracking 대안","prediction-tracking vs 다른 도구","prediction-tracking 설치","prediction-tracking 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 예측 추적 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["herramientas de IA","inteligencia de investigación de IA","cómo usar prediction-tracking","alternativas a prediction-tracking","prediction-tracking vs otras herramientas de IA","instalación de prediction-tracking","guía de configuración de prediction-tracking","desarrollo de software con IA","análisis de datos con IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","intelligence de recherche IA","comment utiliser prediction-tracking","alternatives à prediction-tracking","prediction-tracking vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de prediction-tracking","guide de configuration de prediction-tracking","développement de logiciels avec IA","analyse de données avec IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","KI-Forschungsintelligenz","wie man prediction-tracking verwendet","Alternativen zu prediction-tracking","prediction-tracking vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von prediction-tracking","Einrichtungsanleitung für prediction-tracking","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","Datenanalyse mit KI"],"pt":["como usar prediction-tracking","o que é prediction-tracking","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","prediction-tracking vs ferramentas de IA","instalar prediction-tracking","guia de configuração do prediction-tracking"],"ru":["как использовать prediction-tracking","что такое prediction-tracking","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","prediction-tracking vs инструменты ИИ","установить prediction-tracking","руководство по настройке prediction-tracking"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام prediction-tracking","ما هو prediction-tracking","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","prediction-tracking مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت prediction-tracking","دليل إعداد prediction-tracking"]}},"owner":"rickoslyder","repo":"HypeDelta","repoPath":"rickoslyder/HypeDelta","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.689Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prediction-tracking","description":"Track and evaluate AI predictions over time to assess accuracy. Use when reviewing past predictions to determine if they came true, failed, or remain uncertain.","bodyPreview":"# Prediction Tracking Skill\n\nTrack predictions made by AI researchers and critics, evaluate their accuracy over time.\n\n## Prediction Recording\n\nWhen recording a new prediction, capture:\n\n### Required Fields\n- **text**: The prediction as stated\n- **author**: Who made it\n- **madeAt**: When it was made\n- **timeframe**: When they expect it to happen\n- **topic**: What area of AI\n- **confidence**: How confident they seemed\n\n### Optional Fields\n- **sourceUrl**: Where the prediction was made\n- **targetD","body":"# Prediction Tracking Skill\n\nTrack predictions made by AI researchers and critics, evaluate their accuracy over time.\n\n## Prediction Recording\n\nWhen recording a new prediction, capture:\n\n### Required Fields\n- **text**: The prediction as stated\n- **author**: Who made it\n- **madeAt**: When it was made\n- **timeframe**: When they expect it to happen\n- **topic**: What area of AI\n- **confidence**: How confident they seemed\n\n### Optional Fields\n- **sourceUrl**: Where the prediction was made\n- **targetDate**: Specific date if mentioned\n- **conditions**: Any caveats or conditions\n- **metrics**: How to measure success\n\n## Evaluation Status\n\nWhen evaluating predictions, assign one of:\n\n### `verified`\nClearly came true as stated.\n- The predicted capability/event occurred\n- Within the stated timeframe\n- Substantially as described\n\n### `falsified`\nClearly did not come true.\n- Timeframe passed without occurrence\n- Contradictory evidence emerged\n- Author retracted or modified claim\n\n### `partially-verified`\nPartially accurate.\n- Some aspects came true, others didn''t\n- Capability exists but weaker than claimed\n- Timeframe was off but direction correct\n\n### `too-early`\nNot enough time has passed.\n- Still within stated timeframe\n- No definitive evidence either way\n\n### `unfalsifiable`\nCannot be objectively assessed.\n- Too vague to measure\n- No clear success criteria\n- Moved goalposts\n\n### `ambiguous`\nPrediction was too vague to evaluate.\n- Multiple interpretations possible\n- Success criteria unclear\n\n## Evaluation Process\n\nFor each prediction being evaluated:\n\n### 1. Restate the prediction\nWhat exactly was claimed?\n\n### 2. Identify timeframe\nHas enough time passed to evaluate?\n\n### 3. Gather evidence\nWhat has happened since?\n- Relevant releases or announcements\n- Benchmark results\n- Real-world deployments\n- Counter-evidence\n\n### 4. Assess status\nWhich evaluation status applies?\n\n### 5. Score accuracy\nIf verifiable, rate 0.0-1.0:\n- 1.0: Exactly as predicted\n- 0.7-0.9: Substantially correct\n- 0.4-0.6: Partially correct\n- 0.1-0.3: Mostly wrong\n- 0.0: Completely wrong\n\n### 6. Note lessons\nWhat does this tell us about:\n- The author''s forecasting ability\n- The topic''s predictability\n- Common prediction pitfalls\n\n## Output Format\n\nFor evaluation:\n```json\n{\n  \"evaluations\": [\n    {\n      \"predictionId\": \"id\",\n      \"status\": \"verified\",\n      \"accuracyScore\": 0.85,\n      \"evidence\": \"Description of evidence\",\n      \"notes\": \"Additional context\",\n      \"evaluatedAt\": \"timestamp\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nFor accuracy statistics:\n```json\n{\n  \"author\": \"Author name\",\n  \"totalPredictions\": 15,\n  \"verified\": 5,\n  \"falsified\": 3,\n  \"partiallyVerified\": 2,\n  \"pending\": 4,\n  \"unfalsifiable\": 1,\n  \"averageAccuracy\": 0.62,\n  \"topicBreakdown\": {\n    \"reasoning\": { \"predictions\": 5, \"accuracy\": 0.7 },\n    \"agents\": { \"predictions\": 3, \"accuracy\": 0.4 }\n  },\n  \"calibration\": \"Assessment of how well-calibrated they are\"\n}\n```\n\n## Calibration Assessment\n\nEvaluate whether predictors are well-calibrated:\n\n### Well-Calibrated\n- High-confidence predictions usually come true\n- Low-confidence predictions have mixed results\n- Acknowledges uncertainty appropriately\n\n### Overconfident\n- High-confidence predictions often fail\n- Rarely expresses uncertainty\n- Doesn''t update on evidence\n\n### Underconfident\n- Low-confidence predictions often come true\n- Hedges even on likely outcomes\n- Too conservative\n\n### Inconsistent\n- Confidence doesn''t correlate with accuracy\n- Random relationship between stated and actual accuracy\n\n## Tracking Notable Predictors\n\nKeep running assessments of key voices:\n\n| Predictor | Total | Accuracy | Calibration | Notes |\n|-----------|-------|----------|-------------|-------|\n| Sam Altman | 20 | 55% | Overconfident | Timeline optimism |\n| Gary Marcus | 15 | 70% | Well-calibrated | Conservative |\n| Dario Amodei | 12 | 65% | Slightly over | Safety-focused |\n\n## Red Flags\n\nWatch for prediction patterns that suggest bias:\n- Always bullish regardless of topic\n- Never acknowledges failed predictions\n- Moves goalposts when wrong\n- Predictions align suspiciously with financial interests\n- Vague enough to claim credit for anything\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:31:05.921Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Research Agents needing advanced prediction tracking and evaluation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级预测跟踪和评估能力的 AI 研究代理。","ja":"AI 研究エージェントが高度な予測の追跡と評価機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 예측 추적 및 평가 기능이 필요한 AI 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación de IA que necesitan capacidades de seguimiento y evaluación de predicciones avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche en IA nécessitant des capacités de suivi et d''évaluation de prédictions avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte Vorhersage-Verfolgungs- und Bewertungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de rastreamento e avaliação de previsões.","ru":"Идеально для агентов исследований ИИ, которым требуются продвинутые возможности отслеживания и оценки прогнозов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البحث الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتتبع وتقييم التنبؤات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track and evaluate predictions made by AI researchers and critics, utilizing fields like text, author, madeAt, timeframe, topic, and confidence, with optional fields such as sourceUrl, to provide comprehensive analysis and accuracy assessments over time.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪和评估 AI 研究人员和评论者做出的预测的能力，利用文本、作者、madeAt、时间范围、主题和置信度等字段，并提供可选字段，如 sourceUrl，以便随时间提供全面分析和准确性评估。","ja":"エージェントが AI 研究者や批評家によって行われた予測を追跡し、評価する能力を付与します。テキスト、著者、madeAt、時間枠、トピック、信頼性などのフィールドを利用し、sourceUrl などのオプション フィールドを提供して、時間の経過とともに包括的な分析と精度の評価を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 AI 연구자와 비평가가 한 예측을 추적하고 평가할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 텍스트, 저자, madeAt, 시간 범위, 주제, 확신도 등의 필드를 사용하며 sourceUrl 등의 선택 필드를 제공하여 시간이 지나면서 포괄적인 분석과 정확도 평가를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear y evaluar las predicciones realizadas por investigadores y críticos de IA, utilizando campos como texto, autor, madeAt, timeframe, tema y confianza, con campos opcionales como sourceUrl, para proporcionar un análisis y evaluaciones de precisión integrales con el tiempo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre et d''évaluer les prédictions faites par les chercheurs et les critiques en IA, en utilisant des champs tels que texte, auteur, madeAt, timeframe, sujet et confiance, avec des champs facultatifs tels que sourceUrl, pour fournir une analyse et des évaluations de précision complètes dans le temps.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vorhersagen von KI-Forschern und Kritikern zu verfolgen und zu bewerten, indem Felder wie Text, Autor, madeAt, timeframe, Thema und Vertrauen verwendet werden, mit optionalen Feldern wie sourceUrl, um eine umfassende Analyse und Genauigkeitsbewertungen über die Zeit hinweg zu liefern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear e avaliar previsões feitas por pesquisadores e críticos de IA, utilizando campos como texto, autor, madeAt, timeframe, tópico e confiança, com campos opcionais como sourceUrl, para fornecer análise abrangente e avaliações de precisão ao longo do tempo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать и оценивать прогнозы, сделанные исследователями и критиками ИИ, используя поля seperti текст, автор, madeAt, timeframe, тема и уверенность, с необязательными полями как sourceUrl, для предоставления всестороннего анализа и оценок точности во времени.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تتبع وتقييم التنبؤات التي يقوم بها باحثو النقد الاصطناعي، باستخدام مجالات مثل النص والكاتب و madeAt و timeframe وموضوع وثقة، مع مجالات اختيارية مثل sourceUrl، لتوفير تحليل شامل وتقييمات دقة مع مرور الوقت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating prediction recording with required fields like text and author","Evaluating prediction accuracy over specific timeframes and topics","Generating reports on predictor confidence and performance"],"zh":["使用必需字段（如文本和作者）自动记录预测","评估特定时间范围和主题的预测准确性","生成预测者置信度和性能报告"],"ja":["テキストや著者などの必須フィールドを使用して予測を自動的に記録する","特定の時間枠やトピックの予測精度を評価する","予測者の信頼性やパフォーマンスのレポートを生成する"],"ko":["텍스트와 저자 등의 필수 필드를 사용하여 예측을 자동으로 기록하는 것","특정 시간 범위와 주제의 예측 정확도를 평가하는 것","예측자의 확신도와 성능에 대한 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la grabación de predicciones con campos obligatorios como texto y autor","Evaluar la precisión de las predicciones durante intervalos de tiempo y temas específicos","Generar informes sobre la confianza y el rendimiento de los predictores"],"fr":["Automatiser l''enregistrement des prédictions avec des champs obligatoires tels que texte et auteur","Évaluer la précision des prédictions sur des intervalles de temps et des sujets spécifiques","Générer des rapports sur la confiance et les performances des prévisionnistes"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufzeichnung von Vorhersagen mit erforderlichen Feldern wie Text und Autor","Bewerten der Vorhersagegenauigkeit über bestimmte Zeitrahmen und Themen","Erstellen von Berichten über die Vertrauenswürdigkeit und Leistung der Vorhersager"],"pt":["Automatizar a gravação de previsões com campos obrigatórios como texto e autor","Avaliar a precisão das previsões sobre períodos de tempo específicos e tópicos","Gerar relatórios sobre a confiança e o desempenho dos preditores"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запись прогнозов с обязательными полями как текст и автор","Оценивать точность прогнозов за определенные периоды времени и темы","Генерировать отчеты о уверенности и производительности предсказателей"],"ar":["توفير تسجيل تلقائي للتنبؤات باستخدام الحقول الإلزامية مثل النص والكاتب","تقييم دقة التنبؤات خلال فترات زمنية ومواضيع محددة","إصدار تقارير حول ثقة وأداء المنبئين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires structured data input for prediction recording","Limited to tracking predictions made by AI researchers and critics","Needs manual updating for prediction outcomes and accuracy assessments"],"zh":["需要结构化数据输入来记录预测","仅限于跟踪 AI 研究人员和评论者做出的预测","需要手动更新预测结果和准确性评估"],"ja":["予測の記録に構造化されたデータ入力が必要","AI 研究者や批評家によって行われた予測の追跡のみに限定される","予測結果や精度の評価の手動更新が必要"],"ko":["예측을 기록하기 위해 구조화된 데이터 입력이 필요","AI 연구자와 비평가가 한 예측만 추적할 수 있음","예측 결과와 정확도 평가를 수동으로 업데이트해야 함"],"es":["Requiere datos estructurados de entrada para la grabación de predicciones","Limitado a la seguimiento de predicciones realizadas por investigadores y críticos de IA","Necesita actualizaciones manuales para los resultados de las predicciones y las evaluaciones de precisión"],"fr":["Nécessite des données structurées pour l''enregistrement des prédictions","Limité au suivi des prédictions faites par les chercheurs et les critiques en IA","Nécessite des mises à jour manuelles pour les résultats des prédictions et les évaluations de précision"],"de":["Benötigt strukturierte Daten für die Aufzeichnung von Vorhersagen","Begrenzt auf die Verfolgung von Vorhersagen von KI-Forschern und Kritikern","Benötigt manuelle Updates für die Ergebnisse der Vorhersagen und die Genauigkeitsbewertungen"],"pt":["Exige entrada de dados estruturados para gravação de previsões","Limitado ao rastreamento de previsões feitas por pesquisadores e críticos de IA","Necessita de atualização manual para resultados de previsões e avaliações de precisão"],"ru":["Требует структурированного входного данных для записи прогнозов","Ограничен отслеживанием прогнозов, сделанных исследователями и критиками ИИ","Требует ручного обновления для результатов прогнозов и оценок точности"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال البيانات المنظمة لتسجيل التنبؤات","محدود بتتبع التنبؤات التي يقوم بها باحثو النقد الاصطناعي","يحتاج إلى تحديث يدوي للنتائج والتقديرات الدقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1d8fddba5c670b4e11f4b1337d3e2f9fe1a5add369bc2313ad0cd274ac6a1956","qualityScore":43}');
