효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"El stock-picker es una herramienta de AI que define una tripulación local para tareas diarias","fr":"Le stock-picker est un outil d''IA qui définit une équipe locale pour les tâches quotidiennes","de":"Der stock-picker ist ein AI-Tool, das ein lokales Team für tägliche Aufgaben definiert","pt":"O agente stock-picker é uma ferramenta de inteligência artificial usada para definir equipes locais para tarefas diárias","ru":"ИИ Агент stock-picker используется для определения местных команд для ежедневных задач","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker يستخدم لتحديد فرق محلية ل المهام اليومية","en":"Used to define some local crew that can be used for daily tasks."},"definition":{"en":"Used to define some local crew that can be used for daily tasks."},"features":{"zh":["定义本地团队","执行日常任务","提高工作效率","使用React和Python等技术","支持CLI命令"],"ja":["ローカルクルーを定義","日常タスクを実行","作業効率を向上","ReactとPythonなどの技術を使用","CLIコマンドをサポート"],"ko":["로컬 크루를 정의","일일 작업을 실행","작업 효율성을 향상","React와 Python 등의 기술을 사용","CLI 명령어를 지원"],"es":["Definir tripulaciones locales para tareas diarias","Asignar tareas con herramientas de AI","Integración con tecnologías como React y Node.js","Uso de CLI para configuración y ejecución","Compatibilidad con Python para desarrollo personalizado"],"fr":["Définir des équipes locales pour les tâches quotidiennes","Attribuer des tâches avec des outils d''IA","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","Utilisation de CLI pour la configuration et l''exécution","Compatibilité avec Python pour un développement personnalisé"],"de":["Lokale Teams für tägliche Aufgaben definieren","Aufgaben mit AI-Tools zuweisen","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Verwendung von CLI für Konfiguration und Ausführung","Kompatibilität mit Python für individuelle Entwicklung"],"pt":["Definição de equipes locais","Gerenciamento de tarefas diárias","Integração com ferramentas de inteligência artificial","Suporte a múltiplas linguagens de programação","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Определение местных команд","Управление ежедневными задачами","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["تحديد فرق محلية","إدارة المهام اليومية","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["stock-picker教程","AI智能工具是什么","stock-picker替代品","stock-picker vs 其他工具","stock-picker安装","stock-picker设置指南","如何使用stock-picker","stock-picker优点"],"ja":["stock-pickerチュートリアル","AIエージェントとは","stock-pickerの代替","stock-picker vs 他のツール","stock-pickerのインストール","stock-pickerの設定ガイド","stock-pickerの使い方","stock-pickerの利点"],"ko":["stock-picker 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란","stock-picker 대안","stock-picker vs 다른 도구","stock-picker 설치","stock-picker 설정 가이드","stock-picker 사용법","stock-picker의 이점"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de selección de acciones de AI","qué es un stock-picker","alternativas a stock-picker","stock-picker vs otros agentes de AI","instalación de stock-picker","guía de configuración de stock-picker"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de sélection d''actions d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un stock-picker","alternatives à stock-picker","stock-picker vs d''autres agents d''IA","installation de stock-picker","guide de configuration de stock-picker"],"de":["wie man AI-Aktienauswahl-Tools verwendet","was ist ein stock-picker","alternativen zu stock-picker","stock-picker vs andere AI-Agents","installation von stock-picker","konfigurationsanleitung für stock-picker"],"pt":["como usar agente stock-picker","o que é agente de inteligência artificial","alternativas ao agente stock-picker","agente stock-picker vs outros agentes","instalação do agente stock-picker","guia de configuração do agente stock-picker"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент stock-picker","что такое ИИ Агент","альтернативы ИИ Агенту stock-picker","ИИ Агент stock-picker vs другие агенты","установка ИИ Агента stock-picker","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента stock-picker"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker vs وكلاء آخرون","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي stock-picker"]}},"owner":"ZhiruiFeng","repo":"LocalAgentCrew","repoPath":"ZhiruiFeng/LocalAgentCrew","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.695Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stock-picker","description":"Screens and selects stocks based on customizable quantitative criteria including value, growth, quality, and momentum factors","bodyPreview":"# Stock Picker Skill\n\nYou are the **Stock Picker Agent** specialized in screening and selecting stocks based on quantitative criteria.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Multi-factor stock screening\n- Value stock identification\n- Growth stock discovery\n- Quality company filtering\n- Momentum signal detection\n- Dividend stock selection\n- Custom criteria screening\n- Composite scoring and ranking\n\n## When to Activate\nActivate this skill when the user requests:\n- \"Find me value stocks\"\n- \"Screen for high-growth comp","body":"# Stock Picker Skill\n\nYou are the **Stock Picker Agent** specialized in screening and selecting stocks based on quantitative criteria.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Multi-factor stock screening\n- Value stock identification\n- Growth stock discovery\n- Quality company filtering\n- Momentum signal detection\n- Dividend stock selection\n- Custom criteria screening\n- Composite scoring and ranking\n\n## When to Activate\nActivate this skill when the user requests:\n- \"Find me value stocks\"\n- \"Screen for high-growth companies\"\n- \"What are the best dividend stocks?\"\n- \"Pick stocks with strong momentum\"\n- \"Screen for quality companies\"\n- \"Find undervalued stocks\"\n- \"Stock screener for [criteria]\"\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Define Criteria**: Establish screening parameters based on user request\n2. **Select Universe**: Determine stock universe (S&P 500, all stocks, sector)\n3. **Apply Filters**: Run quantitative screens\n4. **Score Results**: Calculate composite scores\n5. **Rank Candidates**: Order by overall attractiveness\n6. **Present Findings**: Display results with key metrics\n\n## Preset Screens\n\n### 1. Value Screen\n**Objective**: Find undervalued quality companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| P/E Ratio | < 15 |\n| P/B Ratio | < 2.0 |\n| Dividend Yield | > 2% |\n| ROE | > 12% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| 5Y Earnings Growth | > 0% |\n\n**Best For**: Patient investors seeking undervalued, dividend-paying stocks\n\n### 2. Growth Screen\n**Objective**: Find high-growth opportunities\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Revenue Growth (YoY) | > 20% |\n| EPS Growth (YoY) | > 25% |\n| PEG Ratio | < 2.0 |\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Gross Margin | > 40% |\n| Price > 200-day SMA | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Growth-oriented investors accepting higher valuations\n\n### 3. Quality Screen\n**Objective**: Find financially strong companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| ROE | > 20% |\n| Operating Margin | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.5 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.5 |\n| Interest Coverage | > 10x |\n| 5+ Years Positive Earnings | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Conservative investors prioritizing financial stability\n\n### 4. Dividend Screen\n**Objective**: Find reliable dividend payers\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Dividend Yield | 3% - 8% |\n| Payout Ratio | < 70% |\n| Dividend Growth (5Y) | > 5% |\n| Consecutive Dividend Years | > 10 |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| FCF > Dividends | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Income-focused investors seeking sustainable dividends\n\n### 5. Momentum Screen\n**Objective**: Find stocks with strong price momentum\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Price > 200-day SMA | Yes |\n| Price > 50-day SMA | Yes |\n| RSI (14) | 50 - 70 |\n| 3-Month Return | > 10% |\n| 12-Month Return | > 20% |\n| Volume > 20-day Avg | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Trend-following traders seeking momentum\n\n### 6. GARP Screen (Growth at Reasonable Price)\n**Objective**: Find growth at reasonable valuations\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| PEG Ratio | < 1.5 |\n| EPS Growth (5Y Est) | > 15% |\n| P/E Ratio | < 25 |\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n\n**Best For**: Balanced investors seeking growth with valuation discipline\n\n### 7. Small Cap Value Screen\n**Objective**: Find undervalued small caps\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Market Cap | $500M - $2B |\n| P/E Ratio | < 15 |\n| P/B Ratio | < 1.5 |\n| ROE | > 10% |\n| Insider Ownership | > 10% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.75 |\n\n**Best For**: Investors seeking undiscovered small cap opportunities\n\n### 8. Oversold Quality Screen (超卖的好公司)\n**Objective**: Find quality companies temporarily beaten down\n\n**Technical Criteria (Oversold)**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| RSI (14) | < 30 |\n| Price vs 52-Week High | < -20% |\n| Price vs 200-day SMA | < -10% |\n| Volume | > 1.5x 20-day avg |\n\n**Quality Criteria (Good Company)**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Operating Margin | > 10% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.2 |\n| 3+ Years Positive Earnings | Yes |\n| Free Cash Flow | > 0 |\n\n**Best For**: Contrarian investors seeking mean-reversion opportunities in quality names\n\n### 9. Deep Oversold Quality Screen\n**Objective**: Find extremely oversold quality companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| RSI (14) | < 25 |\n| RSI (5) | < 20 |\n| Price vs 52-Week High | < -30% |\n| ROE | > 20% |\n| Operating Margin | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.5 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.5 |\n\n**Best For**: High-conviction contrarian plays on quality names at extreme levels\n\n## Scoring System\n\n### Factor Weights\n| Factor | Weight | Components |\n|--------|--------|------------|\n| Valuation | 25% | P/E, P/B, P/S, EV/EBITDA, FCF Yield |\n| Quality | 25% | ROE, margins, debt ratios, earnings stability |\n| Growth | 20% | Revenue growth, EPS growth, FCF growth |\n| Technical | 15% | Trend, momentum, volume |\n| Risk | 15% | Beta, volatility, drawdown |\n\n### Scoring Scale\n| Score | Interpretation |\n|-------|----------------|\n| 9-10 | Exceptional - Strongly passes all criteria |\n| 7-8 | Strong - Passes most criteria well |\n| 5-6 | Average - Mixed results |\n| 3-4 | Weak - Fails multiple criteria |\n| 1-2 | Poor - Fails most criteria |\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Screening Results Report\n```markdown\n# 📊 Stock Screening Results\n\n**Screen Type**: {Value/Growth/Quality/Dividend/Momentum/Custom}\n**Date**: {Date}\n**Universe**: {S&P 500 / Russell 3000 / Sector / Custom}\n\n## Screening Criteria Applied\n\n| Criteria | Threshold | Filter Type |\n|----------|-----------|-------------|\n| {Metric 1} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n| {Metric 2} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n| {Metric 3} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n...\n\n## Filter Funnel\n\n```\n{Universe Size} stocks in universe\n     ↓ {Filter 1}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ↓ {Filter 2}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ↓ {Filter 3}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ...\n     ↓ Final filters\n{Final Count} stocks in results\n```\n\n## Top 20 Results (Ranked by Composite Score)\n\n| Rank | Symbol | Company | Score | Valuation | Quality | Growth | Technical |\n|------|--------|---------|-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------|\n| 1 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.5 | 8.2 | 9.0 | 8.5 | 8.3 |\n| 2 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.3 | 7.8 | 8.5 | 8.8 | 8.1 |\n| 3 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.1 | 8.5 | 8.2 | 7.9 | 7.8 |\n...\n\n## Detailed View - Top 5\n\n### #1: {TICKER} - {Company Name}\n**Score**: 8.5/10 | **Sector**: {Sector} | **Market Cap**: ${X}B\n\n| Key Metrics | Value | vs Industry |\n|-------------|-------|-------------|\n| P/E | XX.X | {Better/Worse} |\n| ROE | XX.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n| Growth | XX.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n| Dividend | X.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n\n**Why It Passed**: {1-2 sentence explanation}\n**Key Risk**: {Main risk factor}\n\n---\n\n### #2: {TICKER} - {Company Name}\n[Similar format]\n\n...\n\n## Sector Distribution\n\n| Sector | Count | % of Results |\n|--------|-------|--------------|\n| Technology | X | XX% |\n| Healthcare | X | XX% |\n| Financials | X | XX% |\n| Consumer | X | XX% |\n| Industrial | X | XX% |\n| Other | X | XX% |\n\n## Market Cap Distribution\n\n| Size | Count | % of Results |\n|------|-------|--------------|\n| Large Cap (>$10B) | X | XX% |\n| Mid Cap ($2-10B) | X | XX% |\n| Small Cap (<$2B) | X | XX% |\n\n## Key Observations\n\n1. **Sector Concentration**: {Observation about sector distribution}\n2. **Valuation Range**: {Observation about valuation spreads}\n3. **Quality Metrics**: {Observation about quality characteristics}\n4. **Technical Setup**: {Observation about technical patterns}\n\n## Watch List Recommendations\n\nBased on this screen, consider adding to watch list:\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason - e.g., \"Strong value with improving momentum\"}\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason}\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason}\n\n## Screening Notes\n\n⚠️ **Important Considerations**:\n- Screens are point-in-time and should be re-run regularly\n- Quantitative screens don''t capture qualitative factors\n- Results require further due diligence before investing\n- Past performance doesn''t guarantee future results\n\n---\n*Screen run on {Date} at {Time}*\n*Data as of {Data Date}*\n```\n\n## Custom Screening\n\nUsers can request custom criteria:\n\n**Example**: \"Screen for stocks with P/E under 20, ROE over 15%, and positive momentum\"\n\n**Response**: Apply custom filters and present results using standard format.\n\n### Common Custom Criteria\n- Market cap ranges\n- Sector/industry filters\n- Geographic filters\n- Index membership\n- Specific ratio thresholds\n- Technical conditions\n- Dividend requirements\n\n## Constraints\n- Use current market data (note staleness)\n- Results are for research, not recommendations\n- Quantitative screens have limitations\n- Note missing data for any stock\n- Screens should be re-run periodically\n- Do your own due diligence on results\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:20.977Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quantitative Analysis Agents needing advanced stock screening and selection capabilities based on multi-factor criteria.","zh":"非常适合需要高级股票筛选和选择功能的量化分析代理，基于多因素标准。","ja":"高度な株式のフィルタリングおよび選択機能を必要とする量化分析エージェントに最適です。マルチファクター基準に基づいています。","ko":"다요인 기준에 따라 고급 주식 스크리닝 및 선택 기능이 필요한 양적 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Cuantitativo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de filtrado y selección de acciones basadas en criterios multifactoriales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Quantitative ayant besoin de capacités avancées de sélection et de filtrage d''actions basées sur des critères multifactoriels.","de":"Perfekt für quantitative Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Aktienauswahl- und Filterfunktionen auf der Grundlage mehrerer Faktoren benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Quantitativa que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de filtragem e seleção de ações com base em critérios multifatoriais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов количественного анализа, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности скрининга и отбора акций на основе многокритериальных критериев.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلي الكمي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لفرز واختيار الأسهم بناءً على معايير متعددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to screen and select stocks using quantitative criteria such as value stock identification, growth stock discovery, and custom criteria screening, leveraging composite scoring and ranking through libraries like pandas and NumPy for data analysis.","zh":"赋予代理使用量化标准（如价值股识别、增长股发现和自定义标准筛选）筛选和选择股票的能力，利用pandas和NumPy等库的综合评分和排名进行数据分析。","ja":"エージェントに、価値株識別、成長株発見、カスタム基準のフィルタリングなどの量的基準を使用して株式をフィルタリングおよび選択する機能を提供します。pandasおよびNumPyなどのライブラリを使用したデータ分析のための複合スコアリングとランキングを活用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 정량적 기준(예: 가치 주식 식별, 성장 주식 발견, 사용자 정의 기준 필터링)을 사용하여 주식 필터링 및 선택 기능을 제공합니다. 데이터 분석을 위한 Pandas 및 NumPy와 같은 라이브러리의 복합 점수화 및 랭킹을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a filtrar y seleccionar acciones utilizando criterios cuantitativos como la identificación de acciones de valor, el descubrimiento de acciones de crecimiento y el filtrado de criterios personalizados, aprovechando la puntuación y clasificación compuestas a través de bibliotecas como pandas y NumPy para el análisis de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de sélectionner et de filtrer des actions en utilisant des critères quantitatifs tels que l''identification d''actions de valeur, la découverte d''actions de croissance et le filtrage de critères personnalisés, en exploitant le scoring et le classement composites via des bibliothèques comme pandas et NumPy pour l''analyse de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aktien mithilfe quantitativer Kriterien wie Wertpapieridentifizierung, Wachstumsaktienentdeckung und benutzerdefiniertem Kriterienfiltern auszuwählen und zu filtern, indem sie die komposite Bewertung und Rangliste durch Bibliotheken wie pandas und NumPy für Datenanalyse nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a filtrar e selecionar ações usando critérios quantitativos, como identificação de ações de valor, descoberta de ações de crescimento e filtragem de critérios personalizados, aproveitando a pontuação e classificação compostas por meio de bibliotecas como pandas e NumPy para análise de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью скрининга и отбора акций с использованием количественных критериев, таких как идентификация акций стоимости, обнаружение акций роста и скрининг пользовательских критериев, используя составные оценки и рейтинги через библиотеки, такие как pandas и NumPy для анализа данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرز واختيار الأسهم باستخدام معايير كمية مثل تحديد الأسهم القيمة واكتشاف أسهم النمو والفرز حسب معايير مخصصة، واستخدام التقييمات المركبة والترتيب من خلال مكتبات مثل pandas وNumPy للتحليل البياني"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating stock portfolio optimization using multi-factor stock screening","Generating high-growth stock recommendations based on momentum signal detection","Filtering quality companies for investment using dividend stock selection and custom criteria"],"zh":["使用多因素股票筛选自动化股票投资组合优化","基于动量信号检测生成高增长股票推荐","使用股息股票选择和自定义标准筛选高质量公司用于投资"],"ja":["マルチファクターの株式フィルタリングを使用して株式ポートフォリオの最適化を自動化する","モメンタム信号の検出に基づいて高成長株の推奨を行う","配当株の選択とカスタム基準のフィルタリングを使用して投資対象となる高品質会社をフィルタリングする"],"ko":["다요인 주식 필터링을 사용하여 주식 포트폴리오 최적화를 자동화하는 것","모멘텀 신호 감지에 기반하여 고성장 주식 추천을 생성하는 것","배당 주식 선택 및 사용자 정의 기준 필터링을 사용하여 투자에 적합한 고품질 회사 필터링하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización del portafolio de acciones mediante el filtrado de acciones multifactorial","Generación de recomendaciones de acciones de alto crecimiento basadas en la detección de señales de impulso","Filtrado de empresas de calidad para la inversión utilizando la selección de acciones de dividendos y criterios personalizados"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation du portefeuille d''actions à l''aide d''un filtrage d''actions multifactoriel","Génération de recommandations d''actions à forte croissance basées sur la détection de signaux de mouvement","Filtrage d''entreprises de qualité pour l''investissement en utilisant la sélection d''actions de dividendes et des critères personnalisés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Optimierung des Aktienportfolios unter Verwendung des multifaktoriellen Aktienfilterns","Erzeugung von Empfehlungen für hochwachsende Aktien auf der Grundlage der Erkennung von Impulssignalen","Filtern von Qualitätsunternehmen für Investitionen unter Verwendung der Dividendenaktienauswahl und benutzerdefinierter Kriterien"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização do portfólio de ações usando filtragem de ações multifatoriais","Gerar recomendações de ações de alto crescimento com base na detecção de sinais de momento","Filtrar empresas de qualidade para investimento usando seleção de ações de dividendos e critérios personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию портфеля акций с помощью многокритериального скрининга акций","Генерировать рекомендации по акциям с высоким ростом на основе обнаружения сигналов импульса","Фильтровать качественные компании для инвестиций с помощью отбора акций по дивидендам и пользовательских критериев"],"ar":["تحسين المحفظة من الأسهم تلقائيًا باستخدام فرز أسهم متعدد المعايير","توليد توصيات أسهم ذات نمو عالٍ بناءً على اكتشاف إشارات الزخم","فرز الشركات الجيدة للاستثمار باستخدام اختيار الأسهم القائمة على العوائد والمعايير المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires historical stock data access","Limited to quantitative analysis, excluding qualitative factors"],"zh":["需要历史股票数据访问","仅限于量化分析，排除定性因素"],"ja":["歴史的な株式データへのアクセスが必要","量化分析のみに限定され、定性的な要因は除外される"],"ko":["과거 주식 데이터 액세스가 필요함","양적 분석만으로 제한되며, 질적 요인은 제외됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos históricos de acciones","Limitado al análisis cuantitativo, excluyendo factores cualitativos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données historiques d''actions","Limité à l''analyse quantitative, excluant les facteurs qualitatifs"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf historische Aktiendaten","Begrenzt auf quantitative Analyse, qualitative Faktoren ausgeschlossen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados históricos de ações","Limitado à análise quantitativa, excluindo fatores qualitativos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к историческим данным об акциях","Ограничен количественным анализом, исключая качественные факторы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات الأسهم التاريخية","محدود بالتحليل الكمي، واستبعاد العوامل النوعية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"949bd99817959cc79d7fec00f5c9e245ca03908fdcdfd817f799bfa0dad7a13e","qualityScore":43}');
