tgreSQL para una gestión de datos eficiente","Arquitectura de software CQRS para una escalabilidad óptima"],"fr":["Application de boutique de livres en ligne avec backend d''événements","Frontend Blazor pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Orchestration avec Aspire pour une intégration sans problème","Compatibilité avec .NET Core pour une base de code stable","Prise en charge des bases de données PostgreSQL pour une gestion de données efficace","Architecture logicielle CQRS pour une scalabilité optimale"],"de":["Online-Buchladen-Anwendung mit Ereignis-Backend","Blazor-Frontend für eine flüssige Benutzeroberfläche","Orchestrierung mit Aspire für eine reibungslose Integration","Kompatibilität mit .NET Core für eine stabile Codebasis","Unterstützung für PostgreSQL-Datenbanken für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung","CQRS-Softwarearchitektur für eine optimale Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Arquitetura de event sourcing","Frontend Blazor","Backend API em .NET Core","Orquestração da Aspire","Suporte a PostgreSQL","Implementação com Marten"],"ru":["Архитектура event sourcing","Фронтенд Blazor","Бэкенд API на .NET Core","Оркестрация Aspire","Поддержка PostgreSQL","Реализация с Marten"],"ar":["هندسة مصدر الحدث","واجهة المستخدم Blazor","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات خلفية على .NET Core","تحكم Aspire","دعم PostgreSQL","تنفيذ مع Marten"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","前端调试","Full-stack .NET","事件源后端API","Blazor前端","Aspire","CQRS","事件源架构","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンドデバッグ","Full-stack .NET","イベントソースバックエンドAPI","Blazorフロントエンド","Aspire","CQRS","イベントソースアーキテクチャ","AIエージェントの使用方法","AIエージェントのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 디버깅","Full-stack .NET","이벤트 소스 백엔드 API","Blazor 프론트엔드","Aspire","CQRS","이벤트 소스 아키텍처","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 설치"],"es":["herramientas de depuración de frontend","cómo usar Blazor","qué es .NET Core","alternativas a Aspire","guía de instalación de .NET","configuración de PostgreSQL","arquitectura de software CQRS","desarrollo de aplicaciones web con .NET","depuración de aplicaciones web con Blazor"],"fr":["outils de débogage frontend","comment utiliser Blazor","quoi est .NET Core","alternatives à Aspire","guide d''installation de .NET","configuration de PostgreSQL","architecture logicielle CQRS","développement d''applications web avec .NET","débogage d''applications web avec Blazor"],"de":["Frontend-Debugging-Tools","wie man Blazor verwendet","was ist .NET Core","Alternativen zu Aspire",".NET-Installationsanleitung","PostgreSQL-Konfiguration","CQRS-Softwarearchitektur","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit .NET","Debuggen von Webanwendungen mit Blazor"],"pt":["como usar Blazor","o que é event sourcing","Aspire alternative","Blazor vs React","instalar .NET Core","guia de configuração da Aspire"],"ru":["как использовать Blazor","что такое event sourcing","алтернативы Aspire","Blazor vs React","установить .NET Core","руководство по настройке Aspire"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Blazor","ما هو مصدر الحدث","بديل Aspire","Blazor مقابل React","تثبيت .NET Core","دليل إعداد Aspire"]}},"owner":"aalmada","repo":"BookStore","repoPath":"aalmada/BookStore","stars":15,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T19:40:57Z","topics":["aspire","aspire-dotnet","blazor","cqrs","dotnet","dotnet-core","dotnetcore","event-sourcing","example","marten","postgres","wolverine"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend__debug_sse","description":"Debug Server-Sent Events (SSE) notification issues when real-time updates arent working. Use this when mutations dont trigger frontend updates.","bodyPreview":"Use this guide to troubleshoot Server-Sent Events (SSE) issues.\n\n## Quick Path (80% of issues)\n\n// turbo\n1. **Test SSE endpoint**:\n   ```bash\n   curl -N -H \"Accept: text/event-stream\" http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/stream\n   ```\n   Should see: `data: {\"type\":\"Connected\",...}`\n\n2. **Check ProjectionCommitListener** has case for your projection\n3. **Check QueryInvalidationService** maps notification to query keys\n4. **Check ReactiveQuery** uses matching `queryKeys`\n\nIf still broken, conti","body":"Use this guide to troubleshoot Server-Sent Events (SSE) issues.\n\n## Quick Path (80% of issues)\n\n// turbo\n1. **Test SSE endpoint**:\n   ```bash\n   curl -N -H \"Accept: text/event-stream\" http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/stream\n   ```\n   Should see: `data: {\"type\":\"Connected\",...}`\n\n2. **Check ProjectionCommitListener** has case for your projection\n3. **Check QueryInvalidationService** maps notification to query keys\n4. **Check ReactiveQuery** uses matching `queryKeys`\n\nIf still broken, continue to full debugging below.\n\n---\n\n## Symptoms\n\n- ✗ Frontend doesn''t update after mutation\n- ✗ `ReactiveQuery` doesn''t invalidate\n- ✗ SSE connection fails or disconnects\n- ✗ Events not received in browser\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**Prerequisites**:\n- `/aspire__start_solution` - Solution must be running to debug SSE\n\n**First Steps**:\n- `/test__verify_feature` - Run basic checks (build, tests) before deep debugging\n\n**Related Debugging**:\n- `/cache__debug_cache` - If issue seems cache-related instead of SSE\n- `/ops__doctor_check` - Check if environment setup is correct\n\n**After Fixing**:\n- `/test__verify_feature` - Confirm fix works\n- `/test__integration_scaffold` - Add tests to prevent regression\n\n## Debugging Steps\n\n### 1. Verify SSE Endpoint is Working\n\nTest the SSE endpoint directly:\n\n```bash\n# Terminal 1: Connect to SSE stream\ncurl -N -H \"Accept: text/event-stream\" http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/stream\n```\n\nYou should see:\n```\n: connected\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"Connected\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-15T20:00:00Z\"}\n```\n\n**If connection fails**:\n- ✗ Check API service is running\n- ✗ Verify `/api/notifications/stream` endpoint exists in `NotificationEndpoints.cs`\n- ✗ Check firewall/network issues\n\n### 2. Verify Notifications Are Defined\n\nCheck `src/Shared/BookStore.Shared/Notifications/DomainEventNotifications.cs`:\n\n```csharp\n// ✅ Correct - implements IDomainEventNotification\npublic record BookCreatedNotification(Guid Id, string Title) : IDomainEventNotification;\n\n// ✗ Wrong - missing interface\npublic record BookCreatedNotification(Guid Id, string Title);\n```\n\n**If notification is missing**:\n1. Create notification in `DomainEventNotifications.cs`\n2. Implement `IDomainEventNotification` interface\n3. Include all data needed for frontend invalidation\n\n### 3. Verify ProjectionCommitListener Configuration\n\nOpen `src/BookStore.ApiService/Infrastructure/MartenCommitListener.cs`:\n\n**Check if your projection has a handler**:\n\n```csharp\nprivate async Task ProcessDocumentChangeAsync(\n    IDocumentChange change,\n    CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n{\n    switch (change)\n    {\n        case BookProjection proj:\n            await HandleBookChangeAsync(proj, cancellationToken);\n            break;\n\n        // ❌ Missing: Your projection case\n        case AuthorProjection proj:\n            await HandleAuthorChangeAsync(proj, cancellationToken);\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Check if handler sends notification**:\n\n```csharp\nprivate async Task HandleBookChangeAsync(\n    BookProjection book,\n    CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n{\n    var notification = new BookUpdatedNotification(book.Id, book.Title);\n\n    // ✅ Correct - sends notification\n    await _notificationService.NotifyAsync(notification, cancellationToken);\n\n    // ✗ Wrong - forgot to send\n    // (no NotifyAsync call)\n}\n```\n\n**If handler is missing**:\n1. Add case for your projection\n2. Create handler method that calls `NotifyAsync`\n3. Use appropriate notification type\n\n### 4. Verify QueryInvalidationService Mapping\n\nOpen `src/Web/BookStore.Web/Services/QueryInvalidationService.cs`:\n\n**Check if notification maps to query keys**:\n\n```csharp\nIEnumerable<string> GetInvalidationKeys(IDomainEventNotification notification)\n{\n    switch (notification)\n    {\n        case BookCreatedNotification n:\n            yield return \"Books\";\n            yield return $\"Book:{n.EntityId}\";\n            break;\n        case BookUpdatedNotification n:\n            yield return \"Books\";\n            yield return $\"Book:{n.EntityId}\";\n            break;\n\n        // ❌ Missing: Your notification\n        case AuthorUpdatedNotification n:\n            yield return \"Authors\";\n            yield return $\"Author:{n.EntityId}\";\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**If mapping is missing**:\n1. Add case for your notification type\n2. Yield return query keys that should be invalidated\n3. Match keys used in `ReactiveQuery` setup\n\n### 5. Verify Frontend BookStoreEventsService\n\nCheck browser console for SSE connection:\n\n**In Chrome DevTools**:\n1. Open Network tab\n2. Look for \"events\" request (type: eventsource)\n3. Check status is \"pending\" (active connection)\n4. View \"EventStream\" tab to see events\n\n**If connection is closed**:\n- Check `BookStoreEventsService.StartListening()` is called in `OnInitializedAsync`\n- Verify base URL is correct\n- Check for JavaScript errors\n\n### 6. Verify ReactiveQuery Configuration\n\nCheck component using `ReactiveQuery`:\n\n```csharp\n// ✅ Correct - query keys match invalidation mapping\nbookQuery = new ReactiveQuery<PagedListDto<BookDto>>(\n    queryFn: FetchBooksAsync,\n    eventsService: BookStoreEventsService,\n    invalidationService: InvalidationService,\n    queryKeys: new[] { \"Books\" },  // Matches QueryInvalidationService\n    onStateChanged: StateHasChanged,\n    logger: Logger\n);\n\n// ✗ Wrong - query keys don''t match\nqueryKeys: new[] { \"AllBooks\" }  // Doesn''t match \"Books\"\n```\n\n**If query doesn''t invalidate**:\n1. Ensure `queryKeys` match `QueryInvalidationService` mapping\n2. Verify `BookStoreEventsService` is subscribed\n3. Check `onStateChanged` callback is provided\n\n### 7. Test End-to-End\n\nPerform a mutation and watch the flow:\n\n```bash\n# Terminal 1: Watch SSE stream\ncurl -N -H \"Accept: text/event-stream\" http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/stream\n\n# Terminal 2: Trigger mutation\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/books \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"title\":\"Test Book\",...}''\n```\n\n**Expected flow**:\n1. Command executed\n2. Event stored in Marten\n3. `ProjectionCommitListener` triggered\n4. Notification sent via SSE\n5. Browser receives event\n6. `QueryInvalidationService` maps to keys\n7. `ReactiveQuery` invalidates\n8. Query refetches\n9. UI updates\n\n**If any step fails**, locate where:\n- Check logs in Aspire dashboard\n- Add debug logging to `ProjectionCommitListener`\n- Use browser console to see received events\n\n## Common Issues & Fixes\n\n### Issue: Events Not Sent\n\n**Symptom**: ProjectionCommitListener not triggered\n\n**Fix**:\n- Ensure `ProjectionCommitListener` is registered in DI\n- Check Marten event store configuration\n- Verify projection lifecycle (`Inline` vs `Async`)\n\n### Issue: Wrong Event Type\n\n**Symptom**: Notification sent but frontend doesn''t invalidate\n\n**Fix**:\n```csharp\n// Check notification type name matches exactly\ncase \"BookUpdatedNotification\":  // ✅ Correct\ncase \"BookUpdated\":              // ✗ Wrong\n```\n\n### Issue: Multiple Tabs Don''t Update\n\n**Symptom**: Updates only visible in tab that made change\n\n**Fix**:\n- SSE works per-connection, each tab needs own connection\n- Each tab should call `BookStoreEventsService.StartListening()`\n- Verify SignalR isn''t being used (project uses SSE)\n\n### Issue: SSE Connection Drops\n\n**Symptom**: Connection works then stops\n\n**Fix**:\n- Check server-side timeout configuration\n- Verify no proxy/load balancer kills long connections\n- Add reconnection logic in `BookStoreEventsService`\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] SSE endpoint accessible at `/api/notifications/stream`\n- [ ] Notification class implements `IDomainEventNotification`\n- [ ] `ProjectionCommitListener` has handler for projection\n- [ ] Handler calls `NotifyAsync` with notification\n- [ ] `QueryInvalidationService` maps notification to keys\n- [ ] Frontend `ReactiveQuery` uses matching query keys\n- [ ] `BookStoreEventsService.StartListening()` called on mount\n- [ ] Browser DevTools shows active EventSource connection\n- [ ] End-to-end test confirms UI updates after mutation\n\n## Debugging Tools\n\n**Backend**:\n- Aspire Dashboard → Structured Logs → Filter by \"notification\"\n- Add logging in `ProjectionCommitListener`: `_logger.LogInformation(\"Sending {Type}\", notification.GetType().Name)`\n\n**Frontend**:\n- Browser Console → Look for EventSource logs\n- React DevTools → Check component re-renders\n- Network tab → Verify EventSource connection\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**First Steps**:\n- `/test__verify_feature` - Run basic checks (build, tests) before deep debugging\n\n**Related Debugging**:\n- `/cache__debug_cache` - If issue seems cache-related instead of SSE\n- `/ops__doctor_check` - Check if environment setup is correct\n\n**After Fixing**:\n- `/test__verify_feature` - Confirm fix works\n- `/test__integration_scaffold` - Add tests to prevent regression\n\n**See Also**:\n- [wolverine__create_operation](../wolverine__create_operation/SKILL.md) - SSE notification setup in ProjectionCommitListener\n- [frontend__feature_scaffold](../frontend__feature_scaffold/SKILL.md) - Frontend SSE integration\n- [real-time-notifications](../../../docs/guides/real-time-notifications.md) - SSE architecture and data flow\n- ApiService AGENTS.md - Backend notification patterns\n- Web AGENTS.md - Frontend SSE patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:33:50.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-stack Agents troubleshooting Server-Sent Events (SSE) issues in .NET applications with Blazor frontend and event-sourced backend API.","zh":"适用于全栈代理调试使用Blazor前端和事件源后端API的.NET应用程序中的Server-Sent Events (SSE)问题。","ja":"BlazorフロントエンドとイベントソースバックエンドAPIを使用する.NETアプリケーションのServer-Sent Events (SSE)問題のトラブルシューティングに適しています。","ko":"Blazor 프론트엔드와 이벤트 소스 백엔드 API를 사용하는 .NET 애플리케이션의 Server-Sent Events(SSE) 문제를 트러블슈팅하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de full-stack que solucionan problemas de Server-Sent Events (SSE) en aplicaciones .NET con interfaz de usuario Blazor y API de backend con eventos como fuente","fr":"Idéal pour les agents full-stack qui dépannent les problèmes de Server-Sent Events (SSE) dans les applications .NET avec une interface utilisateur Blazor et une API de backend à source d''événements","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die Server-Sent Events (SSE)-Probleme in .NET-Anwendungen mit Blazor-Frontend und ereignisquellengesteuerter Backend-API beheben","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-stack de resolução de problemas de Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) em aplicações .NET com frontend Blazor e API de backend baseada em eventos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полноценных агентов по устранению неполадок событий, отправляемых сервером (SSE), в приложениях .NET с фронтендом Blazor и бэкендом API на основе событий.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تام لتحليل أسباب أعطال الأحداث المرسلة من الخادم (SSE) في تطبيقات .NET مع واجهة المستخدم Blazor وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات الخلفية القائمة على الأحداث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug SSE issues by testing endpoints with curl, inspecting ProjectionCommitListener, and verifying QueryInvalidationService mappings, all while leveraging event-streaming and reactive query capabilities.","zh":"通过使用curl测试端点、检查ProjectionCommitListener和验证QueryInvalidationService映射来赋予代理调试SSE问题的能力，同时利用事件流和响应式查询功能。","ja":"curlでエンドポイントをテストし、ProjectionCommitListenerを検査し、QueryInvalidationServiceのマッピングを検証することで、SSEの問題をデバッグするエージェントをEmpower化し、イベントストリーミングとリアクティブクエリの機能を活用します。","ko":"curl로 엔드ポイント를 테스트하고 ProjectionCommitListener를 검사하고 QueryInvalidationService 매핑을 확인함으로써 SSE 문제를 디버깅할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하며 이벤트 스트리밍과 리액티브 쿼리 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar problemas de SSE probando puntos de conexión con curl, inspeccionando ProjectionCommitListener y verificando asignaciones de QueryInvalidationService, todo mientras aprovecha las capacidades de transmisión de eventos y consultas reactivas","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer les problèmes de SSE en testant les points de terminaison avec curl, en inspectant ProjectionCommitListener et en vérifiant les mappages de QueryInvalidationService, le tout en exploitant les capacités de diffusion d''événements et de requêtes réactives","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SSE-Probleme zu debuggen, indem Endpunkte mit curl getestet, ProjectionCommitListener untersucht und QueryInvalidationService-Zuordnungen überprüft werden, während die Möglichkeiten von Ereignisstreaming und reaktiven Abfragen genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar problemas de SSE testando endpoints com curl, inspecionando ProjectionCommitListener e verificando mapeamentos de QueryInvalidationService, tudo isso aproveitando as capacidades de transmissão de eventos e consulta reativa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отладки проблем с SSE, тестируя конечные точки с помощью curl, инспектируя ProjectionCommitListener и проверяя сопоставления QueryInvalidationService, все это при использовании возможностей потоковой передачи событий и реактивного запроса.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصحيح أعطال SSE من خلال اختبار النقاط النهائية باستخدام curl، وفحص ProjectionCommitListener، وตรวจ التحقق من مappings QueryInvalidationService، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من إمكانيات بث الأحداث والاستفسار التفاعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging Server-Sent Events connectivity","Validating ProjectionCommitListener configurations","Troubleshooting ReactiveQuery issues with query keys"],"zh":["调试Server-Sent Events连接性","验证ProjectionCommitListener配置","使用查询键调试ReactiveQuery问题"],"ja":["Server-Sent Eventsの接続性のデバッグ","ProjectionCommitListenerの設定の検証","クエリキーを使用したReactiveQueryの問題のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["Server-Sent Events 연결성 디버깅","ProjectionCommitListener 구성 검증","쿼리 키를 사용한 ReactiveQuery 문제 트러블슈팅"],"es":["Depuración de la conectividad de Server-Sent Events","Validación de configuraciones de ProjectionCommitListener","Solución de problemas de ReactiveQuery con claves de consulta"],"fr":["Débogage de la connectivité de Server-Sent Events","Validation des configurations de ProjectionCommitListener","Dépannage des problèmes de ReactiveQuery avec des clés de requête"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei der Konnektivität von Server-Sent Events","Validierung von ProjectionCommitListener-Konfigurationen","Behandlung von ReactiveQuery-Problemen mit Abfrage-Schlüsseln"],"pt":["Depuração da conectividade de Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor","Validação de configurações de ProjectionCommitListener","Solução de problemas de ReactiveQuery com chaves de consulta"],"ru":["Отладка подключения событий, отправляемых сервером","Валидация конфигураций ProjectionCommitListener","Устранение неполадок с ReactiveQuery с ключами запроса"],"ar":["تصحيح الأعطال في الاتصال بأحداث الخادم المرسلة","التحقق من صحة تكوينات ProjectionCommitListener","حل مشاكل ReactiveQuery مع مفاتيح الاستفسار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET and Blazor setup","Specific to Server-Sent Events (SSE) protocol","Needs access to event-sourced backend API"],"zh":[".NETとBlazor設定が必要","特定于Server-Sent Events (SSE)协议","需要访问事件源后端API"],"ja":[".NETとBlazorの設定が必要","Server-Sent Events (SSE)プロトコルに特有","イベントソースバックエンドAPIへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":[".NET과 Blazor 설정이 필요함","Server-Sent Events(SSE) 프로토콜에 특정됨","이벤트 소스 백엔드 API에 대한 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de .NET y Blazor","Específico del protocolo Server-Sent Events (SSE)","Necesita acceso a la API de backend con eventos como fuente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration .NET et Blazor","Spécifique au protocole Server-Sent Events (SSE)","Nécessite un accès à l''API de backend à source d''événements"],"de":["Benötigt .NET- und Blazor-Setup","Spezifisch für das Server-Sent Events (SSE)-Protokoll","Benötigt Zugriff auf die ereignisquellengesteuerte Backend-API"],"pt":["Exige configuração .NET e Blazor","Específico para protocolo de Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE)","Necessita acesso à API de backend baseada em eventos"],"ru":["Требует настройки .NET и Blazor","Специфичен для протокола событий, отправляемых сервером (SSE)","Требует доступа к бэкенд API на основе событий"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد .NET و Blazor","محدد لبروتوكول أحداث الخادم المرسلة (SSE)","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الخلفية القائمة على الأحداث"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e212838ed784d1a41dcc1880c73db777d7e5411a7098d132f5184aa0c396557","qualityScore":42}');
