as","Integração com Albopop 2.0","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento avançadas","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para facilitar o uso"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных решений ИИ","Интеграция с Albopop 2.0","Продвинутые инструменты разработки","Поддержка языков программирования như Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для упрощения использования"],"ar":["تطوير حلول ذكاء اصطناعي مخصصة","التكامل مع Albopop 2.0","أدوات تطوير متقدمة","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) لتسهيل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-explore","什么是Albopop 2.0","openspec-explore替代品","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-explore安装","openspec-explore设置指南","AI智能工具","Albopop 2.0开发"],"ja":["openspec-exploreの使い方","Albopop 2.0とは","openspec-exploreの代替","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-exploreのインストール","openspec-exploreの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Albopop 2.0開発"],"ko":["openspec-explore 사용법","Albopop 2.0是什么","openspec-explore 대체","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-explore 설치","openspec-explore 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","Albopop 2.0 개발"],"es":["cómo usar openspec-explore","qué es Albopop 2.0","alternativas a openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs otros herramientas de inteligencia artificial","instalación de openspec-explore","guía de configuración de openspec-explore","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Python y Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser openspec-explore","qu''est-ce que Albopop 2.0","alternatives à openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs autres outils d''intelligence artificielle","installation d''openspec-explore","guide de configuration d''openspec-explore","développement d''applications avec Python et Node.js"],"de":["wie man openspec-explore verwendet","was ist Albopop 2.0","alternativen zu openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs andere KI-Tools","installation von openspec-explore","konfigurationsanleitung für openspec-explore","entwicklung von anwendungen mit Python und Node.js"],"pt":["como usar openspec-explore","o que é openspec-explore","alternativas para openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs outras ferramentas de IA","instalar openspec-explore","guia de configuração do openspec-explore"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-explore","что такое openspec-explore","альтернативы openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs другие инструменты ИИ","установить openspec-explore","руководство по настройке openspec-explore"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-explore","ما هو openspec-explore","بديلات لopenspec-explore","openspec-explore مقابل أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أخرى","تثبيت openspec-explore","دليل إعداد openspec-explore"]}},"owner":"ondata","repo":"albopopTwoDotZero","repoPath":"ondata/albopopTwoDotZero","stars":9,"forks":16,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T12:58:25Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:22:09.967Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced exploratory analysis and open-specification artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级探索性分析和开放规格制品创建能力的AI代理。","ja":"高度な探索分析とオープン仕様アーティファクトの作成機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 탐색 분석 및 개방형 사양 아티팩트 생성 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un análisis exploratorio avanzado y capacidades de creación de artefactos de especificación abierta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une analyse exploratoire avancée et des capacités de création d''artefacts de spécification ouverte.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte exploratorische Analyse und Möglichkeiten zur Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de análise exploratória avançada e capacidades de criação de artefatos de especificação aberta.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутый исследовательский анализ и возможности создания артефактов с открытыми спецификациями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل استكشافي متقدم وقدرات إنشاء مستندات مواصفات مفتوحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, facilitating comprehensive content analysis and investigation of codebases, while creating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals, designs, and specs, all within a read-only explore mode that leverages file reading and code searching capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，促进全面内容分析和代码库的调查，同时在只读探索模式下创建像提案、设计和规格等OpenSpec制品，利用文件读取和代码搜索功能。","ja":"エージェントに深く考え、自由に視覚化する能力を与え、コードベースの調査や包括的なコンテンツ分析を促進し、読み取り専用の探索モードで提案、設計、仕様などのOpenSpecアーティファクトを作成し、ファイルの読み取りやコードの検索機能を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 코드베이스의 조사 및 포괄적인 내용 분석을 촉진하고, 읽기 전용 모드에서 제안, 설계, 사양 등 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성하며, 파일 읽기 및 코드 검색 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar profundamente y visualizar libremente, facilitando un análisis de contenido integral y la investigación de codebases, al tiempo que crea artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones, todo dentro de un modo de exploración de solo lectura que aprovecha las capacidades de lectura de archivos y búsqueda de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir en profondeur et de visualiser librement, facilitant une analyse de contenu globale et l''investigation de codebases, tout en créant des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications, le tout dans un mode d''exploration en lecture seule qui exploite les capacités de lecture de fichiers et de recherche de code.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, wodurch eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und die Untersuchung von Codebasen erleichtert wird, während OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen innerhalb eines schreibgeschützten Explorationsmodus erstellt werden, der Dateilese- und Codesuche-Funktionen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensarem profundamente e visualizarem livremente, facilitando uma análise abrangente de conteúdo e investigação de codebases, ao mesmo tempo em que cria artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, designs e especificações, tudo dentro de um modo de exploração somente leitura que aproveita as capacidades de leitura de arquivos e pesquisa de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко мыслить и свободно визуализировать, облегчая комплексный анализ контента и исследование кодовых баз, а также создание артефактов OpenSpec, таких как предложения, проекты и спецификации, все в режиме чтения, который использует возможности чтения файлов и поиска кода.","ar":"يمكن للعميل التفكير بعمق والتصور بحرية، ويسهم في تحليل شامل للمحتوى و調査 قواعد البيانات، مع création مستندات OpenSpec مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات، كل ذلك في وضع استكشاف للقراءة فقط الذي يعتمد على إمكانيات قراءة الملفات وعمليات البحث عن الكود."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases for potential improvements","Generating OpenSpec proposals for new features","Analyzing existing designs and specs for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["调查代码库以查找潜在的改进点","为新功能生成OpenSpec提案","分析现有的设计和规格以查找优化机会"],"ja":["潜在的な改善点のためのコードベースの調査","新機能のためのOpenSpec提案の生成","最適化の機会のための既存の設計と仕様の分析"],"ko":["潜在적인 개선 지점을 위한 코드베이스 조사","새로운 기능을 위한 OpenSpec 제안 생성","최적화 기회의ための 기존 설계 및 사양 분석"],"es":["Investigación de codebases para mejoras potenciales","Generación de propuestas OpenSpec para nuevas características","Análisis de diseños y especificaciones existentes para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Investigation de codebases pour améliorations potentielles","Génération de propositions OpenSpec pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Analyse de conceptions et de spécifications existantes pour des opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen für potenzielle Verbesserungen","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen für neue Funktionen","Analyse von bestehenden Entwürfen und Spezifikationen für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Investigação de codebases para melhorias potenciais","Geração de propostas OpenSpec para novos recursos","Análise de designs e especificações existentes para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Изучение кодовых баз для потенциальных улучшений","Генерация предложений OpenSpec для новых функций","Анализ существующих проектов и спецификаций для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["فحص قواعد البيانات للتحسينات المحتملة","إنتاج مقترحات OpenSpec للميزات الجديدة","تحليل التصاميم والمواصفات الحالية لفرص التحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires explicit user request to create OpenSpec artifacts"],"zh":["在探索模式下不得编写代码或实现功能","需要用户明确请求创建OpenSpec制品"],"ja":["探索モードでコードを書くことや機能を実装することはできない","OpenSpecアーティファクトの作成には明示的なユーザー要求が必要"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성하려면 명시적인 사용자 요청이 필요함"],"es":["No debe escribir código ni implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere una solicitud explícita del usuario para crear artefactos OpenSpec"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Requiert une demande explicite de l''utilisateur pour créer des artefacts OpenSpec"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Benötigt eine explizite Benutzeraufforderung zur Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer solicitação explícita do usuário para criar artefatos OpenSpec"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме изучения","Требует явного запроса пользователя для создания артефактов OpenSpec"],"ar":["لا ينبغي كتابه الشفرة أو تنفيذ الميزات في режим الاستكشاف","يتطلب طلبًا صريحًا من المستخدم لإنشاء مستندات OpenSpec"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"64ded43c11f45d9be10670202659bbbb81bb70e4fd67d3579ae31f1a1f693911","qualityScore":42}');
