"什么是Unicode规范化","euni-commands-guide替代品","euni-commands-guide安装","euni-commands-guide设置指南","Unicode规范化问题解决","Git仓库优化","CI运行器优化"],"ja":["euni-commands-guideの使用方法","Unicode正規化とは","euni-commands-guideの代替品","euni-commands-guideのインストール","euni-commands-guideの設定ガイド","Unicode正規化問題の解決","Gitリポジトリの最適化","CIランナーの最適化"],"ko":["euni-commands-guide 사용법","유니코드 규칙화란","euni-commands-guide 대체품","euni-commands-guide 설치","euni-commands-guide 설정 가이드","유니코드 규칙화 문제 해결","Git 저장소 최적화","CI 런너 최적화"],"es":["guía de comandos euni","normalización Unicode","diferencias de normalización Unicode","Agente de IA para desarrolladores","herramienta de línea de comandos","instalación de euni","configuración de euni","alternativas a euni"],"fr":["guide de commandes euni","normalisation Unicode","différences de normalisation Unicode","outil IA pour les développeurs","outil en ligne de commande","installation de euni","configuration de euni","alternatives à euni"],"de":["Euni-Kommando-Guide","Unicode-Normalisierung","Unterschiede in der Unicode-Normalisierung","KI-Tool für Entwickler","Kommandozeilen-Tool","Installation von euni","Konfiguration von euni","Alternativen zu euni"],"pt":["como usar euni-commands-guide","o que é normalização Unicode","ferramentas de IA para Git","euni-commands-guide vs outras ferramentas","instalar euni-commands-guide","guia de configuração do euni-commands-guide"],"ru":["как использовать euni-commands-guide","что такое нормализация Юникода","инструменты ИИ для Git","euni-commands-guide vs другие инструменты","установка euni-commands-guide","руководство по настройке euni-commands-guide"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة euni-commands-guide","ما هو تعديل يونيكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمستودعات جيت","أداة euni-commands-guide مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة euni-commands-guide","دليل إعداد أداة euni-commands-guide"]}},"owner":"takuto-tanaka-4digit","repo":"excel-unidiff-cli","repoPath":"takuto-tanaka-4digit/excel-unidiff-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:22:47Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"euni-commands-guide","description":"English runbook for euni command usage in local development and CI, including exit-code and UG-code troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# euni Commands (English)\n\nOperational playbook for `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`).\nGoal: decide quickly which command to run, in what order, and how to interpret results.\n\n## Command Map\n\n- `euni init-policy`\n  - Create `.euni.yml` template in `--repo`.\n- `euni check`\n  - Non-destructive check for policy drift + Unicode findings on tracked files.\n- `euni apply`\n  - Apply policy drift fixes via `git config --local` only.\n  - Use `--dry-run` before writing.\n  - Use `--repair-unicode-deletes` to res","body":"# euni Commands (English)\n\nOperational playbook for `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`).\nGoal: decide quickly which command to run, in what order, and how to interpret results.\n\n## Command Map\n\n- `euni init-policy`\n  - Create `.euni.yml` template in `--repo`.\n- `euni check`\n  - Non-destructive check for policy drift + Unicode findings on tracked files.\n- `euni apply`\n  - Apply policy drift fixes via `git config --local` only.\n  - Use `--dry-run` before writing.\n  - Use `--repair-unicode-deletes` to restore staged/worktree deleted tracked paths in `core.precomposeunicode=false` mode.\n  - The repair keeps staged non-delete changes (`worktree-only delete` is restored with `git restore --worktree`).\n  - Caution: this restores deleted tracked paths in scope; do not use when deletions are intentional.\n- `euni doctor`\n  - Combined diagnosis (`check` + scan-like Unicode analysis).\n- `euni scan`\n  - Unicode path analysis on tracked + untracked files (no policy input).\n- `euni version`\n  - Print `euni <version> (<commit>)`.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- Subcommand required; no standalone `help` command.\n- `--recursive` default is `false` (root repo only).\n- Write operations are only `apply` and `init-policy`.\n- `scan` does not accept `--policy`.\n- `version` accepts no options.\n- `--format` is `text` or `json` only.\n\n## Recommended Flows\n\n### 1) First-time setup\n\n```bash\neuni init-policy --repo .\neuni check --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\n```\n\n### 2) Drift remediation loop\n\n```bash\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml --dry-run\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\neuni check --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\n```\n\n### 3) Unicode phantom delete repair (one command)\n\n```bash\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml --repair-unicode-deletes\n```\n\n### 4) Hard-case diagnosis\n\n```bash\neuni doctor --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\neuni scan --repo . --recursive --format json\n```\n\n## CI Recipe (Deterministic Gate)\n\n```bash\neuni check \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --recursive \\\n  --policy ./.euni.yml \\\n  --non-interactive \\\n  --format json > euni-report.json\n```\n\nGate expectations:\n\n- Validate against `schema/euni-report.schema.json`.\n- Ensure process exit code matches `report.exitCode`.\n- Treat `exit 1` as findings (operational failure), `exit 2` as execution/runtime failure.\n- Upload `euni-report.json` as artifact.\n\nJSON contract:\n\n- `stdout`: exactly one JSON object.\n- `stderr`: logs/progress/error details.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `0`: no findings, no errors.\n- `1`: findings present.\n- `2`: execution error.\n\nPrecedence: if any execution error exists, exit is `2`.\n\n## UG Code Triage (Quick)\n\nCommon findings (`exit 1`):\n\n- `UG004`: config drift detected.\n- `UG005`: NFC collision detected.\n- `UG011`: combining mark in path.\n- `UG012`: non-standard FS entry (symlink/reparse/mount).\n- `UG013`: ambiguous policy path key (case-only collision).\n- `UG014`: unicode delete repair signal (dry-run plan or runtime safety skip).\n\nCommon execution errors (`exit 2`):\n\n- `UG001`: invalid/inaccessible `--repo`.\n- `UG002`: git command/runtime failure.\n- `UG003`: policy load failure.\n- `UG006`: submodule uninitialized/inaccessible.\n- `UG007`: invalid policy structure/unsupported keys.\n- `UG008`: `.euni.yml` exists without `--force`.\n- `UG009`: unsupported command/option usage.\n- `UG010`: gitdir/top-level outside `--repo` boundary.\n\n## Local Source Run Note\n\nWhen running via `go run`, non-zero app exits may appear as process exit `1` (Go tool wrapper behavior).\nFor strict `0/1/2` contract checks, build and run the binary directly:\n\n```bash\ngo build -o ./bin/euni ./cmd/euni\n./bin/euni check --repo . --policy ./.euni.yml\necho $?\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T14:52:49.796Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing Unicode normalization management across macOS, Linux, and Windows CI runners.","zh":"非常适合需要在macOS、Linux和Windows CI运行器上进行Unicode标准化管理的DevOps代理。","ja":"macOS、Linux、Windows CIランナー上でUnicode正規化管理が必要なDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"macOS, Linux, Windows CI 실행기에서 유니코드 정규화 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan administración de normalización de Unicode en ejecutores de CI de macOS, Linux y Windows.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de normalisation d''Unicode sur les exécuteurs de CI macOS, Linux et Windows.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine Verwaltung der Unicode-Normalisierung auf macOS-, Linux- und Windows-CI-Runnern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de normalização de Unicode em runners de CI do macOS, Linux e Windows.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым необходим управление нормализацией Unicode в средах выполнения CI macOS, Linux и Windows.","ar":"مثالي للموكلين DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تطبيع Unicode عبر تشغيل CI لنظام macOS و Linux و Windows."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect and fix Unicode normalization issues via Git diffs using the `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`) command-line tool, preventing phantom Excel file changes and ensuring consistent repository states by leveraging `euni init-policy`, `euni check`, and `euni apply` commands.","zh":"使代理能够通过Git差异和`excel-unidiff-cli`（`euni`）命令行工具检测和修复Unicode标准化问题，防止幻影Excel文件更改，并通过利用`euni init-policy`、`euni check`和`euni apply`命令确保一致的存储库状态。","ja":"エージェントがGitの差分と`excel-unidiff-cli`（`euni`）コマンドラインツールを使用してUnicode正規化の問題を検出および修正できるようにし、幻影的なExcelファイルの変更を防ぎ、`euni init-policy`、`euni check`、`euni apply`コマンドを利用して一貫したリポジトリ状態を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 차이점과 `excel-unidiff-cli`(`euni`) 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 유니코드 표준화 문제를 감지하고 수정할 수 있도록 하여幻影 Excel 파일 변경을 방지하고 `euni init-policy`, `euni check`, `euni apply` 명령을 활용하여 일관된 저장소 상태를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar y solucionar problemas de normalización de Unicode a través de diferencias de Git utilizando la herramienta de línea de comandos `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), evitando cambios de archivos de Excel fantasma y asegurando estados de repositorio coherentes mediante los comandos `euni init-policy`, `euni check` y `euni apply`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter et de corriger les problèmes de normalisation d''Unicode via des différences Git en utilisant l''outil de ligne de commande `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), empêchant les modifications de fichiers Excel fantômes et assurant des états de référentiel cohérents en utilisant les commandes `euni init-policy`, `euni check` et `euni apply`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Unicode-Normalisierungsprobleme über Git-Diffs mithilfe des Kommandozeilen-Tools `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`) zu erkennen und zu beheben, verhindert Phantom-Excel-Dateiänderungen und stellt konsistente Repository-Zustände sicher, indem es die Befehle `euni init-policy`, `euni check` und `euni apply` nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar e corrigir problemas de normalização de Unicode por meio de diffs do Git usando a ferramenta de linha de comando `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), prevenindo alterações fantasmagóricas de arquivos do Excel e garantindo estados de repositório consistentes aproveitando os comandos `euni init-policy`, `euni check` e `euni apply`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и исправлять проблемы нормализации Unicode с помощью diff Git, используя командную утилиту `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), предотвращая фантомные изменения файлов Excel и обеспечивая последовательное состояние репозиториев за счет команд `euni init-policy`, `euni check` и `euni apply`.","ar":"يمكن للموكلين اكتشاف ومعالجة مشاكل تطبيع Unicode من خلال DIFF Git باستخدام أداة سطر الأوامر `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`)، ومنع تغييرات الملفات المزيفة لبرنامج Excel وضمان حالات مستودع متسقة من خلال أوامر `euni init-policy` و `euni check` و `euni apply`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Unicode normalization checks for Git repositories and submodules","Debugging phantom Excel file changes across different operating systems","Applying policy drift fixes via `git config --local` for consistent repository management"],"zh":["自动化Git存储库和子模块的Unicode标准化检查","调试不同操作系统上的幻影Excel文件更改","通过`git config --local`应用策略漂移修复以实现一致的存储库管理"],"ja":["GitリポジトリとサブモジュールのUnicode正規化チェックを自動化する","異なるオペレーティングシステムでの幻影的なExcelファイルの変更をデバッグする","`git config --local`を使用してポリシードリフトの修正を適用し、一貫したリポジトリ管理を実現する"],"ko":["Git 저장소 및 서브모듈의 유니코드 표준화 확인 자동화","다양한 운영 체제에서幻影 Excel 파일 변경 디버깅","`git config --local`를 통해 정책漂移 수정 적용 및 일관된 저장소 관리"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones de normalización de Unicode para repositorios y submódulos de Git","Depuración de cambios de archivos de Excel fantasma en diferentes sistemas operativos","Aplicación de correcciones de desviación de políticas a través de `git config --local` para una administración de repositorios coherente"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de normalisation d''Unicode pour les référentiels et les sous-modules Git","Débogage des modifications de fichiers Excel fantômes sur différents systèmes d''exploitation","Application de corrections de dérive de politiques via `git config --local` pour une gestion de référentiel cohérente"],"de":["Automatisierung von Überprüfungen der Unicod