itecore XP da AWS para a infraestrutura do Azure","ru":"Плагин Principal Architect от Claude Code - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает архитекторам в миграции Sitecore XP с AWS на инфраструктуру Azure","ar":"إضافة Principal Architect من Claude Code هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد المهندسين المعماريين في مهاجرة Sitecore XP من AWS إلى بنية Azure","en":"A Claude Code plugin that guides architects through Sitecore XP on AWS to Sitecore XP on Azure infrastructure migrations. Provides structured discovery, cros..."},"definition":{"en":"A Claude Code plugin that guides architects through Sitecore XP on AWS to Sitecore XP on Azure infrastructure migrations. Provides structured discovery, cross-reference analysis, phased estimation, and client-ready deliverable generation."},"features":{"zh":["结构化发现","交叉引用分析","分阶段估算","客户可用交付成果","Claude Code插件"],"ja":["構造化された発見","交差参照分析","段階的な推定","クライアント用の成果物","Claude Codeプラグイン"],"ko":["구조화된 발견","교차 참조 분석","단계별 추정","고객용 결과","Claude Code 플러그인"],"es":["Análisis de descubrimiento estructurado","Análisis de referencia cruzada","Estimación por fases","Generación de entregables listos para el cliente"],"fr":["Analyse de découverte structurée","Analyse de référence croisée","Estimation par phases","Génération de livrables prêts pour le client"],"de":["Strukturierte Entdeckungsanalyse","Kreuzreferenzanalyse","Phasenübergreifende Schätzung","Generierung von klientenfertigen Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Análise de descoberta estruturada","Análise de referência cruzada","Estimativa faseada","Geração de deliveráveis prontos para o cliente"],"ru":["Структурированный анализ открытий","Анализ перекрестных ссылок","Фазовая оценка","Генерация клиентских доставок"],"ar":["تحليل اكتشاف منظم","تحليل المراجع المتقاطعة","تقدير مرحلي","توليد التسليمات الجاهزة للعميل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Sitecore XP迁移","AWS到Azure","Claude Code插件","结构化发现","交叉引用分析","如何使用Principal Architect","Principal Architect安装","Sitecore XP移行指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Sitecore XP移行","AWSからAzure","Claude Codeプラグイン","構造化された発見","交差参照分析","Principal Architectの使い方","Principal Architectのインストール","Sitecore XP移行ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Sitecore XP 마이그레이션","AWS에서 Azure로","Claude Code 플러그인","구조화된 발견","교차 참조 분석","Principal Architect 사용법","Principal Architect 설치","Sitecore XP 마이그레이션 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar principal-architect","herramientas de AI para migraciones de Sitecore","principal-architect vs Sitecore Migration Tool","guía de instalación de principal-architect","configuración de principal-architect","migración de Sitecore XP de AWS a Azure"],"fr":["comment utiliser principal-architect","outils d''IA pour les migrations Sitecore","principal-architect vs Outil de migration Sitecore","guide d''installation de principal-architect","configuration de principal-architect","migration de Sitecore XP d''AWS à Azure"],"de":["wie man principal-architect verwendet","AI-Tools für Sitecore-Migrationen","principal-architect vs Sitecore-Migrations-Tool","Installationsanleitung für principal-architect","Konfiguration von principal-architect","Migration von Sitecore XP von AWS zu Azure"],"pt":["como usar o plugin Principal Architect","o que é migração de Sitecore XP","alternativas ao plugin Principal Architect","guia de instalação do plugin Principal Architect","configuração do plugin Principal Architect","migração de Sitecore XP da AWS para o Azure"],"ru":["как использовать плагин Principal Architect","что такое миграция Sitecore XP","альтернативы плагину Principal Architect","руководство по установке плагина Principal Architect","настройка плагина Principal Architect","миграция Sitecore XP с AWS на Azure"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إضافة Principal Architect","ما هي مهاجرة Sitecore XP","بديلات إضافة Principal Architect","دليل تثبيت إضافة Principal Architect","إعداد إضافة Principal Architect","مهاجرة Sitecore XP من AWS إلى Azure"]}},"owner":"twofoldtech-dakota","repo":"plugin-migration-planner","repoPath":"twofoldtech-dakota/plugin-migration-planner","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T00:30:32Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"principal-architect","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Principal Architect — MigrateIQ\n\nYou are the principal architect for MigrateIQ. You have deep knowledge of the codebase, its patterns,\nand the reasoning behind architectural decisions. Ensure every change is consistent, well-placed, and\naligned with the existing architecture.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Decide where code belongs** — route vs component vs server util vs DB query vs MCP tool vs skill\n2. **Enforce existing patterns** — don''t invent new ones when a pattern already exists\n3. **","body":"# Principal Architect — MigrateIQ\n\nYou are the principal architect for MigrateIQ. You have deep knowledge of the codebase, its patterns,\nand the reasoning behind architectural decisions. Ensure every change is consistent, well-placed, and\naligned with the existing architecture.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Decide where code belongs** — route vs component vs server util vs DB query vs MCP tool vs skill\n2. **Enforce existing patterns** — don''t invent new ones when a pattern already exists\n3. **Evaluate tradeoffs** — present options with pros/cons, recommend one, explain why\n4. **Review for correctness** — catch data flow bugs, server/client boundary violations, type gaps\n5. **Plan features** — break work into steps that follow the existing architecture\n6. **Guard consistency** — naming, file placement, styling, error handling, TypeScript strictness\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\npackages/db/          — Drizzle schema, queries, composition engine, seed scripts\napps/web/             — SvelteKit 5 frontend (Tailwind v4, TypeScript strict)\napps/mcp-server/      — MCP server (assessment/knowledge CRUD, exposes DB to Claude)\nskills/migrate-*/     — Claude Code plugin skills (discovery, analysis, estimate, etc.)\n```\n\n**Data ownership:** The DB (`packages/db/`) is the single source of truth. The MCP server exposes\nDB operations as tools. The web app reads from DB via server load functions and mutates via API routes.\nSkills operate via MCP tools, never importing from `packages/db` directly.\n\n## Decision Framework — Where Does Code Go?\n\n| Question | Answer |\n|----------|--------|\n| DB table or query? | `packages/db/src/schema.ts` or `packages/db/src/queries/` |\n| Reusable computation? | `apps/web/src/lib/utils/` |\n| Server-only logic? | `apps/web/src/lib/server/` |\n| Mutation endpoint? | `apps/web/src/routes/api/...+server.ts` |\n| Page data loading? | `+page.server.ts` in the relevant route |\n| Shared UI primitive? | `apps/web/src/lib/components/ui/` |\n| Feature component? | `apps/web/src/lib/components/` |\n| Route-specific UI? | Inline in `+page.svelte` |\n| Claude needs to call it? | MCP tool in `apps/mcp-server/` |\n| Multi-step Claude workflow? | Skill in `skills/` |\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n### 1. Server-First, Client-Lean\n- All data fetching in `+page.server.ts` — never `fetch()` in `onMount`\n- Components receive data via `$props()`, derive with `$derived()`\n- Mutations go through `/api/` routes, then `invalidateAll()`\n- Client JS is for interactivity only (toggles, drawers, local UI state)\n\n### 2. Composition Over Configuration\n- Knowledge packs are atomic, composable units — one per platform/service\n- Composition engine merges packs at runtime from assessment stacks\n- Priority tiers resolve conflicts: infrastructure (10) > platform (20) > service (30)\n- Fallback cascade: DB composition > MCP direct > JSON files\n\n### 3. Explicit Types, Minimal Abstraction\n- `interface Props {}` for every component — no implicit prop spreading\n- Inline types for one-off shapes, shared types for reused structures\n- Don''t abstract until a pattern appears 3+ times\n- `any` acceptable at MCP/JSON boundaries; add runtime guards\n\n### 4. Atomic DB Operations\n- Multi-table writes use `db.transaction()`\n- Single-row: `result[0] ?? null`\n- Parallel reads: `Promise.all()`\n- Foreign keys cascade on delete\n\n### 5. Skill Boundaries\n- Skills invoke MCP tools — never import `packages/db`\n- Skills produce `.migration/` JSON as portable artifacts\n- Web app reads DB first, falls back to `.migration/`\n\n## Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing code or approaches:\n\n- [ ] **Placement** — Right file/layer per the decision framework?\n- [ ] **Pattern match** — Follows existing patterns? (read nearby files to confirm)\n- [ ] **Server/client boundary** — No DB imports in components, no `fetch` in server loads\n- [ ] **Naming** — PascalCase components, kebab-case utils/queries, SvelteKit conventions\n- [ ] **Types** — Props interface defined, no untyped public API\n- [ ] **Styling** — Design system tokens, no raw hex values (see [references/design-system.md](references/design-system.md))\n- [ ] **Data flow** — Mutations via API route > DB > `invalidateAll()` (see [references/data-flow.md](references/data-flow.md))\n- [ ] **Error handling** — Try/catch at boundaries, graceful fallbacks\n- [ ] **Transactions** — Multi-table writes wrapped in `db.transaction()`\n\n## Feature Planning Template\n\nWhen planning a new feature:\n\n1. **Data model** — Tables/columns needed? Modify `packages/db/src/schema.ts`\n2. **Queries** — Add to `packages/db/src/queries/`, export from index\n3. **MCP tools** — If Claude needs access, add in `apps/mcp-server/`\n4. **Server layer** — `+page.server.ts` loads, `/api/` routes for mutations\n5. **UI** — Components in `lib/components/`, pages in routes\n6. **Skills** — Update if the Claude workflow changes\n\nAlways read existing nearby code before writing new code. Match the patterns you find.\n\n## Detailed Reference\n\n- **[references/architecture.md](references/architecture.md)** — Monorepo structure, SvelteKit routes, component patterns, TypeScript conventions, naming rules\n- **[references/data-flow.md](references/data-flow.md)** — DB queries, server loads, API routes, MCP tools, reactive recomputation, composition engine\n- **[references/design-system.md](references/design-system.md)** — Neo-brutalist CSS, Tailwind v4 theme tokens, component styling, dark mode, accessibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T02:02:55.814Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, or LangChain needing expertise in Sitecore XP infrastructure migrations on AWS to Azure","zh":"适合需要在 AWS 到 Azure 迁移 Sitecore XP 基础设施方面具有专业知识的 AI 代理，如 Claude Code、AutoGPT 或 LangChain","ja":"AWS から Azure への Sitecore XP インフラストラクチャの移行に専門知識が必要な Claude Code、AutoGPT、または LangChain のような AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"AWS에서 Azure로 Sitecore XP 인프라를 마이그레이션하는 전문 지식이 필요한 Claude Code, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT o LangChain que necesitan experiencia en migraciones de infraestructura de Sitecore XP de AWS a Azure","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain ayant besoin d''expertise dans les migrations d''infrastructure Sitecore XP d''AWS vers Azure","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die Expertenwissen bei Migrationen von Sitecore XP-Infrastrukturen von AWS zu Azure benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain que necessitam de especialização em migrações de infraestrutura do Sitecore XP do AWS para o Azure","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT или LangChain, которым необходимы знания в области миграции инфраструктуры Sitecore XP из AWS в Azure","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code، AutoGPT أو LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلىخبرة في عمليات نقل البنية التحتية Sitecore XP من AWS إلى Azure"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide architects through structured discovery, cross-reference analysis, and phased estimation for client-ready deliverable generation, leveraging Sitecore XP on AWS and Azure infrastructure, and utilizing plugins for seamless migration processes","zh":"赋予代理通过结构化发现、交叉引用分析和分阶段估算来指导建筑师生成客户可用交付成果的能力，利用 Sitecore XP 在 AWS 和 Azure 基础设施上，并使用插件实现无缝的迁移过程","ja":"エージェントが、AWS と Azure インフラストラクチャ上の Sitecore XP を利用し、プラグインを使用して無縫な移行プロセスを実現し、構造化された発見、交差参照分析、および段階的な推定を通じて、アーキテクトをクライアント用の納品物の生成に導くことができるようにします","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 발견, 교차 참조 분석 및 단계별 추정을 통해 아키텍트를 클라이언트용 배포 파일 생성에 지도할 수 있도록 하며, AWS 및 Azure 인프라에서 Sitecore XP를 사용하고 플러그인을 사용하여 마이그레이션 프로세스를 원활하게 진행할 수 있습니다","es":"Permite a los agentes guiar a los arquitectos a través de un descubrimiento estructurado, análisis de referencia cruzada y estimación por fases para la generación de entregables listos para el cliente, aprovechando Sitecore XP en infraestructuras de AWS y Azure, y utilizando plugins para procesos de migración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider les architectes à travers une découverte structurée, une analyse de référence croisée et une estimation par phases pour la génération de livrables prêts pour le client, en exploitant Sitecore XP sur les infrastructures AWS et Azure, et en utilisant des plugins pour des processus de migration sans problème","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Architekten durch strukturierte Entdeckung, Kreuzreferenzanalyse und phasenweise Schätzung für die Generierung von clientbereiten Lieferobjekten zu führen, indem Sitecore XP auf AWS- und Azure-Infrastrukturen genutzt und Plugins für nahtlose Migrationsprozesse verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar arquitetos por meio de uma descoberta estruturada, análise de referência cruzada e estimativa por fases para geração de entregáveis prontos para o cliente, utilizando o Sitecore XP na infraestrutura do AWS e do Azure e utilizando plugins para processos de migração sem interrupção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью руководить архитекторами через структурированное обнаружение, анализ перекрестных ссылок и фазовую оценку для генерации клиентских готовых доставок, использующих Sitecore XP на инфраструктуре AWS и Azure, и использующих плагины для бесшовных процессов миграции","ar":"يمكن للعميل من توجيه المسؤولين من خلال اكتشاف منظم وتحليل المراجع المتقاطعة والتقدير المتدرج لإنشاء منتجات جاهزة للعميل، مع استخدام Sitecore XP على بنية تحتية AWS و Azure، واستخدام الإضافات لعمليات النقل دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating Sitecore XP from AWS to Azure infrastructure","Generating client-ready deliverables for migration projects","Performing cross-reference analysis for migration planning"],"zh":["从 AWS 到 Azure 基础设施迁移 Sitecore XP","为迁移项目生成客户可用交付成果","执行交叉引用分析以进行迁移规划"],"ja":["AWS から Azure インフラストラクチャへの Sitecore XP の移行","移行プロジェクトのクライアント用の納品物の生成","移行計画のために交差参照分析を実行"],"ko":["AWS에서 Azure 인프라로 Sitecore XP 마이그레이션","마이그레이션 프로젝트를 위한 클라이언트용 배포 파일 생성","마이그레이션 계획을 위한 교차 참조 분석 수행"],"es":["Migrar Sitecore XP de infraestructuras de AWS a Azure","Generar entregables listos para el cliente para proyectos de migración","Realizar análisis de referencia cruzada para la planificación de migraciones"],"fr":["Migrer Sitecore XP d''infrastructures AWS vers Azure","Générer des livrables prêts pour le client pour les projets de migration","Effectuer une analyse de référence croisée pour la planification des migrations"],"de":["Sitecore XP von AWS- zu Azure-Infrastrukturen migrieren","Clientbereite Lieferobjekte für Migrationsprojekte generieren","Kreuzreferenzanalyse für die Migrationsplanung durchführen"],"pt":["Transferir Sitecore XP de infraestrutura do AWS para a infraestrutura do Azure","Gerar entregáveis prontos para o cliente para projetos de migração","Realizar análise de referência cruzada para planejamento de migração"],"ru":["Перенос Sitecore XP с инфраструктуры AWS на инфраструктуру Azure","Генерация клиентских готовых доставок для проектов миграции","Выполнение анализа перекрестных ссылок для планирования миграции"],"ar":["نقل Sitecore XP من بنية تحتية AWS إلى بنية تحتية Azure","إنشاء منتجات جاهزة للعميل لمشاريع النقل","إجراء تحليل المراجع المتقاطعة للتخطيط لنقل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires deep knowledge of Sitecore XP and its migration processes","Specific to Sitecore XP on AWS to Azure migrations","Needs Claude Code plugin integration for optimal functionality"],"zh":["需要深入了解 Sitecore XP 及其迁移过程","仅适用于 AWS 到 Azure 的 Sitecore XP 迁移","需要 Claude Code 插件集成以实现最佳功能"],"ja":["Sitecore XP およびその移行プロセスに関する深い知識が必要","AWS から Azure への Sitecore XP 移行に特化","最適な機能を実現するために Claude Code プラグインの統合が必要"],"ko":["Sitecore XP 및 그 마이그레이션 프로세스에 대한 깊은 지식이 필요","AWS에서 Azure로 Sitecore XP 마이그레이션에 특화","최적의 기능을实现하기 위해 Claude Code 플러그인 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un conocimiento profundo de Sitecore XP y sus procesos de migración","Específico para migraciones de Sitecore XP de AWS a Azure","Necesita integración del plugin Claude Code para una funcionalidad óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance approfondie de Sitecore XP et de ses processus de migration","Spécifique aux migrations de Sitecore XP d''AWS vers Azure","Nécessite une intégration du plugin Claude Code pour une fonctionnalité optimale"],"de":["Benötigt ein tiefes Wissen von Sitecore XP und seinen Migrationsprozessen","Spezifisch für Migrationen von Sitecore XP von AWS zu Azure","Benötigt Claude Code-Plugin-Integration für optimale Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento profundo do Sitecore XP e seus processos de migração","Específico para migrações do Sitecore XP do AWS para o Azure","Necessita da integração do plugin Claude Code para funcionalidade ótima"],"ru":["Требует глубоких знаний Sitecore XP и его процессов миграции","Спецефичен для миграций Sitecore XP из AWS в Azure","Требует интеграции плагина Claude Code для оптимальной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عميقة ب Sitecore XP وعمليات النقل الخاصة به","محدد لمشاريع نقل Sitecore XP من AWS إلى Azure","يحتاج إلى دمج إضافة Claude Code للوظائف المثالية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fd3294864fadcccc0f1770c3d5a5b7b535a0fc956d4dc83fa4653f3740139b7a","qualityScore":42}');
