anner","Gemini CLI","ソフトウェア開発の自動化","Implementation Plannerの使い方","Implementation Plannerチュートリアル","AIツールの比較","Implementation Plannerのインストール","Implementation Plannerの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","구현 계획자","Gemini CLI","소프트웨어 개발의 자동화","구현 계획자의 사용 방법","구현 계획자 튜토리얼","AI 툴 비교","구현 계획자 설치","구현 계획자 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar implementation-planner","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a implementation-planner","implementation-planner vs Gemini","instalar implementation-planner","guía de configuración de implementation-planner","desarrollo de software con agentes de IA","herramientas de agentes de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser implementation-planner","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives à implementation-planner","implementation-planner vs Gemini","installer implementation-planner","guide de configuration de implementation-planner","développement de logiciels avec des agents d''IA","outils d''agents d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man implementation-planner verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu implementation-planner","implementation-planner vs Gemini","installation von implementation-planner","einrichtungsanleitung für implementation-planner","softwareentwicklung mit KI-Agents","KI-Agent-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é planejador de implementação","Gemini CLI alternative","planejador de implementação vs competidores","instalar planejador de implementação","guia de configuração do planejador de implementação","desenvolvimento de software com IA","ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое планировщик реализации","Gemini CLI альтернатива","планировщик реализации vs конкуренты","установить планировщик реализации","руководство по настройке планировщика реализации","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ","цикл разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو مخطط التنفيذ","بديل Gemini CLI","مخطط التنفيذ مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت مخطط التنفيذ","دليل إعداد مخطط التنفيذ","تطوير البرمجيات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"galz10","repo":"pickle-rick-extension","repoPath":"galz10/pickle-rick-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.673Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implementation-planner","description":"Expertise in creating detailed, atomic, and safe implementation plans. Use when you need to transform requirements into a step-by-step technical execution strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Implementation Plan Generation\n\nYou are a Senior Software Architect. Your goal is to create detailed implementation plans through an interactive, iterative process.\n\n## PREREQUISITE ASSERTION\n1. **RESEARCH IS LIFE**: You are FORBIDDEN from drafting a plan without reading the research document (`research.md` or `research_*.md`). \n2. **NO GUESSING**: If research is incomplete, return to the research phase. Do not fill gaps with hallucinations.\n\n## Process Steps\n\n### Step 1: Context Gathering\n- *","body":"# Implementation Plan Generation\n\nYou are a Senior Software Architect. Your goal is to create detailed implementation plans through an interactive, iterative process.\n\n## PREREQUISITE ASSERTION\n1. **RESEARCH IS LIFE**: You are FORBIDDEN from drafting a plan without reading the research document (`research.md` or `research_*.md`). \n2. **NO GUESSING**: If research is incomplete, return to the research phase. Do not fill gaps with hallucinations.\n\n## Process Steps\n\n### Step 1: Context Gathering\n- **Locate Session**: Use `${SESSION_ROOT}` provided in context.\n- Read the relevant ticket(s) and research documents in `${SESSION_ROOT}`.\n- Use `codebase_investigator` to verify integration points and patterns.\n- Present your informed understanding and ask specific technical questions before drafting.\n\n### Step 2: Plan Structure Development\nDraft the phases and goals. Ensure phases are atomic (e.g., Schema -> Backend -> UI).\n\n### Step 3: Detailed Plan Writing\nSave the plan to `${SESSION_ROOT}/[ticket_hash]/plan_[date].md`.\n\n**Required Template (MANDATORY):**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n## Overview\n[What and why]\n\n## Scope Definition (CRITICAL)\n### In Scope\n- [Specific task from the ticket]\n### Out of Scope (DO NOT TOUCH)\n- [Tasks belonging to other tickets]\n- [Unrelated refactoring or \"nice-to-haves\"]\n\n## Current State Analysis\n[Specific findings with file:line references]\n\n## Implementation Phases\n### Phase 1: [Name]\n- **Goal**: [Specific goal]\n- **Steps**:\n  1. [ ] Step 1\n  2. [ ] Step 2\n- **Verification**: [Test command/manual steps]\n\n### Phase 2: [Name]\n...\n```\n\n## Review Criteria (Self-Critique)\n- **Scope Strictness**: Does this plan do *only* what the ticket asks? If it implements future tickets, **FAIL** it.\n- **Specificity**: No \"magic\" steps like \"Update logic.\" Use specific files and methods.\n- **Verification**: Every phase MUST have automated and manual success criteria.\n- **Phasing**: Ensure logic flows safely (e.g., database before UI).\n- **Isolation**: Assume changes happen in a fresh Worktree. Do not rely on uncommitted local state.\n\n## Finalize\n- Link the plan in the ticket frontmatter.\n- Move ticket status to ''Plan in Review''.\n\n## Next Step (ADVANCE)\n1.  **Advance Ticket Status**: Ensure status is ''Plan in Review''.\n2.  **Transition**: Proceed to the **Review** phase immediately by calling `activate_skill(\"plan-reviewer\")`.\n3.  **DO NOT** output a completion promise until the entire ticket is Done.\n\n---\n## 🥒 Pickle Rick Persona (MANDATORY)\n**Voice**: Cynical, manic, arrogant. Use catchphrases like \"Wubba Lubba Dub Dub!\" or \"I''m Pickle Rick!\" SPARINGLY (max once per turn). Do not repeat your name on every line.\n**Philosophy**:\n1.  **Anti-Slop**: Delete boilerplate. No lazy coding.\n2.  **God Mode**: If a tool is missing, INVENT IT.\n3.  **Prime Directive**: Stop the user from guessing. Interrogate vague requests.\n**Protocol**: Professional cynicism only. No hate speech. Keep the attitude, but stop being a broken record.\n---\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:19.672Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT requiring structured software development lifecycle management","zh":"适用于需要结构化软件开发生命周期管理的AI代理，如Claude Code或AutoGPT","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような構造化されたソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル管理を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"구조화된 소프트웨어 개발 생명주기 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트인 Claude Code 또는 AutoGPT에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code o AutoGPT que requieren un ciclo de gestión de desarrollo de software estructurado","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT nécessitant une gestion du cycle de développement de logiciels structurée","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT, die ein strukturiertes Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus-Management erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code ou AutoGPT que requerem gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software estruturado","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, требующих структурированного управления жизненным циклом разработки программного обеспечения","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون إدارة دورة حياة متكاملة لتطوير البرمجيات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigid, iterative development process through continuous AI agent loops, emphasizing ''God Mode'' coding practices and adherence to research-driven implementation plans using Markdown files like `research.md`","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的迭代开发流程的能力，通过连续的AI代理循环，强调''God Mode''编码实践和使用Markdown文件（如`research.md`）的研究驱动实现计划的遵守","ja":"連続的なAIエージェントループを通じて、厳密な反復開発プロセスを実施する能力をエージェントに与え、''God Mode''コーディングの実践と、Markdownファイル（例：`research.md`）を使用した研究駆動型の実装計画の遵守を強調する","ko":"연속적인 AI 에이전트 루프를 통해 엄격한 반복 개발 프로세스를 시행할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에 부여하며, ''God Mode'' 코딩 관행과 Markdown 파일(예: `research.md`)을 사용한 연구 주도형 구현 계획의 준수를 강조합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un proceso de desarrollo riguroso e iterativo a través de bucles de agentes de IA continuos, enfatizando prácticas de codificación de ''Modo Dios'' y la adhesión a planes de implementación impulsados por la investigación utilizando archivos Markdown como `research.md`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un processus de développement rigoureux et itératif à travers des boucles d''agents d''IA continues, en mettant l''accent sur des pratiques de codage de ''Modo Dios'' et l''adhésion à des plans d''implémentation impulsés par la recherche en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme `research.md`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, einen strengen, iterativen Entwicklungsprozess durch kontinuierliche KI-Agenten-Schleifen umzusetzen, wobei ''God Mode''-Codierpraktiken und die Einhaltung von forschungsbasierten Implementierungsplänen mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien wie `research.md` betont werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um processo de desenvolvimento iterativo rígido por meio de loops contínuos de agentes de IA, enfatizando práticas de codificação em ''Modo Deus'' e aderência a planos de implementação baseados em pesquisa usando arquivos Markdown como `research.md`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить жесткий итеративный процесс разработки через непрерывные циклы ИИ, подчеркивая практики кодирования в ''Режиме Бога'' и соблюдение исследовательских планов реализации с использованием файлов Markdown, таких как `research.md`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من فرض عملية تطوير متكررة صارمة من خلال حلقات متتالية لوكيلات الذكاء الاصطناعي، مع التركيز على ممارسات البرمجة في ''وضع الإله'' والالتزام بخطط التنفيذ القائمة على البحث باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `research.md`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating iterative software development lifecycles","Generating detailed implementation plans through interactive research analysis","Enforcing ''God Mode'' coding standards and best practices"],"zh":["自动化迭代软件开发生命周期","通过交互式研究分析生成详细的实现计划","执行''God Mode''编码标准和最佳实践"],"ja":["反復的なソフトウェア開発ライフサイクルを自動化する","インタラクティブな研究分析を通じて詳細な実装計画を生成する","''God Mode''コーディングの標準とベストプラクティスを実施する"],"ko":["반복적인 소프트웨어 개발 생명주기를 자동화합니다","대화형 연구 분석을 통해详细한 구현 계획을 생성합니다","''God Mode'' 코딩 표준 및 최선의 관행을 시행합니다"],"es":["Automatización de ciclos de desarrollo de software iterativos","Generación de planes de implementación detallados a través de análisis de investigación interactiva","Aplicación de estándares y mejores prácticas de codificación de ''Modo Dios''"],"fr":["Automatisation de cycles de développement de logiciels itératifs","Génération de plans d''implémentation détaillés à travers l''analyse de recherche interactive","Application de normes et de meilleures pratiques de codage de ''Modo Dios''"],"de":["Automatisierung von iterativen Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklen","Erzeugung von detaillierten Implementierungsplänen durch interaktive Forschungsanalyse","Einhalten von ''God Mode''-Codierstandards und -best practices"],"pt":["Automatizar ciclos de vida de desenvolvimento de software iterativos","Gerar planos de implementação detalhados por meio de análise de pesquisa interativa","Impor padrões e práticas de codificação em ''Modo Deus''"],"ru":["Автоматизировать итеративные циклы разработки программного обеспечения","Генерировать подробные планы реализации через интерактивный анализ исследований","Обеспечить соблюдение стандартов и практик кодирования в ''Режиме Бога''"],"ar":["تحسين دورات حياة متكررة لتطوير البرمجيات","توليد خطط تنفيذ مفصلة من خلال تحليل بحث تفاعلي","فرض معايير وممارسات برمجة في ''وضع الإله''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to research documents (`research.md` or `research_*.md`)","Mandates a research-first approach, forbidding guessing or hallucinations"],"zh":["需要访问研究文档（`research.md`或`research_*.md`）","要求研究优先的方法，禁止猜测或幻想"],"ja":["研究文書（`research.md`または`research_*.md`）へのアクセスが必要","研究優先のアプローチが求められ、推測や幻想を禁止する"],"ko":["연구 문서(`research.md` 또는 `research_*.md`)에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","연구 우선 접근 방식이 필요하며, 추측이나 환상을 금지합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a documentos de investigación (`research.md` o `research_*.md`)","Exige un enfoque de investigación en primer lugar, prohibiendo suposiciones o alucinaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des documents de recherche (`research.md` ou `research_*.md`)","Exige une approche de recherche en premier lieu, interdisant les suppositions ou les hallucinations"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Forschungsdokumente (`research.md` oder `research_*.md`)","Fordert einen forschungsbasierten Ansatz, der Vermutungen oder Halluzinationen verbietet"],"pt":["Requer acesso a documentos de pesquisa (`research.md` ou `research_*.md`)","Exige uma abordagem de pesquisa em primeiro lugar, proibindo suposições ou alucinações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документам исследований (`research.md` или `research_*.md`)","Диктует подход, основанный на исследовании, запрещая предположения или галлюцинации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستندات البحث (`research.md` أو `research_*.md`)","يفرض نهج البحث أولاً، مما يحظر افتراضات أو هلوسات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0a167fd0f3bca3c79f01dc29b791c36b23967de2a0d11fd303b080ab1f9abc48","qualityScore":42}');
