 habilidades","Plantillas y ejemplos de código para empezar","Flujos de trabajo personalizables para tu proyecto","Integración con tecnologías como React y Node.js"],"fr":["Outils de développement d''agents IA","Guides et tutoriels pour améliorer vos compétences","Modèles et exemples de code pour commencer","Workflows personnalisables pour votre projet","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js"],"de":["KI-Agents-Entwicklungstools","Anleitungen und Tutorien, um Ihre Fähigkeiten zu verbessern","Vorlagen und Codebeispiele, um loszulegen","Anpassbare Workflows für Ihr Projekt","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Pilha de desenvolvimento opinada para agente de IA","Ferramentas e guias para criar projetos de sucesso","Fluxos de trabalho personalizados para atender às necessidades do seu projeto","Integração com tecnologias de inteligência artificial","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","CLI para facilitar a execução de comandos e tarefas"],"ru":["Опинированная стека разработки для ИИ Агентов","Инструменты и руководства для создания успешных проектов","Пользовательские рабочие процессы для удовлетворения потребностей вашего проекта","Интеграция с технологиями искусственного интеллекта","Поддержка языков программирования, таких как Python и Node.js","CLI для упрощения выполнения команд и задач"],"ar":["حزمة تطوير متميزة لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات ودلائل لإنشاء مشاريع ناجحة","عمليات مخصصة لتناسب احتياجات مشروعك","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","CLI لتسهيل تشغيل الأوامر والمهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","ground栈","AI开发工具","如何使用ground栈","AI智能代理开发指南","ground栈安装","ground栈设置指南","AI智能代理开发最佳实践"],"ja":["AIエージェント","groundスタック","AI開発ツール","groundスタックの使い方","AIエージェント開発ガイド","groundスタックのインストール","groundスタックの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ground 스택","AI 개발 툴","ground 스택 사용법","AI 에이전트 개발 가이드","ground 스택 설치","ground 스택 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발 베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["desarrollo de agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","guías de desarrollo de IA","alternativas a Ground","Ground vs otros frameworks de IA","instalación de Ground","configuración de Ground","uso de React con Ground","uso de Node.js con Ground"],"fr":["développement d''agents IA","outils IA","guides de développement IA","alternatives à Ground","Ground vs autres frameworks IA","installation de Ground","configuration de Ground","utilisation de React avec Ground","utilisation de Node.js avec Ground"],"de":["KI-Agents-Entwicklung","KI-Tools","KI-Entwicklungsguides","Alternativen zu Ground","Ground vs andere KI-Frameworks","Installation von Ground","Konfiguration von Ground","Verwendung von React mit Ground","Verwendung von Node.js mit Ground"],"pt":["agente de IA","desenvolvimento de agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","guias de agente de IA","como criar um agente de IA","o que é um agente de IA","agente de IA vs chatbot","instalação de agente de IA","configuração de agente de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агент","разработка ИИ Агентов","инструменты ИИ Агентов","руководства ИИ Агентов","как создать ИИ Агента","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент vs чат-бот","установка ИИ Агента","настройка ИИ Агента"],"ar":["وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دلائل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية إنشاء وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي vs بوت المحادثة","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Mburdo","repo":"knowledge_and_vibes","repoPath":"Mburdo/knowledge_and_vibes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.680Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ground","description":"Verify external libraries, APIs, and frameworks against current documentation. Use when implementing external dependencies, when unsure if a pattern is current, when the user mentions ground, verify docs, exa, or current API.","bodyPreview":"# Ground — External Documentation\n\nVerify external dependencies against current documentation before implementation. Direct execution.\n\n> **Design rationale:** This skill executes directly rather than spawning subagents because grounding is a simple query + verification sequence (~300 tokens), not substantial analytical work. Per Lita research: \"Simple agents achieve 97% of complex system performance with 15x less code.\"\n\n## When This Applies\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| About to w","body":"# Ground — External Documentation\n\nVerify external dependencies against current documentation before implementation. Direct execution.\n\n> **Design rationale:** This skill executes directly rather than spawning subagents because grounding is a simple query + verification sequence (~300 tokens), not substantial analytical work. Per Lita research: \"Simple agents achieve 97% of complex system performance with 15x less code.\"\n\n## When This Applies\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| About to write `import` for external lib | Ground first |\n| Using API/SDK methods | Verify current syntax |\n| Framework-specific patterns | Check version compatibility |\n| Auth/security code | Always verify current best practices |\n| User says \"ground\" or \"verify\" | Run full grounding check |\n| New library or major version | Deep grounding |\n\n**Default: When uncertain about external APIs, ground.**\n\n---\n\n## Tool Reference\n\n### Exa MCP Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `web_search_exa(query)` | General documentation search |\n| `get_code_context_exa(query)` | Code examples from GitHub/tutorials |\n| `crawling(url)` | Extract content from specific URLs |\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhere does truth live?\n\nEXTERNAL DOCS ──► /ground (this skill)\n                 \"What''s the current API for X?\"\n\nCODEBASE ───────► /explore (warp-grep)\n                 \"How does X work in our code?\"\n\nHISTORY ────────► /recall (cm + cass)\n                 \"How did we do this before?\"\n\nTASKS ──────────► bv --robot-*\n                 \"What should I work on?\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Execution Flow\n\nExecute these steps directly. No subagents needed.\n\n### Step 1: Identify What Needs Grounding\n\nCategories that need verification:\n\n| Category | Why | Risk |\n|----------|-----|------|\n| **Imports/Initialization** | Syntax changes between versions | High |\n| **API Methods** | Methods get renamed/deprecated | High |\n| **Configuration** | Options/flags evolve | Medium |\n| **Async Patterns** | Async APIs vary significantly | Medium |\n| **Auth/Security** | Security best practices change | Critical |\n| **Data Validation** | Validators/schemas evolve | Medium |\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Construct Query\n\n**Formula:**\n```\n{library_name} {specific_feature} {version_if_known} 2024 2025\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nFastAPI Pydantic v2 model_validator 2024 2025\nNext.js 14 app router server components\nReact useOptimistic hook 2024\nPrisma findMany where clause 2024\n```\n\n**Strengthening queries:**\n- Add version number if known\n- Add year for recency (2024, 2025)\n- Add \"official\" or \"docs\" for authoritative sources\n- Add \"migration\" if moving between versions\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Execute Search\n\n**For documentation:**\n```python\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\")\n```\n\n**For code examples:**\n```python\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\n```\n\n**For specific page:**\n```python\ncrawling(\"{url}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Verify Results\n\n| Criterion | Pass If |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Source** | Official docs or reputable repo |\n| **Freshness** | Updated within 12 months |\n| **Version** | Matches your dependency |\n| **Completeness** | Full import + usage pattern |\n| **Status** | Not deprecated |\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Record Grounding Status\n\nTrack in your work:\n\n```markdown\n## Grounding Status\n| Pattern | Query | Source | Status |\n|---------|-------|--------|--------|\n| `@model_validator` | \"Pydantic v2 2024\" | docs.pydantic.dev | ✅ Verified |\n| `useOptimistic` | \"React 19 2024\" | react.dev | ✅ Verified |\n```\n\n**Status values:**\n- ✅ Verified — Matches current docs\n- ⚠️ Changed — API changed, updated approach\n- ❌ Deprecated — Found alternative\n- ❓ Unverified — Couldn''t confirm, flagged\n\n---\n\n## Query Patterns\n\n### Current API Documentation\n```\n\"{library} {method} documentation 2024\"\n\"{library} {feature} API reference\"\n\"{library} official docs {feature}\"\n```\n\n### Migration Between Versions\n```\n\"{library} v{old} to v{new} migration\"\n\"{library} {version} breaking changes\"\n\"{library} upgrade guide {version}\"\n```\n\n### Code Examples\n```python\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {use_case} tutorial\")\n```\n\n### Security/Auth Patterns\n```\n\"{auth_method} best practices 2024\"\n\"{library} authentication {pattern} security\"\n\"OAuth PKCE {language} 2024\"\n```\n\n### Error Resolution\n```\n\"{library} {error_message} fix\"\n\"{library} {error_type} troubleshooting\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Grounding Depth Levels\n\n| Depth | When | What to Check |\n|-------|------|---------------|\n| **Quick** | Familiar pattern, just confirming | One query, verify method exists |\n| **Standard** | Normal implementation | Query + check for deprecation warnings |\n| **Deep** | Security/auth, new library, major version | Multiple queries, read changelog, check issues |\n\n---\n\n## Version Sensitivity Signals\n\nGround more carefully when you see:\n\n| Signal | Risk |\n|--------|------|\n| Major version in deps (v1 → v2) | Breaking changes likely |\n| Library < 2 years old | API still evolving |\n| \"experimental\" or \"beta\" in docs | May change without notice |\n| Security-related code | Best practices evolve |\n| AI training data gap | Libs released after training cutoff |\n\n---\n\n## Failure Handling\n\n| Issue | Response |\n|-------|----------|\n| No results | Broaden query, try alternate terms |\n| Conflicting info | Official docs > GitHub > tutorials |\n| Only outdated info | Mark ❓, proceed with caution, add TODO |\n| Can''t verify | Flag for human review |\n\n---\n\n## Query Anti-Patterns\n\n| Bad Query | Problem | Better Query |\n|-----------|---------|--------------|\n| `\"how to use {library}\"` | Too vague | `\"{library} {specific_feature} 2024\"` |\n| `\"{library} tutorial\"` | May be outdated | `\"{library} {feature} official docs\"` |\n| `\"best {library}\"` | Opinion, not docs | `\"{library} {pattern} documentation\"` |\n| `\"{library}\"` alone | No specificity | Add feature + version + year |\n\n---\n\n## Query Strengthening\n\nIf initial query returns poor results:\n\n1. **Add version**: `\"React 19 useOptimistic\"` vs `\"React useOptimistic\"`\n2. **Add year**: `\"FastAPI middleware 2024\"` vs `\"FastAPI middleware\"`\n3. **Add \"official\"**: `\"Next.js official docs app router\"`\n4. **Be more specific**: `\"Prisma findMany where clause\"` vs `\"Prisma queries\"`\n5. **Try alternate terms**: `\"authentication\"` vs `\"auth\"` vs `\"login\"`\n\n---\n\n## Progressive Grounding\n\nFor large implementations:\n\n1. **Start**: Ground the core imports/setup\n2. **As you go**: Ground each new external method before using\n3. **Before commit**: Review grounding table, verify nothing ❓\n\nDon''t try to ground everything upfront — ground just-in-time as you encounter external deps.\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Workflow\n\n### Before implementing (via /advance)\n```python\n# Check external dependencies\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} 2024\")\n```\n\n### During implementation\n```python\n# Just-in-time verification\nget_code_context_exa(\"{specific_method} example\")\n```\n\n### Before commit\nReview grounding table, ensure all ❓ are resolved or documented.\n\n---\n\n## Requirements\n\nRequires Exa API key configured:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add exa -s user \\\n  -e EXA_API_KEY=your-key \\\n  -- npx -y @anthropic-labs/exa-mcp-server\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```python\n# Documentation search\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\")\n\n# Code examples\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\n\n# Specific page\ncrawling(\"{url}\")\n```\n\n**Query formula:**\n```\n{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Why | Do Instead |\n|-------|-----|------------|\n| Skip grounding for external APIs | Training data may be stale | Ground before using |\n| Use tutorials over docs | Tutorials get outdated | Prefer official docs |\n| Ignore version mismatches | Breaking changes exist | Verify version compatibility |\n| Ground everything upfront | Wastes time | Ground just-in-time |\n| Skip grounding for \"familiar\" libs | APIs change | Quick verify is still worth it |\n\n---\n\n## See Also\n\n- `/recall` — Past session patterns\n- `/explore` — Codebase search\n- `/advance` — Bead workflow (includes grounding step)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:31.693Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing external dependency verification and documentation validation.","zh":"非常适合需要外部依赖验证和文档验证的AI代理。","ja":"外部依存関係の検証とドキュメントのバリデーションが必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"외부 종속성 검증 및 문서 유효성 검사가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan verificación de dependencias externas y validación de documentación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA nécessitant une vérification de dépendances externes et une validation de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine Überprüfung externer Abhängigkeiten und eine Validierung der Dokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de verificação de dependência externa e validação de documentação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется проверка внешних зависимостей и проверка документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من الاعتماد الخارجيและการ التحقق من الوثائق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify external dependencies against current documentation using direct execution, ensuring accuracy and consistency in query + verification sequences, leveraging ~300 tokens for efficient analysis.","zh":"使代理能够使用直接执行验证外部依赖项与当前文档，确保查询 + 验证序列的准确性和一致性，利用 ~300 个令牌进行高效分析。","ja":"エージェントが直接実行を使用して外部依存関係を現在のドキュメントに対して検証できるようにし、クエリ + 検証シーケンスの精度と一貫性を保証し、約 300 トークンを使用して効率的な分析を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 직접 실행을 사용하여 외부 종속성을 현재 문서와 비교하여 검증할 수 있도록 하여 쿼리 + 검증 시퀀스의 정확성과 일관성을 보장하며, 약 300개의 토큰을 사용하여 효율적인 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar las dependencias externas frente a la documentación actual utilizando la ejecución directa, asegurando la precisión y la coherencia en las secuencias de consulta y verificación, aprovechando ~300 tokens para un análisis eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les dépendances externes par rapport à la documentation actuelle en utilisant l''exécution directe, en garantissant l''exactitude et la cohérence dans les séquences de requête et de vérification, en exploitant ~300 jetons pour une analyse efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, externe Abhängigkeiten gegen die aktuelle Dokumentation mit direkter Ausführung zu überprüfen, wodurch Genauigkeit und Konsistenz in Abfrage- und Verifizierungssequenzen sichergestellt werden, indem ~300 Token für eine effiziente Analyse genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar dependências externas contra a documentação atual usando execução direta, garantindo precisão e consistência nas sequências de consulta + verificação, aproveitando ~300 tokens para análise eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять внешние зависимости против текущей документации с помощью прямого выполнения, гарантируя точность и последовательность в последовательностях запроса + проверки, используя ~300 токенов для эффективного анализа.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من الاعتماد الخارجي ضد الوثائق الحالية باستخدام التنفيذ المباشر، مما يضمن الدقة والاتساق في تسلسلات الاستعلام + التحقق، مستفيدا من ~300 رمز للتحليل الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating external documentation","Verifying dependencies before implementation","Ensuring consistency in query sequences"],"zh":["验证外部文档","在实施前验证依赖项","确保查询序列的一致性"],"ja":["外部ドキュメントの検証","実装前の依存関係の検証","クエリシーケンスの一貫性の確保"],"ko":["외부 문서의 유효성 검사","구현 전 종속성 검증","쿼리 시퀀스의 일관성 보장"],"es":["Validar la documentación externa","Verificar las dependencias antes de la implementación","Asegurar la coherencia en las secuencias de consulta"],"fr":["Valider la documentation externe","Vérifier les dépendances avant la mise en œuvre","Assurer la cohérence dans les séquences de requête"],"de":["Externe Dokumentation validieren","Abhängigkeiten vor der Implementierung überprüfen","Konsistenz in Abfrage-Sequenzen sicherstellen"],"pt":["Validação de documentação externa","Verificação de dependências antes da implementação","Garantia de consistência nas sequências de consulta"],"ru":["Проверка внешней документации","Проверка зависимостей перед реализацией","Обеспечение последовательности в последовательностях запросов"],"ar":["التحقق من الوثائق الخارجية","التحقق من الاعتماد قبل التنفيذ","ضمان الاتساق في تسلسلات الاستعلام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Simple query + verification sequence only","Not suitable for substantial analytical work","Direct execution may have performance implications"],"zh":["仅支持简单的查询 + 验证序列","不适合进行大量的分析工作","直接执行可能会对性能产生影响"],"ja":["シンプルなクエリ + 検証シーケンスのみをサポート","大量の分析作業には不適切","直接実行はパフォーマンスに影響を与える可能性がある"],"ko":["단순한 쿼리 + 검증 시퀀스만 지원","大量의 분석 작업에는 부적합","직접 실행은 성능에 영향을 줄 수 있음"],"es":["Secuencia de consulta y verificación simple solamente","No es adecuado para un trabajo analítico sustancial","La ejecución directa puede tener implicaciones de rendimiento"],"fr":["Seule une séquence de requête et de vérification simple","Pas adapté pour un travail d''analyse substantiel","L''exécution directe peut avoir des implications de performances"],"de":["Nur einfache Abfrage- und Verifizierungssequenz","Nicht geeignet für umfangreiche analytische Arbeiten","Die direkte Ausführung kann Performance-Auswirkungen haben"],"pt":["Apenas sequência de consulta + verificação simples","Não é adequado para trabalhos analíticos substanciais","A execução direta pode ter implicações de desempenho"],"ru":["Только простая последовательность запроса + проверки","Не подходит для существенной аналитической работы","Прямое выполнение может иметь последствия для производительности"],"ar":["تسلسل استعلام + التحقق البسيط فقط","لا يصلح للعمل التحليلي المهم","التنفيذ المباشر قد يكون له آثار على الأداء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7505c36375062c9690e4fb215374357f0bba39f5d210123fa68fe7afc53a59cf","qualityScore":42}');
