veloppeurs"],"de":["HTTP-Client für Anfragen und Antworten","CLI für die Ausführung von Befehlen und Skripten","MCP für die Verwaltung von Prozessen und Aufgaben","Integration mit anderen Tools und Technologien von Lightdash","Dokumentation und Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Suporte a HTTP client","Integração com CLI","Recursos de MCP","Desenvolvimento avançado com Lightdash","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento personalizadas"],"ru":["Поддержка HTTP-клиента","Интеграция с CLI","Возможности MCP","Расширенное развитие с помощью Lightdash","Настройка инструментов разработки"],"ar":["دعم العميل HTTP","التكامل مع CLI","ميزات MCP","التطوير المتقدم باستخدام Lightdash","أدوات التطوير المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-explore","什么是Lightdash工具","openspec-explore替代品","Lightdash工具箱安装","openspec-explore设置指南","AI工具openspec-explore"],"ja":["openspec-exploreの使い方","Lightdashツールとは","openspec-exploreの代替","Lightdashツールボックスのインストール","openspec-exploreの設定ガイド","AIエージェントopenspec-explore"],"ko":["openspec-explore 사용법","라이트대시 도구란","openspec-explore 대체품","라이트대시 도구박스의 설치","openspec-explore 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 openspec-explore"],"es":["cómo usar Lightdash","qué es openspec-explore","alternativas a Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","instalar Lightdash","guía de configuración de Lightdash","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Lightdash"],"fr":["comment utiliser Lightdash","qu''est-ce que openspec-explore","alternatives à Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","installer Lightdash","guide de configuration de Lightdash","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","développement d''applications avec Lightdash"],"de":["wie man Lightdash verwendet","was ist openspec-explore","Alternativen zu Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","Lightdash installieren","Konfigurationsanleitung für Lightdash","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Anwendungsentwicklung mit Lightdash"],"pt":["como usar openspec-explore","o que é openspec-explore","alternativas para Lightdash","Lightdash vs openspec-explore","instalar openspec-explore","guia de configuração do openspec-explore","desenvolvimento com Lightdash","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de AI"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-explore","что такое openspec-explore","альтернативы Lightdash","Lightdash vs openspec-explore","установка openspec-explore","руководство по настройке openspec-explore","разработка с помощью Lightdash","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-explore","ما هو openspec-explore","بديلات Lightdash","Lightdash مقابل openspec-explore","تثبيت openspec-explore","دليل إعداد openspec-explore","التطوير باستخدام Lightdash","أدوات التطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"yu-iskw","repo":"lightdash-tools","repoPath":"yu-iskw/lightdash-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.686Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if th","body":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n\n```bash\ncd docs && openspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type               | Where to Capture             |\n   | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed        | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made       | `design.md`                  |\n   | Scope changed              | `proposal.md`                |\n   | New work identified        | `tasks.md`                   |\n   | Assumption invalidated     | Relevant artifact            |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:26:30.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing advanced exploratory analysis and OpenSpec artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适合如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code等AI代理，需要高级探索性分析和OpenSpec工件创建能力的场景。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、高度な探索分析とOpenSpecアーティファクトの作成機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 고급 탐색 분석 및 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan análisis exploratorio avanzado y capacidades de creación de artefactos OpenSpec.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code nécessitant une analyse exploratoire avancée et des capacités de création d''artefacts OpenSpec.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die erweiterte explorative Analyse- und OpenSpec-Artifact-Erstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de análise exploratória avançada e capacidades de criação de artefatos OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которые требуют продвинутого эксплораторного анализа и возможностей создания артефактов OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى تحليل استكشافي متقدم وقدرات إنشاء مستندات OpenSpec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deeply explore and visualize codebases using HTTP clients, CLI, and MCP tools, facilitating the creation of OpenSpec proposals, designs, and specs without implementing code changes, leveraging protocols like HTTP and file formats for investigation.","zh":"赋予代理深入探索和可视化代码库的能力，使用HTTP客户端、CLI和MCP工具，促进OpenSpec提案、设计和规格的创建，而无需实施代码更改，利用HTTP和文件格式等协议进行调查。","ja":"エージェントに、HTTPクライアント、CLI、およびMCPツールを使用してコードベースを深く探索および視覚化する能力を与え、コードの変更を実装せずにOpenSpecの提案、設計、および仕様を生成することを容易にし、HTTPやファイル形式などのプロトコルを使用して調査します。","ko":"에이전트에게 HTTP 클라이언트, CLI 및 MCP 도구를 사용하여 코드베이스를 깊이探색하고 시각화하는 능력을 부여하며, 코드 변경을 구현하지 않고 OpenSpec 제안, 설계 및 사양을 생성하며, HTTP 및 파일 형식 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 조사합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes explorar y visualizar profundamente las bases de código utilizando clientes HTTP, CLI y herramientas MCP, facilitando la creación de propuestas, diseños y especificaciones OpenSpec sin implementar cambios de código, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y formatos de archivo para la investigación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer et de visualiser en profondeur les bases de code à l''aide de clients HTTP, CLI et d''outils MCP, facilitant la création de propositions, de conceptions et de spécifications OpenSpec sans implémenter de modifications de code, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTP et des formats de fichiers pour l''investigation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Codebasen mithilfe von HTTP-Clients, CLI und MCP-Tools tief zu erkunden und zu visualisieren, wodurch die Erstellung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen, -Entwürfen und -Spezifikationen ohne die Implementierung von Codeänderungen erleichtert wird, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und Dateiformate für die Untersuchung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar profundamente e visualizar repositórios de código usando clientes HTTP, CLI e ferramentas MCP, facilitando a criação de propostas, projetos e especificações OpenSpec sem implementar alterações de código, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e formatos de arquivo para investigação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко исследовать и визуализировать кодовые базы с помощью HTTP-клиентов, CLI и инструментов MCP, облегчая создание предложений, проектов и спецификаций OpenSpec без реализации изменений кода, используя протоколы, такие как HTTP, и форматы файлов для расследования.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استكشاف глубوك وتصور مخازن الشفرة باستخدام عملاء HTTP و CLI وأدوات MCP، وتسهيل إنشاء مقترحات وتصاميم ومواصفات OpenSpec دون تنفيذ تغييرات الشفرة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وشكلات الملفات للتحقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebase structures","Generating OpenSpec artifacts for proposal and design documentation","Exploring Lightdash tool integrations for comprehensive analysis"],"zh":["调查代码库结构","为提案和设计文档生成OpenSpec工件","探索Lightdash工具集成以进行综合分析"],"ja":["コードベースの構造を調査する","提案と設計文書のためのOpenSpecアーティファクトを生成する","包括的な分析のためのLightdashツールの統合を探索する"],"ko":["코드베이스 구조 조사","제안 및 설계 문서를 위한 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성","포괄적인 분석을 위한 Lightdash 도구 통합 탐색"],"es":["Investigación de estructuras de base de código","Generación de artefactos OpenSpec para la documentación de propuestas y diseños","Exploración de integraciones de herramientas Lightdash para un análisis integral"],"fr":["Investigation des structures de base de code","Génération d''artefacts OpenSpec pour la documentation des propositions et conceptions","Exploration des intégrations d''outils Lightdash pour une analyse complète"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen-Strukturen","Erzeugung von OpenSpec-Artifacten für Vorschlags- und Entwurfsdokumentation","Erkundung von Lightdash-Tool-Integrationen für eine umfassende Analyse"],"pt":["Investigação de estruturas de repositórios de código","Geração de artefatos OpenSpec para documentação de propostas e projetos","Exploração de integrações de ferramentas Lightdash para análise abrangente"],"ru":["Изучение структур кодовой базы","Генерация артефактов OpenSpec для документации предложений и проектов","Изучение интеграций инструментов Lightdash для всестороннего анализа"],"ar":["تحقيق هيكل مخازن الشفرة","إنشاء مستندات OpenSpec لمستندات المقترحات والتصاميم","استكشاف دمج أدوات Lightdash للتحليل الشامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires exit from explore mode to implement changes","Limited to reading files, searching code, and investigating the codebase"],"zh":["探索模式下不能编写代码或实现功能","需要退出探索模式才能实施更改","仅限于读取文件、搜索代码和调查代码库"],"ja":["探索モードではコードを書いたり機能を実装したりできない","変更を実装するには探索モードを終了する必要がある","ファイルの読み取り、コードの検索、コードベースの調査のみに限定される"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","변경 사항을 구현하려면 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함","파일 읽기, 코드 검색 및 코드베이스 조사만 허용"],"es":["No debe escribir código ni implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere la salida del modo de exploración para implementar cambios","Limitado a la lectura de archivos, búsqueda de código e investigación de la base de código"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter de fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite la sortie du mode d''exploration pour implémenter des modifications","Limité à la lecture de fichiers, à la recherche de code et à l''investigation de la base de code"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Erfordert den Ausstieg aus dem Explorationsmodus, um Änderungen zu implementieren","Begrenzt auf das Lesen von Dateien, die Suche nach Code und die Untersuchung der Codebasis"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer saída do modo de exploração para implementar alterações","Limitado à leitura de arquivos, busca de código e investigação do repositório de código"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требует выхода из режима исследования для реализации изменений","Ограничен чтением файлов, поиском кода и исследованием кодовой базы"],"ar":["لا ينبغي书 كود أو تنفيذ ميزات في режим الاستكشاف","يتطلب الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف لتنفيذ التغييرات","محدود بالقراءة من الملفات و البحث عن الشفرة و التحقيق في مخزن الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"37cb96a8ba4c1f65d3a79e3a2636f1367325e7dbc815e9519c2c5d46d346ce15","qualityScore":42}');
