","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: angular-signals","en":"angular-signals"},"description":{"zh":"Angular Signaling AI工具，用于构建高性能Angular应用","ja":"Angular Signals AIエージェント，用于构建高性能Angular应用","ko":"Angular Signaling AI 에이전트，用于构建高性能Angular应用","es":"Angular-signals es un monorepo de nx con ejemplos de codificación de plastikaweb utilizando Angular, @ngrx, Tailwind y Material","fr":"Angular-signals est un monorepo nx avec des exemples de codage de plastikaweb utilisant Angular, @ngrx, Tailwind et Material","de":"Angular-signals ist ein nx-Monorepo mit Beispielen für die Kodierung von plastikaweb unter Verwendung von Angular, @ngrx, Tailwind und Material","pt":"O angular-signals é um monorepo nx que fornece exemplos de codificação plastikaweb usando Angular, @ngrx, tailwind e material.","ru":"Angular-signals - это nx-монорепо, который предоставляет примеры кодирования plastikaweb с использованием Angular, @ngrx, tailwind и material.","ar":"angular-signals هو monorepo nx يوفر أمثلة من kodierung plastikaweb باستخدام Angular، @ngrx، tailwind و material.","en":"An nx monorepo with examples of plastikaweb coding using Angular, @ngrx, tailwind and material https://deepwiki.com/plastikaweb/plastikspace"},"definition":{"en":"An nx monorepo with examples of plastikaweb coding using Angular, @ngrx, tailwind and material https://deepwiki.com/plastikaweb/plastikspace"},"features":{"zh":["Angular Signaling AI工具","用于构建高性能Angular应用","支持@ngrx和tailwind","支持Material设计"],"ja":["Angular Signals AIエージェント","用于构建高性能Angular应用","支持@ngrx和tailwind","支持Material设计"],"ko":["Angular Signaling AI 에이전트","用于构建高性能Angular应用","支持@ngrx와 tailwind","支持Material 디자인"],"es":["Ejemplos de codificación de plastikaweb con Angular","Integración con @ngrx para la gestión de estado","Diseño con Tailwind y Material","Monorepo de nx para una mejor organización","Compatibilidad con la última versión de Angular"],"fr":["Exemples de codage de plastikaweb avec Angular","Intégration avec @ngrx pour la gestion d''état","Conception avec Tailwind et Material","Monorepo de nx pour une meilleure organisation","Compatibilité avec la dernière version d''Angular"],"de":["Kodierbeispiele für plastikaweb mit Angular","Integration mit @ngrx für die Zustandsverwaltung","Design mit Tailwind und Material","Monorepo von nx für eine bessere Organisation","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten Version von Angular"],"pt":["Exemplos de codificação plastikaweb com Angular","Integração com @ngrx","Estilização com tailwind","Componentes de material","Monorepo nx para gerenciamento de código"],"ru":["Примеры кодирования plastikaweb с использованием Angular","Интеграция с @ngrx","Стилизация с помощью tailwind","Компоненты material","Nx-монорепо для управления кодом"],"ar":["أمثلة من kodierung plastikaweb باستخدام Angular","التكامل مع @ngrx","التنسيق باستخدام tailwind","مكونات material","monorepo nx لإدارة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI工具"],"ja":["Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI工具"],"ko":["Angular Signaling AI 에이전트","Angular Signals AI에이전트","Angular Signaling AI 에이전트","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar angular-signals","qué es angular-signals","alternativas a angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","instalación de angular-signals","guía de configuración de angular-signals","desarrollo de aplicaciones con angular-signals"],"fr":["comment utiliser angular-signals","quoi est angular-signals","alternatives à angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","installation d''angular-signals","guide de configuration d''angular-signals","développement d''applications avec angular-signals"],"de":["wie man angular-signals verwendet","was ist angular-signals","alternativen zu angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","installation von angular-signals","konfigurationsanleitung für angular-signals","entwicklung von anwendungen mit angular-signals"],"pt":["como usar angular-signals","o que é plastikaweb","angular-signals vs outros monorepos","instalar angular-signals","guia de configuração do angular-signals","exemplos de codificação com Angular","integração com @ngrx","estilização com tailwind"],"ru":["как использовать angular-signals","что такое plastikaweb","angular-signals vs другие моноре포","установить angular-signals","руководство по настройке angular-signals","примеры кодирования с использованием Angular","интеграция с @ngrx","стилизация с помощью tailwind"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام angular-signals","ما هو plastikaweb","angular-signals مقابل مونوريبو الأخرى","تثبيت angular-signals","دليل إعداد angular-signals","أمثلة من kodierung باستخدام Angular","التكامل مع @ngrx","التنسيق باستخدام tailwind"]}},"owner":"plastikaweb","repo":"plastikspace","repoPath":"plastikaweb/plastikspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.707Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-signals","description":"Implement signal-based reactive state management in Angular v20+. Use for creating reactive state with signal(), derived state with computed(), dependent state with linkedSignal(), and side effects with effect(). Triggers on state management questions, converting from BehaviorSubject/Observable patterns to signals, or implementing reactive data flows.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({","body":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' });\n```\n\n### computed() - Derived State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, computed } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst firstName = signal(''John'');\nconst lastName = signal(''Doe'');\n\n// Derived signal - automatically updates when dependencies change\nconst fullName = computed(() => `${firstName()} ${lastName()}`);\n\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"John Doe\"\nfirstName.set(''Jane'');\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"Jane Doe\"\n\n// Computed with complex logic\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\nconst filter = signal('''');\n\nconst filteredItems = computed(() => {\n  const query = filter().toLowerCase();\n  return items().filter(item => item.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n});\n\nconst totalPrice = computed(() => filteredItems().reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0));\n```\n\n### linkedSignal() - Dependent State with Reset\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, linkedSignal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst options = signal([''A'', ''B'', ''C'']);\n\n// Resets to first option when options change\nconst selected = linkedSignal(() => options()[0]);\n\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"A\"\nselected.set(''B''); // User selects B\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"B\"\noptions.set([''X'', ''Y'']); // Options change\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"X\" - auto-reset to first\n\n// With previous value access\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\n\nconst selectedItem = linkedSignal<Item[], Item | null>({\n  source: () => items(),\n  computation: (newItems, previous) => {\n    // Try to preserve selection if item still exists\n    const prevItem = previous?.value;\n    if (prevItem && newItems.some(i => i.id === prevItem.id)) {\n      return prevItem;\n    }\n    return newItems[0] ?? null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### effect() - Side Effects\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, effect, inject, DestroyRef } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  constructor() {\n    // Effect runs when query changes\n    effect(() => {\n      console.log(''Search query:'', this.query());\n    });\n\n    // Effect with cleanup\n    effect((onCleanup) => {\n      const timer = setInterval(() => {\n        console.log(''Current query:'', this.query());\n      }, 1000);\n\n      onCleanup(() => clearInterval(timer));\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Effect rules:**\n\n- Run in injection context (constructor or with `runInInjectionContext`)\n- Automatically cleaned up when component destroys\n\n## Component State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-todo-list'',\n  template: `\n    <input [value]=\"newTodo()\" (input)=\"newTodo.set($any($event.target).value)\" />\n    <button (click)=\"addTodo()\" [disabled]=\"!canAdd()\">Add</button>\n\n    <ul>\n      @for (todo of filteredTodos(); track todo.id) {\n        <li [class.done]=\"todo.done\">\n          {{ todo.text }}\n          <button (click)=\"toggleTodo(todo.id)\">Toggle</button>\n        </li>\n      }\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>{{ remaining() }} remaining</p>\n  `,\n})\nexport class TodoList {\n  // State\n  todos = signal<Todo[]>([]);\n  newTodo = signal('''');\n  filter = signal<''all'' | ''active'' | ''done''>(''all'');\n\n  // Derived state\n  canAdd = computed(() => this.newTodo().trim().length > 0);\n\n  filteredTodos = computed(() => {\n    const todos = this.todos();\n    switch (this.filter()) {\n      case ''active'':\n        return todos.filter(t => !t.done);\n      case ''done'':\n        return todos.filter(t => t.done);\n      default:\n        return todos;\n    }\n  });\n\n  remaining = computed(() => this.todos().filter(t => !t.done).length);\n\n  // Actions\n  addTodo() {\n    const text = this.newTodo().trim();\n    if (text) {\n      this.todos.update(todos => [...todos, { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, done: false }]);\n      this.newTodo.set('''');\n    }\n  }\n\n  toggleTodo(id: string) {\n    this.todos.update(todos => todos.map(t => (t.id === id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t)));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## RxJS Interop\n\n### toSignal() - Observable to Signal\n\n```typescript\nimport { toSignal } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { interval } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Timer {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // From observable - requires initial value or allowUndefined\n  counter = toSignal(interval(1000), { initialValue: 0 });\n\n  // From HTTP - undefined until loaded\n  users = toSignal(this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users''));\n\n  // With requireSync for synchronous observables (BehaviorSubject)\n  private user$ = new BehaviorSubject<User | null>(null);\n  currentUser = toSignal(this.user$, { requireSync: true });\n}\n```\n\n### toObservable() - Signal to Observable\n\n```typescript\nimport { toObservable } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { switchMap, debounceTime } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // Convert signal to observable for RxJS operators\n  results = toSignal(\n    toObservable(this.query).pipe(\n      debounceTime(300),\n      switchMap(q => this.http.get<Result[]>(`/api/search?q=${q}`))\n    ),\n    { initialValue: [] }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Signal Equality\n\n```typescript\n// Custom equality function\nconst user = signal<User>({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' }, { equal: (a, b) => a.id === b.id });\n\n// Only triggers updates when ID changes\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice Updated'' }); // No update\nuser.set({ id: 2, name: ''Bob'' }); // Triggers update\n```\n\n## Untracked Reads\n\n```typescript\nimport { untracked } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst a = signal(1);\nconst b = signal(2);\n\n// Only depends on ''a'', not ''b''\nconst result = computed(() => {\n  const aVal = a();\n  const bVal = untracked(() => b());\n  return aVal + bVal;\n});\n```\n\n## Service State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Auth {\n  // Private writable state\n  private _user = signal<User | null>(null);\n  private _loading = signal(false);\n\n  // Public read-only signals\n  readonly user = this._user.asReadonly();\n  readonly loading = this._loading.asReadonly();\n  readonly isAuthenticated = computed(() => this._user() !== null);\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  async login(credentials: Credentials): Promise<void> {\n    this._loading.set(true);\n    try {\n      const user = await firstValueFrom(this.http.post<User>(''/api/login'', credentials));\n      this._user.set(user);\n    } finally {\n      this._loading.set(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  logout(): void {\n    this._user.set(null);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns including resource(), see [references/signal-patterns.md](references/signal-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:35.470Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fine-grained state management with Angular''s reactive primitives.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Angular 的响应式原语进行细粒度状态管理的前端代理。","ja":"Angular の反応的なプリミティブを使用した細粒度の状態管理が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular의 반응형 原语를 사용하여 세부적인 상태 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un control de estado granular con los primitivos reactivos de Angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une gestion d''état fine avec les primitives réactives d''Angular.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine feingranulare Zustandsverwaltung mit den reaktiven Primitiven von Angular benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado granular com primitivos reativos do Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим тонкий контроль состояния с помощью реактивных примитивов Angular.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة حالة دقيقة باستخدام البدائيات التفاعلية لأنجولار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously using Angular Signals, integrating seamlessly with @ngrx and Tailwind for robust frontend development, and providing explicit type control for signals like User or null.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Angular Signals 同步管理状态的能力，与 @ngrx 和 Tailwind 无缝集成，提供强大的前端开发，并为信号（如 User 或 null）提供显式类型控制。","ja":"Angular Signals を使用して状態を同期的に管理するエージェントを可能にし、@ngrx と Tailwind との統合を容易にし、信号（たとえば User または null）に対する明示的な型制御を提供することで、ロバストなフロントエンド開発を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular Signals를 사용하여 상태를 동기적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @ngrx 및 Tailwind와의 통합을 원활하게 하고, User 또는 null과 같은 신호에 대한 명시적인 유형 제어를 제공하여 강력한 프론트엔드 개발을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado de forma sincrónica utilizando Angular Signals, integrándose de forma nativa con @ngrx y Tailwind para un desarrollo de frontend robusto, y proporcionando un control de tipo explícito para señales como User o null.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état de manière synchrone en utilisant les signaux Angular, en s''intégrant sans problème avec @ngrx et Tailwind pour un développement de frontend robuste, et en fournissant un contrôle de type explicite pour les signaux comme User ou null.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, den Zustand synchron mithilfe von Angular Signals zu verwalten, indem sie nahtlos in @ngrx und Tailwind für robuste Frontend-Entwicklung integriert werden und eine explizite Typsteuerung für Signale wie User oder null bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar estado de forma síncrona usando Sinais do Angular, integrando-se perfeitamente com @ngrx e Tailwind para desenvolvimento de frontend robusto, e fornecendo controle de tipo explícito para sinais como User ou nulo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием синхронно с помощью сигналов Angular, интегрируясь без проблем с @ngrx и Tailwind для прочного frontend-разработки, и обеспечивая явный контроль типов для сигналов, таких как User или null.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة بشكل متزامن باستخدام إشارات الأنجولار، ودمجها بشكل متكامل مع @ngrx و Tailwind من أجل تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية القوية، وتوفير التحكم الصريح في النوع للإشارات مثل المستخدم أو فارغة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating synchronous, fine-grained reactive components with signal()","Updating state values using signal.set() and signal.update() methods","Implementing explicit type control for signals, such as User or null, in Angular applications"],"zh":["使用 signal() 创建同步、细粒度的响应式组件","使用 signal.set() 和 signal.update() 方法更新状态值","在 Angular 应用程序中实现信号（如 User 或 null）的显式类型控制"],"ja":["signal() を使用して同期的な、細粒度の反応コンポーネントを作成する","signal.set() と signal.update() メソッドを使用して状態値を更新する","Angular アプリケーションで、User または null などの信号の明示的な型制御を実装する"],"ko":["signal()를 사용하여 동기적이고 세부적인 반응형 컴포넌트를 생성합니다.","signal.set() 및 signal.update() 메서드를 사용하여 상태 값을 업데이트합니다.","Angular 애플리케이션에서 User 또는 null과 같은 신호에 대한 명시적인 유형 제어를 구현합니다."],"es":["Crear componentes reactivos sincrónicos y granulares con signal()","Actualizar valores de estado utilizando los métodos signal.set() y signal.update()","Implementar un control de tipo explícito para señales como User o null en aplicaciones Angular"],"fr":["Créer des composants réactifs synchrones et granulaires avec signal()","Mettre à jour les valeurs d''état en utilisant les méthodes signal.set() et signal.update()","Mettre en œuvre un contrôle de type explicite pour les signaux comme User ou null dans les applications Angular"],"de":["Erstellen von synchronen, feingranularen reaktiven Komponenten mit signal()","Aktualisieren von Zustandswerten mithilfe der Methoden signal.set() und signal.update()","Implementieren einer expliziten Typsteuerung für Signale wie User oder null in Angular-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criar componentes reativos finos e síncronos com signal()","Atualizar valores de estado usando métodos signal.set() e signal.update()","Implementar controle de tipo explícito para sinais, como User ou nulo, em aplicativos Angular"],"ru":["Создание синхронных, тонких реактивных компонентов с помощью signal()","Обновление значений состояния с помощью методов signal.set() и signal.update()","Реализация явного контроля типов для сигналов, таких как User или null, в приложениях Angular"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات تفاعلية دقيقة ومزامنة باستخدام signal()","تحديث قيم الحالة باستخدام أساليب signal.set() و signal.update()","تنفيذ التحكم الصريح في النوع للإشارات مثل المستخدم أو فارغة في تطبيقات الأنجولار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular and @angular/core installation","Limited to Angular ecosystem, not compatible with other frontend frameworks"],"zh":["需要安装 Angular 和 @angular/core","仅限于 Angular 生态系统，不兼容其他前端框架"],"ja":["Angular と @angular/core のインストールが必要","Angular エコシステムのみに制限され、他のフロントエンド フレームワークとの互換性がありません"],"ko":["Angular 및 @angular/core의 설치가 필요합니다.","Angular 생태계에만 제한되며 다른 프론트엔드 프레임워크와 호환되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Angular y @angular/core","Limitado al ecosistema de Angular, no compatible con otros frameworks de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''Angular et de @angular/core","Limité à l''écosystème d''Angular, non compatible avec d''autres frameworks de frontend"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Angular und @angular/core","Begrenzt auf das Angular-Ökosystem, nicht kompatibel mit anderen Frontend-Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Angular e @angular/core","Limitado ao ecossistema do Angular, não compatível com outros frameworks de frontend"],"ru":["Требует установки Angular и @angular/core","Ограничен экосистемой Angular, не совместим с другими фронтенд-фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت الأنجولار و @angular/core","محدود بنظام الأنجولار، غير متوافق مع إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ba4eff135230b69cf49d64f9c57a458fa5081fa0553dbd67239639ac27dd02d","qualityScore":42}');
