ation des flux de travail"],"de":["Leichtes und flexibles Entwickeln","Spec-Driven Development für KI","Integration mit GitHub","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Automatisierung von Workflows"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento leve e flexível","Spec-Driven Development para aplicativos modernos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Легкий и гибкий подход к разработке","Spec-Driven Development для современных приложений","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Автоматизация задач разработки"],"ar":["نهج خفيف ومرن لتطوير التطبيقات","Spec-Driven Development من أجل التطبيقات الحديثة","دمج مع أدوات تطوير شائعة","دعم بيئات متعددة للتطوير","آليّة مهام التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-actions教程","AI驱动开发工具","Spec-Driven Development是什么","github-actions安装","github-actions替代品","github-actions和Jenkins比较","如何使用github-actions","github-actions文档"],"ja":["github-actionsチュートリアル","AI駆動開発ツール","Spec-Driven Developmentとは","github-actionsインストール","github-actionsの代替","github-actionsとJenkinsの比較","github-actionsの使い方","github-actionsドキュメント"],"ko":["github-actions 튜토리얼","AI 구동 개발 도구","Spec-Driven Development이란","github-actions 설치","github-actions 대안","github-actions와 Jenkins 비교","github-actions 사용 방법","github-actions 문서"],"es":["herramientas de AI","GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración con GitHub","automatización de flujos de trabajo","cómo usar GitHub Actions","alternativas a GitHub Actions"],"fr":["outils d''IA","GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","développement d''applications","intégration avec GitHub","automatisation des flux de travail","comment utiliser GitHub Actions","alternatives à GitHub Actions"],"de":["KI-Tools","GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","Anwendungsentwicklung","Integration mit GitHub","Automatisierung von Workflows","wie man GitHub Actions verwendet","Alternativen zu GitHub Actions"],"pt":["como usar github actions","o que é spec driven development","github actions vs jenkins","instalar github actions","guia de setup do github actions","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento ágil com github actions","github actions para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать ии агенты github actions","что такое spec driven development","ии агенты github actions vs jenkins","установка ии агентов github actions","руководство по настройке ии агентов github actions","инструменты ии для разработки","гибкая разработка с ии агентами github actions","ии агенты github actions для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام عمليات github","ما هي Spec-Driven Development","عمليات github مقابل jenkins","تثبيت عمليات github","دليل إعداد عمليات github","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير التطبيقات","التطوير المُرن مع عمليات github","عمليات github للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"codervisor","repo":"lean-spec","repoPath":"codervisor/lean-spec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.705Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-actions","description":"GitHub Actions workflow management for LeanSpec. Use when triggering CI/CD workflows, monitoring build status, debugging failed runs, managing artifacts, or checking CI before releases.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status Before Acting** - Always verify current run status before triggering new ones\n3. **Monitor Until Completion** - Background workflows need periodic status checks\n4. **Artifacts Are Ephemeral** - Download important artifacts before they expire (default: 30 day","body":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status Before Acting** - Always verify current run status before triggering new ones\n3. **Monitor Until Completion** - Background workflows need periodic status checks\n4. **Artifacts Are Ephemeral** - Download important artifacts before they expire (default: 30 days)\n5. **Respect Rate Limits** - Don''t poll too frequently (minimum 30s between checks)\n\n## Available Workflows\n\n| Workflow | File | Triggers | Purpose |\n|----------|------|----------|---------|\n| **CI** | `ci.yml` | push, PR to main | Build, test, lint (Node.js + Rust) |\n| **Publish** | `publish.yml` | release, manual | Publish to npm (all platforms) |\n| **Desktop Build** | `desktop-build.yml` | push, PR, manual | Build Tauri desktop apps |\n| **Copilot Setup** | `copilot-setup-steps.yml` | push, PR, manual | Setup environment for Copilot agent |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Check Workflow Status\n\n```bash\n# List recent workflow runs\ngh run list --limit 10\n\n# View specific workflow runs\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 5\ngh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 5\n\n# Get details of a specific run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Watch a run in progress\ngh run watch <run-id>\n```\n\n### Trigger Workflows\n\n```bash\n# Trigger CI manually (usually automatic on push/PR)\ngh workflow run ci.yml\n\n# Trigger publish (dev version)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\n# Trigger publish (dry run - validates without publishing)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true --field dry_run=true\n\n# Trigger desktop build\ngh workflow run desktop-build.yml\n```\n\n### Debug Failed Runs\n\n```bash\n# View failed run logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log-failed\n\n# View full logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log\n\n# Re-run failed jobs only\ngh run rerun <run-id> --failed\n\n# Re-run entire workflow\ngh run rerun <run-id>\n```\n\n### Manage Artifacts\n\n```bash\n# List artifacts from a run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Download all artifacts from a run\ngh run download <run-id>\n\n# Download specific artifact\ngh run download <run-id> --name ui-dist\ngh run download <run-id> --name binaries-linux-x64\n```\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nNeed to check if build passing?\n└─> gh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 1\n\nNeed to publish packages?\n├─> Production: Create GitHub Release (recommended)\n└─> Testing: gh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\nWorkflow failed?\n├─> View logs: gh run view <id> --log-failed\n├─> Transient: gh run rerun <id> --failed\n└─> Real issue: Fix locally, push, let CI re-run\n\nNeed build artifacts?\n└─> gh run download <run-id> --name <artifact-name>\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [references/WORKFLOWS.md](./references/WORKFLOWS.md) - Detailed workflow documentation (jobs, triggers, durations)\n- [references/COMMANDS.md](./references/COMMANDS.md) - Complete `gh` command reference\n- [references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md](./references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) - Common issues and solutions"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:41:56.251Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated workflow management with GitHub Actions","zh":"非常适合需要使用 GitHub Actions 实现自动化工作流管理的 DevOps Agents","ja":"GitHub Actions を使用した自動化されたワークフローの管理が必要な DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub Actions 를 사용하여 자동화된 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada con GitHub Actions","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow automatisée avec GitHub Actions","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Workflow-Verwaltung mit GitHub Actions benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado com GitHub Actions","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым требуется автоматизированное управление рабочим процессом с помощью GitHub Actions","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل DevOps التي تحتاج إلى إدارة سير عمل آلية مع GitHub Actions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows using the GitHub CLI (`gh`), ensuring seamless Spec-Driven Development (SDD) and efficient workflow management with features like periodic status checks and artifact downloads","zh":"赋予代理触发、监控和管理 GitHub Actions 工作流的能力，使用 GitHub CLI (`gh`)，确保无缝的 Spec-Driven Development (SDD) 和高效的工作流管理，具有周期性状态检查和工件下载等功能","ja":"エージェントが GitHub Actions ワークフローをトリガー、監視、管理できるようにし、GitHub CLI (`gh`) を使用してシームレスな Spec-Driven Development (SDD) と効率的なワークフローの管理を可能にし、周期的なステータス チェックやアーティファクトのダウンロードなどの機能を提供","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions 워크플로우를 트리거, 모니터링, 관리할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub CLI (`gh`)를 사용하여無縫의 Spec-Driven Development (SDD)와 효율적인 워크플로우 관리를 가능하게 하며, 주기적인 상태 확인 및 아티팩트 다운로드 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes para desencadenar, monitorear y gestionar flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions utilizando la GitHub CLI (`gh`), asegurando un desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones (SDD) sin problemas y una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente con características como comprobaciones de estado periódicas y descargas de artefactos","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour déclencher, surveiller et gérer les flux de travail GitHub Actions à l''aide de la GitHub CLI (`gh`), garantissant un développement piloté par des spécifications (SDD) sans heurts et une gestion de flux de travail efficace avec des fonctionnalités comme des vérifications d''état périodiques et des téléchargements d''artefacts","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GitHub Actions-Workflows mithilfe der GitHub CLI (`gh`) auszulösen, zu überwachen und zu verwalten, und gewährleistet so eine reibungslose spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung (SDD) und eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung mit Funktionen wie periodischen Statusprüfungen und Artefakt-Downloads","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar, monitorar e gerenciar fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions usando o GitHub CLI (`gh`), garantindo desenvolvimento orientado por especificações (SDD) sem interrupções e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho eficiente com recursos como checagens periódicas de status e downloads de artefatos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать, отслеживать и управлять рабочими процессами GitHub Actions с помощью GitHub CLI (`gh`), обеспечивая бесперебойное развитие на основе спецификаций (SDD) и эффективное управление рабочим процессом с функциями, такими как периодические проверки статуса и загрузка артефактов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل ومراقبة وإدارة سير العمل من GitHub Actions باستخدام GitHub CLI (`gh`)， مما يضمن تطويرًا مستندًا إلى المواصفات (SDD) بدون انقطاع وإدارة سير عمل فعالة مع ميزات مثل فحوصات حالة دورية وتنزيل المكونات الإضافية"},"useCases":{"en":["Triggering GitHub Actions workflows for automated testing and deployment","Monitoring workflow runs for real-time status updates and debugging","Downloading artifacts before expiration to ensure data persistence"],"zh":["触发 GitHub Actions 工作流以进行自动化测试和部署","监控工作流运行以获取实时状态更新和调试","在过期之前下载工件以确保数据持久性"],"ja":["自動テストとデプロイのために GitHub Actions ワークフローをトリガーする","ワークフローの実行を監視してリアルタイムのステータス更新とデバッグを行う","有効期限の前にアーティファクトをダウンロードしてデータの永続性を確保する"],"ko":["자동화된 테스트 및 배포를 위해 GitHub Actions 워크플로우를 트리거하는 것","워크플로우 실행을 모니터링하여 실시간 상태 업데이트 및 디버깅을 수행","유효 기간이 끝나기 전에 아티팩트를 다운로드하여 데이터 지속성을 보장"],"es":["Desencadenar flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions para pruebas y despliegue automatizados","Monitorear las ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo para obtener actualizaciones de estado en tiempo real y depuración","Descargar artefactos antes de su expiración para garantizar la persistencia de datos"],"fr":["Déclencher des flux de travail GitHub Actions pour des tests et des déploiements automatisés","Surveiller les exécutions de flux de travail pour obtenir des mises à jour d''état en temps réel et de débogage","Télécharger des artefacts avant leur expiration pour assurer la persistance des données"],"de":["Auslösen von GitHub Actions-Workflows für automatisierte Tests und Bereitstellungen","Überwachen von Workflow-Ausführungen für Echtzeit-Statusupdates und Fehlersuche","Herunterladen von Artefakten vor deren Ablauf, um die Datensicherheit zu gewährleisten"],"pt":["Disparar fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions para testes e implantação automatizados","Monitorar execuções de fluxo de trabalho para atualizações de status em tempo real e depuração","Baixar artefatos antes do vencimento para garantir a persistência de dados"],"ru":["Запуск рабочих процессов GitHub Actions для автоматизированного тестирования и развертывания","Отслеживание выполнения рабочих процессов для обновлений статуса в режиме реального времени и отладки","Загрузка артефактов до истечения срока для обеспечения сохранения данных"],"ar":["تشغيل سير العمل من GitHub Actions لاختبارات وتنصيب آلي","مراقبة تشغيل سير العمل للحصول على تحديثات حالة في الوقت الفعلي وتصحيح الأخطاء","تنزيل المكونات الإضافية قبل انتهاء الصلاحية لضمان استمرار البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (`gh`) installation and configuration","Dependent on GitHub Actions workflow setup and configuration","Artifact storage limited to 30 days by default"],"zh":["需要安装和配置 GitHub CLI (`gh`)","依赖于 GitHub Actions 工作流设置和配置","工件存储默认限制为 30 天"],"ja":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) のインストールと設定が必要","GitHub Actions ワークフローの設定と構成に依存","アーティファクトのストレージはデフォルトで 30 日に制限"],"ko":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) 설치 및 구성 필요","GitHub Actions 워크플로우 설정 및 구성에 의존","아티팩트 저장소 기본적으로 30일로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Dependiente de la configuración y el establecimiento del flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions","El almacenamiento de artefactos está limitado a 30 días por defecto"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de la GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Dépend de la configuration et de la mise en place du flux de travail GitHub Actions","Le stockage d''artefacts est limité à 30 jours par défaut"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration der GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Hängt von der Einrichtung und Konfiguration d