e","Integration mit Claude Code","Unterstützung für spezialisierte KI-Agents","Offener und anpassbarer Code","Detaillierte Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Modelo de TypeScript pronto para produção","Agentes de IA especializados para Claude Code","Suporte a desenvolvimento frontend","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Código de alta qualidade e facilmente manutenível"],"ru":["Шаблон TypeScript для агентов ИИ","Специализированные агенты ИИ для Claude Code","Поддержка разработки frontend","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Высококачественный и легко поддерживаемый код"],"ar":["قالب TypeScript جاهزة للتشغيل","وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متخصصين ل Claude Code","دعم تطوير الجانب الأمامي","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كود عالي الجودة وسهل الصيانة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","TypeScript模板","Claude Code","前端技术规范","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","TypeScriptボイラープレート","Claude Code","フロントエンド技術仕様","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","타입스크립트 보일러プレ이트","클라우드 코드","프론트엔드 기술 사양","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["agentes de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de agentes de ia","plantilla de typescript para ia","claude code","agentes de ia especializados","tipo de inteligencia artificial","ia en el desarrollo de software","herramientas de ia para desarrolladores","integración de ia en aplicaciones"],"fr":["agents d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''agents d''ia","modèle de typescript pour ia","claude code","agents d''ia spécialisés","type d''intelligence artificielle","ia dans le développement de logiciels","outils d''ia pour développeurs","intégration d''ia dans les applications"],"de":["ki-agents","entwicklung von ki-agents","typescript-boilerplate für ki","claude code","spezialisierte ki-agents","art der künstlichen intelligenz","ki im software-entwicklung","ki-tools für entwickler","integration von ki in anwendungen"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que é agente de IA"," Claude Code alternative"," Claude Code vs outros","instalar agente de IA","guia de configuração de agente de IA"],"ru":["как использовать агенты ИИ","что такое агент ИИ","альтернатива Claude Code","сравнение Claude Code с другими","установка агента ИИ","руководство по настройке агента ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل Claude Code","مقارنة Claude Code مع غيرها","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"ai-coding-project-boilerplate","repoPath":"shinpr/ai-coding-project-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.728Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend/technical-spec","description":"Defines frontend environment variables, component design, and data flow patterns. Use when configuring React environment.","bodyPreview":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety wit","body":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety with TypeScript\n- Properly implement default value settings and mandatory checks\n\n```typescript\n// Build tool environment variables (public values only)\nconst config = {\n  apiUrl: import.meta.env.API_URL || ''http://localhost:3000'',\n  appName: import.meta.env.APP_NAME || ''My App''\n}\n\n// Does not work in frontend\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL\n```\n\n### Security (Client-side Constraints)\n- **CRITICAL**: All frontend code is public and visible in browser\n- **Never store secrets client-side**: No API keys, tokens, or secrets in environment variables\n- Do not include `.env` files in Git (same as backend)\n- Prohibit logging of sensitive information (passwords, tokens, personal data)\n- Do not include sensitive information in error messages\n\n**Correct Approach for Secrets**:\n```typescript\n// Security risk: API key exposed in browser\nconst apiKey = import.meta.env.API_KEY\nconst response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/data?key=${apiKey}`)\n\n// Correct: Backend manages secrets, frontend accesses via proxy\nconst response = await fetch(''/api/data'') // Backend handles API key authentication\n```\n\n## Architecture Design\n\n### Frontend Architecture Patterns\n\n**React Component Architecture**:\n- **Function Components**: Mandatory, class components deprecated\n- **Custom Hooks**: For logic reuse and dependency injection\n- **Component Hierarchy**: Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms -> Templates -> Pages\n- **Props-driven**: Components receive all necessary data via props\n- **Co-location**: Place tests, styles, and related files alongside components\n\n**State Management Patterns**:\n- **Local State**: `useState` for component-specific state\n- **Context API**: For sharing state across component tree (theme, auth, etc.)\n- **Custom Hooks**: Encapsulate state logic and side effects\n- **Server State**: React Query or SWR for API data caching\n\n## Unified Data Flow Principles\n\n### Client-side Data Flow\nMaintain consistent data flow throughout the React application:\n\n- **Single Source of Truth**: Each piece of state has one authoritative source\n  - UI state: Component state or Context\n  - Server data: API responses cached in React Query/SWR\n  - Form data: Controlled components with React Hook Form\n\n- **Unidirectional Flow**: Data flows top-down via props\n  ```\n  API Response -> State -> Props -> Render -> UI\n  User Input -> Event Handler -> State Update -> Re-render\n  ```\n\n- **Immutable Updates**: Use immutable patterns for state updates\n  ```typescript\n  // Immutable state update\n  setUsers(prev => [...prev, newUser])\n\n  // Mutable state update (avoid)\n  users.push(newUser)\n  setUsers(users)\n  ```\n\n### Type Safety in Data Flow\n- **Frontend -> Backend**: Props/State (Type Guaranteed) -> API Request (Serialization)\n- **Backend -> Frontend**: API Response (`unknown`) -> Type Guard -> State (Type Guaranteed)\n\n```typescript\n// Type-safe data flow\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<User> {\n  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`)\n  const data: unknown = await response.json()\n\n  if (!isUser(data)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid user data'')\n  }\n\n  return data // Type guaranteed as User\n}\n```\n\n## Build and Testing\nUse the appropriate run command based on the `packageManager` field in package.json.\n\n### Build Commands\n- `dev` - Development server\n- `build` - Production build\n- `preview` - Preview production build\n- `type-check` - Type check (no emit)\n\n### Testing Commands\n- `test` - Run tests\n- `test:coverage` - Run tests with coverage\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Run tests with coverage (fresh cache)\n- `test:safe` - Safe test execution (with auto cleanup)\n- `cleanup:processes` - Cleanup Vitest processes\n\n### Quality Check Requirements\nQuality checks are mandatory upon implementation completion:\n\n**Phase 1-3: Basic Checks**\n- `check` - Biome (lint + format)\n- `build` - TypeScript build\n\n**Phase 4-5: Tests and Final Confirmation**\n- `test` - Test execution\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Coverage measurement\n- `check:all` - Overall integrated check\n\n### Coverage Requirements\n- **Mandatory**: Unit test coverage must be 60% or higher\n- **Component-specific targets**:\n  - Atoms: 70% or higher\n  - Molecules: 65% or higher\n  - Organisms: 60% or higher\n  - Custom Hooks: 65% or higher\n  - Utils: 70% or higher\n\n### Non-functional Requirements\n- **Browser Compatibility**: Chrome/Firefox/Safari/Edge (latest 2 versions)\n- **Rendering Time**: Within 5 seconds for major pages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:58:20.976Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents like Claude Code needing scalable frontend architecture and environment variable management","zh":"适用于基于TypeScript的AI代理，如Claude Code，需要可扩展的前端架构和环境变量管理","ja":"TypeScriptをベースとするAIエージェント、たとえばClaude Codeのように、スケーラブルなフロントエンドアーキテクチャと環境変数管理が必要な場合に最適","ko":"TypeScript 기반의 AI 에이전트인 Claude Code와 같이 확장 가능한 프론트엔드 아키텍처 및 환경 변수 관리가 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript como Claude Code que necesitan una arquitectura de frontend escalable y gestión de variables de entorno","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript comme Claude Code nécessitant une architecture frontend scalable et une gestion de variables d''environnement","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine skalierbare Frontend-Architektur und Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript, como Claude Code, que necessitam de arquitetura de frontend escalável e gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, таких как Claude Code, требующих масштабируемой архитектуры frontend и управления переменными среды","ar":"مثالي لعميل الحاسوب الذكي القائم على TypeScript مثل Claude Code والذي يحتاج إلى هيكل متقدم للواجهة وادارة متغيرات البيئة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement production-ready React applications with proper type safety, utilizing build tool environment variable systems and centralized configuration layers for security, all while leveraging TypeScript''s robust typing capabilities and React''s component-driven architecture","zh":"赋予代理实现生产就绪的React应用程序的能力，具有适当的类型安全性，利用构建工具环境变量系统和集中配置层以确保安全，同时利用TypeScript的强大类型功能和React的组件驱动架构","ja":"エージェントが、ビルドツールの環境変数システムとセキュリティのために集中配置層を利用し、TypeScriptの堅固なタイピング機能とReactのコンポーネント駆動アーキテクチャを活用しながら、適切なタイプセーフティを持つプロダクションレディのReactアプリケーションを実装する能力を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 프로덕션 준비가 된 React 애플리케이션을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 적절한 타입 안전성을 제공하고, 빌드 도구의 환경 변수 시스템과 보안을 위한集中 구성 계층을 활용하며,同時に TypeScript의 강력한 타이핑 기능과 React의 컴포넌트 주도 아키텍처를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones React listas para producción con una seguridad de tipos adecuada, utilizando sistemas de variables de entorno de herramientas de compilación y capas de configuración centralizadas para la seguridad, aprovechando al mismo tiempo las capacidades de tipado robusto de TypeScript y la arquitectura basada en componentes de React","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des applications React prêtes pour la production avec une sécurité de types appropriée, en utilisant des systèmes de variables d''environnement d''outils de construction et des couches de configuration centralisées pour la sécurité, tout en exploitant les capacités de typage robuste de TypeScript et l''architecture basée sur les composants de React","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Produktions-React-Anwendungen mit ordnungsgemäßer Typsicherheit zu implementieren, die Umgebungsvariablen-Systeme von Build-Tools und zentralisierte Konfigurationsebenen für die Sicherheit nutzen und gleichzeitig die robusten Typisierungsfähigkeiten von TypeScript und die komponentenbasierte Architektur von React nutzen","pt":"Habilita agentes a implementar aplicações React prontas para produção com segurança de tipo adequada, utilizando sistemas de variáveis de ambiente de ferramentas de build e camadas de configuração centralizadas para segurança, aproveitando ao mesmo tempo as capacidades de digitação robustas do TypeScript e a arquitetura orientada a componentes do React","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать приложения React, готовые к производству, с надлежащей безопасностью типов, используя системы переменных среды инструментов сборки и централизованные конфигурационные слои для безопасности, одновременно используя прочные возможности типизации TypeScript и компонентно-ориентированную архитектуру React","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنفيذ تطبيقات React جاهزة للانتاج مع ضمانات أمنية مناسبة، باستخدام أنظمة المتغيرات البيئية لأدوات البناء وطبقات التهيئة المركزية لأغراض الأمن، مع الاستفادة من قدرات التنضيد القوية لTypeScript وهيكل مكونات React"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure environment variable management for browser environments","Designing scalable TypeScript-based React applications with selected architecture patterns","Centrally managing environment variables through a configuration layer for enhanced security"],"zh":["为浏览器环境实现安全的环境变量管理","使用选定的架构模式设计可扩展的TypeScript基于React应用程序","通过配置层集中管理环境变量以增强安全性"],"ja":["ブラウザ環境のためのセキュアな環境変数管理の実装","選択されたアーキテクチャパターンを使用してスケーラブルなTypeScriptベースのReactアプリケーションを設計する","セキュリティの向上のために配置層を介して環境変数を集中管理する"],"ko":["브라우저 환경을 위한 보안 환경 변수 관리 구현","선택된 아키텍처 패턴을 사용하여 확장 가능한 TypeScript 기반 React 애플리케이션 설계","보안 강화를 위해 구성 계층을 통해 환경 변수를集中 관리"],"es":["Implementar una gestión segura de variables de entorno para entornos de navegador","Diseñar aplicaciones React basadas en TypeScript escalables con patrones de arquitectura seleccionados","Gestionar centralmente las variables de entorno a través de una capa de configuración para una mayor seguridad"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement pour les environnements de navigateur","Concevoir des applications React basées sur TypeScript escalables avec des modèles d''architecture sélectionnés","Gérer de manière centralisée les variables d''environnement via une couche de configuration pour une sécurité renforcée"],"de":