,"자동으로 wp-content를 동기화"],"es":["Soporte para SSH y modo de importación de archivos","Manejo automático de bases de datos","Reemplazo de URLs","Sincronización de wp-content","Migración de sitios web de WordPress de manera segura"],"fr":["Prise en charge SSH et mode d''importation d''archives","Gestion automatique de bases de données","Remplacement d''URL","Synchronisation de wp-content","Migration de sites web WordPress de manière sécurisée"],"de":["Unterstützung für SSH und Archiv-Import-Modus","Automatische Datenbankverwaltung","URL-Ersetzung","Synchronisation von wp-content","Migration von WordPress-Websites auf sichere Weise"],"pt":["Suporte a SSH para migração segura","Importação de arquivos para facilitar a transferência","Tratamento automático de banco de dados","Substituição de URLs para evitar erros","Sincronização de wp-content para garantir a integridade do site"],"ru":["Поддержка SSH для безопасной миграции","Импорт файлов для упрощения переноса","Автоматическая обработка базы данных","Замена URL для избежания ошибок","Синхронизация wp-content для обеспечения целостности сайта"],"ar":["دعم SSH لتحريك آمن","استيراد الملفات لتسهيل النقل","معالجة 자동ية لقاعدة البيانات","استبدال الروابط لتجنب الأخطاء","مزامنة wp-content لضمان سلامة الموقع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WP迁移AI工具","WordPress迁移工具","如何使用WP迁移AI工具","WP迁移AI工具安装","WordPress迁移工具比较","WP迁移AI工具教程","WordPress迁移最佳实践"],"ja":["WordPress移行AIエージェント","WordPress移行ツール","WordPress移行AIエージェントの使い方","WordPress移行AIエージェントのインストール","WordPress移行ツールの比較","WordPress移行AIエージェントのチュートリアル","WordPress移行のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["워드프레스 마이그레이션 AI 에이전트","워드프레스 마이그레이션 도구","워드프레스 마이그레이션 AI 에이전트 사용법","워드프레스 마이그레이션 AI 에이전트 설치","워드프레스 마이그레이션 도구 비교","워드프레스 마이그레이션 AI 에이전트 튜토리얼","워드프레스 마이그레이션 최선의 방법"],"es":["herramientas de migración de WordPress","wp-migrate","cómo migrar un sitio web de WordPress","mejores herramientas de migración de WordPress","wp-migrate vs otras herramientas","instalación de wp-migrate","guía de configuración de wp-migrate"],"fr":["outils de migration WordPress","wp-migrate","comment migrer un site web WordPress","meilleurs outils de migration WordPress","wp-migrate vs autres outils","installation de wp-migrate","guide de configuration de wp-migrate"],"de":["WordPress-Migrationstools","wp-migrate","wie man eine WordPress-Website migriert","beste WordPress-Migrationstools","wp-migrate vs andere Tools","Installation von wp-migrate","Konfigurationsanleitung für wp-migrate"],"pt":["como usar wp-migrate","o que é wp-migrate","wp-migrate alternative","wp-migrate vs duplicator","instalar wp-migrate","guia de configuração do wp-migrate","migração de site wordpress","ferramentas de ia para wordpress"],"ru":["как использовать wp-migrate","что такое wp-migrate","wp-migrate альтернатива","wp-migrate vs duplicator","установить wp-migrate","руководство по настройке wp-migrate","миграция сайта wordpress","инструменты ии для wordpress"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام wp-migrate","ما هو wp-migrate","بديل wp-migrate","wp-migrate مقابل duplicator","تثبيت wp-migrate","دليل إعداد wp-migrate","نقل موقع ووردبريس","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لويبوردبريس"]}},"owner":"BWBama85","repo":"wp-migrate.sh","repoPath":"BWBama85/wp-migrate.sh","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.729Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-migrate","description":"WordPress site migration and deployment using wp-migrate.sh. Use when migrating WordPress sites, syncing databases, managing backups, testing migrations, debugging migration issues, or working with WordPress deployment workflows including Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, and Solid Backups archives. Also use for code modifications, testing, git workflows, PR creation, and release management for this project.","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Migration Skill\n\nThis skill provides expertise for working with the wp-migrate.sh WordPress migration tool.\n\n## Project Overview\n\nwp-migrate.sh is a comprehensive WordPress migration tool that operates in two modes:\n\n1. **Push Mode**: Migrates WordPress sites between servers via SSH (source → destination)\n2. **Archive Mode**: Imports WordPress backup archives (Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, Solid Backups) on destination server\n\n**Current Version**: Check the latest release\n\n```bash\ngit","body":"# WordPress Migration Skill\n\nThis skill provides expertise for working with the wp-migrate.sh WordPress migration tool.\n\n## Project Overview\n\nwp-migrate.sh is a comprehensive WordPress migration tool that operates in two modes:\n\n1. **Push Mode**: Migrates WordPress sites between servers via SSH (source → destination)\n2. **Archive Mode**: Imports WordPress backup archives (Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, Solid Backups) on destination server\n\n**Current Version**: Check the latest release\n\n```bash\ngit describe --tags --abbrev=0  # Get current version from git\n```\n\n**Latest Release**: See [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/BWBama85/wp-migrate.sh/releases/latest)\n\n**Repository**: BWBama85/wp-migrate.sh\n\n**Main Branch**: main\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### Migration Modes\n\n#### Push Mode\n- Transfers wp-content and database from source to destination via SSH\n- Enables maintenance mode on both servers during migration\n- Creates timestamped backups before overwriting\n- Performs URL search-replace to align destination domain\n- Excludes object-cache.php to preserve destination caching infrastructure\n- Supports StellarSites managed hosting compatibility (--stellarsites flag)\n\n#### Archive Mode\n- Auto-detects archive format (Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, Solid Backups)\n- Extracts archives to temporary directory\n- Validates disk space (requires 3x archive size)\n- Creates backups of destination database and wp-content before import\n- Automatically aligns table prefixes if different from wp-config.php\n- Performs URL search-replace to align with destination URLs\n- Provides rollback instructions with exact commands\n\n### Key Features\n- **Migration preview with confirmation**: Pre-migration summary with detailed stats and confirmation prompt (v2.6.0)\n- **Rollback command**: Automatic restoration from backups with --rollback flag (v2.6.0)\n- **Progress indicators**: Real-time progress bars for long-running operations when pv is installed (v2.6.0)\n- **Dry-run mode**: Preview all operations without making changes (--dry-run)\n- **Verbose logging**: Show detailed diagnostic information (--verbose)\n- **Trace mode**: Show every command before execution (--trace)\n- **Plugin preservation**: Preserve destination plugins/themes not in source (--preserve-dest-plugins)\n- **StellarSites mode**: Managed hosting compatibility with mu-plugins exclusion (--stellarsites)\n- **Skip search-replace**: Fast migrations that only update home/siteurl options (--no-search-replace)\n- **Automation support**: Skip confirmation prompts with --yes flag for CI/CD (v2.6.0)\n- **Quiet mode**: Suppress progress indicators for non-interactive scripts with --quiet (v2.6.0)\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Running Migrations\n\n**Push Mode:**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --dest-host user@dest.example.com --dest-root /var/www/site\n```\n\n**Archive Mode:**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --archive /path/to/backup.zip\n./wp-migrate.sh --archive /path/to/backup.tar.gz --archive-type jetpack\n```\n\n**Dry Run:**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --dest-host user@dest --dest-root /var/www/site --dry-run --verbose\n```\n\n**Rollback (v2.6.0):**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --rollback  # Auto-detects latest backups\n./wp-migrate.sh --rollback --rollback-backup /path/to/specific/backup  # Specific backup\n./wp-migrate.sh --rollback --yes  # Skip confirmation for automation\n```\n\n**Automation-Friendly (v2.6.0):**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --archive /path/to/backup.zip --yes --quiet  # CI/CD: skip prompts, no progress bars\n```\n\n### Testing\n\n**Run all tests:**\n```bash\nmake test\n```\n\n**Run specific test:**\n```bash\n./test-wp-migrate.sh\n```\n\n**ShellCheck validation:**\n```bash\nshellcheck wp-migrate.sh\n```\n\n### Development Workflow\n\n#### Code Structure (v2+)\nThe project uses a modular source structure:\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── header.sh           # Shebang, defaults, variable declarations\n├── lib/\n│   ├── core.sh         # Core utilities (log, err, validate_url)\n│   ├── functions.sh    # All other functions\n│   └── adapters/       # Archive format adapters\n│       ├── README.md\n│       ├── duplicator.sh\n│       ├── jetpack.sh\n│       └── solidbackups.sh\n└── main.sh             # Argument parsing and main execution\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Modifications should be made in `src/` files, NOT in `wp-migrate.sh` directly.\n\n#### Build Process\n\nAfter modifying source files:\n```bash\nmake build\n```\n\nThis will:\n1. Run shellcheck on concatenated source\n2. Concatenate src/ files into dist/wp-migrate.sh\n3. Copy to ./wp-migrate.sh (repo root)\n4. Generate SHA256 checksum\n\n#### Pre-commit Hook\nA pre-commit hook prevents committing source changes without rebuilding:\n```bash\nln -s ../../.githooks/pre-commit .git/hooks/pre-commit\n```\n\n### Git Workflow\n\n1. **Branching**: Create from main using descriptive names:\n   - `feature/<slug>` for enhancements\n   - `fix/<slug>` for bug fixes\n   - `docs/<slug>` for documentation\n   - `chore/<slug>` for maintenance\n\n2. **Commits**: Use .gitmessage template format:\n   ```\n   type: short imperative summary\n\n   Longer explanation if needed\n   ```\n\n   Types: feat, fix, docs, chore, refactor, test\n\n3. **Changelog**: Update CHANGELOG.md under [Unreleased] section with every feature or fix\n\n4. **Pull Requests**:\n   - Use .github/pull_request_template.md checklist\n   - Include comprehensive summary based on ALL commits (not just latest)\n   - Include test plan with verification steps\n   - Reference related issues\n\n5. **Merging**: Keep main release-ready with `git merge --no-ff` or squash after review\n\n6. **Releases**: Tag with semantic versioning (e.g., `git tag v2.7.0`)\n\n### Creating Pull Requests\n\nWhen creating PRs, ensure:\n- Review ALL commits in the branch (use `git log main..HEAD` and `git diff main...HEAD`)\n- Summary covers complete scope of changes\n- Test plan verifies all functionality\n- CHANGELOG.md is updated\n- ShellCheck passes\n- Tests pass (make test)\n\n### Common Files to Check\n\n- [wp-migrate.sh](wp-migrate.sh) - Main script (built artifact, don''t edit directly)\n- [src/](src/) - Modular source files (edit these)\n- [src/lib/adapters/](src/lib/adapters/) - Archive format adapters\n- [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) - Version history\n- [README.md](README.md) - User documentation\n- [Makefile](Makefile) - Build and test targets\n- [test-wp-migrate.sh](test-wp-migrate.sh) - Test script\n\n## Troubleshooting Guide\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Permission Errors on Managed Hosts (StellarSites)**\n- Symptom: \"Permission denied\" when syncing wp-content\n- Solution: Use `--stellarsites` flag to exclude protected mu-plugins\n- Details: Managed hosts protect certain mu-plugins directories (e.g., `stellarsites-cloud`)\n\n**Database Import Fails**\n- Check table prefix alignment (script auto-detects and updates wp-config.php)\n- Verify sufficient disk space (3x archive size for archive mode)\n- Check MySQL max_allowed_packet size for large imports\n\n**URL Search-Replace Issues**\n- Use `--verbose` to see detected URLs\n- Override with `--dest-home-url` or `--dest-site-url` if detection fails\n- Use `--no-search-replace` for faster migrations that only need home/siteurl updated\n\n**Archive Detection Fails**\n- Use explicit `--archive-type` to specify format (duplicator, jetpack, solidbackups)\n- Verify archive structure matches adapter expectations (see src/lib/adapters/)\n- Check detailed validation errors with --verbose (v2.6.0+)\n\n**Non-Interactive Context Failures (v2.6.0)**\n- Symptom: Script exits with \"This script requires a TTY for confirmation prompts\"\n- Solution: Add `--yes` flag when running in CI/CD, cron, or pipeline contexts\n- Details: Migration preview and rollback require confirmation by default; use --yes to bypass\n\n**Rollback Issues (v2.6.0)**\n- Auto-detection looks for latest timestamped backups in db-backups/ and wp-content.backup-*\n- If backups aren''t found, use `--rollback-backup /path/to/backup` to specify explicitly\n- Rollback only works for archive mode migrations (restores from local backups)\n\n**SSH Connection Issues**\n- Add custom SSH options with `--ssh-opt` (can be repeated)\n- Examples: `--ssh-opt ''Port=2222''` or `--ssh-opt ''ProxyJump=bastion''`\n\n**ShellCheck Errors**\n- Install ShellCheck: `brew install shellcheck` (macOS) or see https://www.shellcheck.net/\n- Run: `shellcheck wp-migrate.sh`\n- All code must be ShellCheck-clean before merging\n\n### Debugging Commands\n\n**Show verbose migration preview:**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --dest-host user@dest --dest-root /var/www/site --dry-run --verbose\n```\n\n**Show every command (trace mode):**\n```bash\n./wp-migrate.sh --dest-host user@dest --dest-root /var/www/site --dry-run --trace\n```\n\n**Check archive structure:**\n```bash\nunzip -l /path/to/backup.zip | head -50\ntar -tzf /path/to/backup.tar.gz | head -50\n```\n\n**Verify wp-cli on destination:**\n```bash\nssh user@dest ''cd /var/www/site && wp core version''\n```\n\n## Archive Adapter System\n\nThe script uses an extensible adapter system for different backup formats.\n\n### Supported Formats\n\n1. **Duplicator**: ZIP archives with `dup-installer/dup-database__*.sql` structure\n2. **Jetpack Backup**: ZIP/TAR.GZ archives with `sql/*.sql` multi-file structure\n3. **Solid Backups**: ZIP archives with split SQL in `wp-content/uploads/backupbuddy_temp/{ID}/`\n\n### Adding New Adapters\n\nSee [src/lib/adapters/README.md](src/lib/adapters/README.md) for contributor guide.\n\nEach adapter must implement:\n- `validate_<adapter>()` - Check if file matches format\n- `extract_<adapter>()` - Extract archive to temp directory\n- `detect_db_<adapter>()` - Find database file(s)\n- `detect_wp_content_<adapter>()` - Find wp-content directory\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### When Assisting with Code Changes\n\n1. **Always check if source files need modification** (src/) not wp-migrate.sh directly\n2. **Run `make build` after any source changes** to regenerate wp-migrate.sh\n3. **Run ShellCheck validation** before committing\n4. **Update CHANGELOG.md** for all features and fixes\n5. **Use TodoWrite** to track multi-step tasks\n6. **Create focused PRs** addressing single concerns\n\n### When Testing Migrations\n\n1. **Always start with dry-run** to preview operations\n2. **Use verbose mode** for troubleshooting (--verbose or --trace)\n3. **Verify backups** before destructive operations\n4. **Test rollback procedures** in safe environments\n5. **Check logs** in logs/ directory after migrations\n\n### When Creating Releases\n\n1. **Update CHANGELOG.md** with version number and date\n2. **Create git tag** with semantic version (e.g., v2.7.0)\n3. **Generate GitHub release** with changelog excerpt\n4. **Verify tests pass** on clean checkout\n5. **Update README** if user-facing changes exist\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Searching Code\nUse Grep tool for code searches:\n```\npattern: \"function_name\"\noutput_mode: \"content\"\n-n: true (show line numbers)\n```\n\n### Reading Source Files\nUse Read tool for file contents:\n```\nfile_path: /Volumes/personal/codeprojects/bash/wp-migrate/src/lib/functions.sh\n```\n\n### Editing Code\nUse Edit tool for precise changes:\n```\nfile_path: /Volumes/personal/codeprojects/bash/wp-migrate/src/lib/functions.sh\nold_string: \"exact match from file\"\nnew_string: \"replacement text\"\n```\n\n### Running Git Commands\n```bash\ngit status\ngit diff main...HEAD  # See all changes in branch\ngit log main..HEAD    # See all commits in branch\n```\n\n## Critical Reminders\n\n- **NEVER edit wp-migrate.sh directly** - edit files in src/ instead\n- **ALWAYS run `make build`** after source changes\n- **ALWAYS update CHANGELOG.md** for features and fixes\n- **ALWAYS run ShellCheck** before committing (make test)\n- **ALWAYS commit both source AND built files** together\n- **ALWAYS review ALL commits** when creating PRs (not just latest commit)\n- **ALWAYS use TodoWrite** for multi-step tasks to track progress\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:58:23.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress Management Agents requiring seamless site migration capabilities via SSH and archive import modes.","zh":"适用于需要通过SSH和存档导入模式实现无缝站点迁移的WordPress管理代理的理想选择。","ja":"SSHとアーカイブインポートモードを介した無шовなサイト移行機能を必要とするWordPress管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"SSH와 아카이브 가져오기 모드를 통해 무중단 사이트 마이그레이션 기능을 필요로 하는 워드프레스 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de WordPress que requieren capacidades de migración de sitios sin problemas a través de SSH y modos de importación de archivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de WordPress nécessitant des capacités de migration de site sans interruption via SSH et des modes d''importation d''archives.","de":"Ideal für WordPress-Management-Agents, die eine nahtlose Migration von Websites über SSH und Archiv-Importmodi erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento do WordPress que requerem capacidades de migração de site sem interrupção via SSH e modos de importação de arquivos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления WordPress, требующих бесшовных возможностей миграции сайтов через SSH и режимы импорта архивов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة ووردبريس التي تتطلب قدرات نقل موقع دون انقطاع عبر SSH ووضعيات استيراد الأرشيف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WordPress migrations with SSH push and archive import modes, handling database updates, URL replacements, and wp-content synchronization using protocols like SSH and supporting file formats from Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, and Solid Backups.","zh":"赋予代理自动化WordPress迁移的能力，使用SSH推送和存档导入模式，处理数据库更新、URL替换和wp-content同步，支持SSH等协议和Duplicator、Jetpack Backup和Solid Backups的文件格式。","ja":"SSHプッシュとアーカイブインポートモードを使用して、データベースの更新、URLの置換、wp-contentの同期を行い、SSHなどのプロトコルとDuplicator、Jetpack Backup、Solid Backupsなどのファイル形式をサポートすることで、エージェントにWordPressの自動マイグレーションを可能にします。","ko":"SSH 푸시 및 아카이브 가져오기 모드를 사용하여 데이터베이스 업데이트, URL 대체 및 wp-content 동기화를 처리하고 SSH 등의 프로토콜과 Duplicator, Jetpack Backup 및 Solid Backups 등의 파일 형식을 지원하여 에이전트가 워드프레스 자동 마이그레이션을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las migraciones de WordPress con modos de push SSH y de importación de archivos, manejo de actualizaciones de bases de datos, reemplazos de URL y sincronización de wp-content utilizando protocolos como SSH y formatos de archivo compatibles con Duplicator, Jetpack Backup y Solid Backups.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les migrations de WordPress avec des modes de push SSH et d''importation d''archives, en gérant les mises à jour de bases de données, les remplacements d''URL et la synchronisation de wp-content en utilisant des protocoles comme SSH et des formats de fichiers pris en charge par Duplicator, Jetpack Backup et Solid Backups.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, WordPress-Migrationen mit SSH-Push- und Archiv-Importmodi zu automatisieren, wobei Datenbankaktualisierungen, URL-Ersetzungen und wp-content-Synchronisation mithilfe von Protokollen wie SSH und unterstützten Dateiformaten von Duplicator, Jetpack Backup und Solid Backups durchgeführt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar migrações do WordPress com modos de push SSH e importação de arquivos, lidando com atualizações de banco de dados, substituições de URL e sincronização do wp-content usando protocolos como SSH e suportando formatos de arquivo do Duplicator, Jetpack Backup e Solid Backups.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать миграции WordPress с помощью режимов SSH-передачи и импорта архивов, обрабатывая обновления базы данных, замену URL и синхронизацию wp-content с использованием протоколов, таких как SSH, и поддерживая форматы файлов от Duplicator, Jetpack Backup и Solid Backups.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تلقين نقل ووردبريس باستخدام أوضاع دفع SSH واستيراد الأرشيف، وتعامل مع تحديثات قاعدة البيانات واستبدال عنوان URL وتزامن wp-content باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل SSH ودعم تنسيقات الملفات من Duplicator و Jetpack Backup و Solid Backups."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating WordPress sites between servers via SSH","Importing WordPress backup archives on destination servers","Automating database handling and URL replacement during migration"],"zh":["通过SSH在服务器之间迁移WordPress站点","在目标服务器上导入WordPress备份存档","在迁移过程中自动处理数据库和URL替换"],"ja":["SSHを介してサーバー間でWordPressサイトを移行する","目的のサーバーにWordPressバックアップアーカイブをインポートする","移行中にデータベースとURLの置換を自動で処理する"],"ko":["SSH를 통해 서버 간 워드프레스 사이트 마이그레이션","목적 서버에 워드프레스 백업 아카이브 가져오기","마이그레이션 중 데이터베이스 및 URL 대체 자동 처리"],"es":["Migrar sitios de WordPress entre servidores a través de SSH","Importar archivos de respaldo de WordPress en servidores de destino","Automatizar el manejo de bases de datos y el reemplazo de URL durante la migración"],"fr":["Migrer des sites WordPress entre serveurs via SSH","Importer des archives de sauvegarde de WordPress sur des serveurs de destination","Automatiser la gestion des bases de données et le remplacement d''URL pendant la migration"],"de":["WordPress-Sites zwischen Servern über SSH migrieren","WordPress-Sicherungsarchivdateien auf Zielservern importieren","Automatisierung der Datenbankverwaltung und der URL-Ersetzung während der Migration"],"pt":["Migrar sites do WordPress entre servidores via SSH","Importar arquivos de backup do WordPress nos servidores de destino","Automatizar manipulação de banco de dados e substituição de URL durante a migração"],"ru":["Перемещать сайты WordPress между серверами через SSH","Импортировать архивы резервного копирования WordPress на целевые серверы","Автоматизировать обработку базы данных и замену URL-адреса во время миграции"],"ar":["نقل مواقع ووردبريس بين الخواديم عبر SSH","استيراد أرشيفات النسخ الاحتياطي لووردبريس على خواديم الوجهة","تلقين التعامل مع قاعدة البيانات واستبدال عنوان URL أثناء النقل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH access for push mode","Limited to WordPress platform","Dependent on specific backup archive formats like Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, and Solid Backups"],"zh":["需要SSH访问以使用推送模式","仅限于WordPress平台","依赖于特定的备份存档格式，如Duplicator、Jetpack Backup和Solid Backups"],"ja":["プッシュモードを使用するにはSSHアクセスが必要","WordPressプラットフォームのみに限定","Duplicator、Jetpack Backup、Solid Backupsなどの特定のバックアップアーカイブ形式に依存"],"ko":["푸시 모드를 사용하려면 SSH 액세스가 필요함","워드프레스 플랫폼만 해당","Duplicator, Jetpack Backup, Solid Backups 등의 특정 백업 아카이브 형식에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso SSH para el modo de push","Limitado a la plataforma de WordPress","Dependiente de formatos de archivo de respaldo específicos como Duplicator, Jetpack Backup y Solid Backups"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès SSH pour le mode de push","Limité à la plateforme WordPress","Dépendant de formats de fichiers de sauvegarde spécifiques tels que Duplicator, Jetpack Backup et Solid Backups"],"de":["Benötigt SSH-Zugriff für den Push-Modus","Begrenzt auf die WordPress-Plattform","Abhängig von spezifischen Sicherungsarchiv-Dateiformaten wie Duplicator, Jetpack Backup und Solid Backups"],"pt":["Requer acesso SSH para modo de push","Limitado à plataforma do WordPress","Dependente de formatos de arquivo de backup específicos como Duplicator, Jetpack Backup e Solid Backups"],"ru":["Требует доступа SSH для режима передачи","Ограничен платформой WordPress","Зависит от конкретных форматов файлов резервного копирования, таких как Duplicator, Jetpack Backup и Solid Backups"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى SSH لنمط الدفع","محدود بالمنصة ووردبريس","يعتمد على تنسيقات أرشيف النسخ الاحتياطي المحددة مثل Duplicator و Jetpack Backup و Solid Backups"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ef1e5b04d63389b0a12ebe61d71cfddb33ba3831d8fb8c8ea9f77142dc915c92","qualityScore":42}');
