des outils de développement","Code open source et gratuit","Support pour plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Optimierung von Abonnements","Analyse der Anwendungsnutzung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Open-Source- und kostenlos","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen"],"pt":["Controle de assinaturas","Otimização de uso","Código aberto","Integração com Tauri","Economia de dinheiro"],"ru":["Контроль подписок","Оптимизация использования","Открытый код","Интеграция с Tauri","Экономия денег"],"ar":["التحكم في الاشتراكات","تحسين الاستخدام","الكود المفتوح","التكامل مع Tauri","توفير المال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tauri 开发","AI 工具","订阅费用优化","OpenUsage","免费开源","如何使用 Tauri","Tauri 开发教程","AI 驱动的优化","Tauri 开发框架"],"ja":["Tauri 開発","AI エージェント","サブスクリプションのコスト最適化","OpenUsage","無料のオープンソース","Tauri の使用方法","Tauri 開発チュートリアル","AI ドライブの最適化","Tauri 開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Tauri 개발","AI 에이전트","구독 비용 최적화","OpenUsage","무료 오픈소스","Tauri 사용법","Tauri 개발 튜토리얼","AI 구동의 최적화","Tauri 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["desarrollo de Tauri","herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","optimización de suscripciones","análisis de uso de aplicaciones","código abierto y gratuito","alternativas a Tauri","instalación de Tauri","guía de configuración de Tauri"],"fr":["développement Tauri","outils d''Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","optimisation des abonnements","analyse de l''utilisation des applications","code open source et gratuit","alternatives à Tauri","installation de Tauri","guide de configuration de Tauri"],"de":["Tauri-Entwicklung","KI-Agent-Tools","Optimierung von Abonnements","Analyse der Anwendungsnutzung","Open-Source- und kostenlos","Alternativen zu Tauri","Installation von Tauri","Konfigurationsanleitung für Tauri"],"pt":["desenvolvimento Tauri","ferramentas de IA","controle de assinaturas","otimização de uso","código aberto","como usar OpenUsage","OpenUsage vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação OpenUsage"],"ru":["разработка Tauri","ИИ инструменты","контроль подписок","оптимизация использования","открытый код","как использовать OpenUsage","OpenUsage vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке OpenUsage"],"ar":["تطوير Tauri","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحكم في الاشتراكات","تحسين الاستخدام","الكود المفتوح","كيفية استخدام OpenUsage","OpenUsage مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت OpenUsage"]}},"owner":"robinebers","repo":"openusage","repoPath":"robinebers/openusage","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.736Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tauri-development","description":"Tauri development guidelines for building cross-platform desktop applications with TypeScript, Rust, and modern web technologies","bodyPreview":"# Tauri Development Guidelines\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript and Rust development for cross-platform desktop applications using Tauri.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Write clean, maintainable TypeScript and Rust code\n- Use TailwindCSS and ShadCN-UI for styling\n- Follow step-by-step planning for complex features\n- Prioritize code quality, security, and performance\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **Frontend**: TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS, ShadCN-UI\n- **Backend**: Rust, Tauri APIs\n- **Build**: Tauri","body":"# Tauri Development Guidelines\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript and Rust development for cross-platform desktop applications using Tauri.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Write clean, maintainable TypeScript and Rust code\n- Use TailwindCSS and ShadCN-UI for styling\n- Follow step-by-step planning for complex features\n- Prioritize code quality, security, and performance\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **Frontend**: TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS, ShadCN-UI\n- **Backend**: Rust, Tauri APIs\n- **Build**: Tauri CLI, Vite/Webpack\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── app/                # Next.js app directory\n├── components/         # React components\n│   ├── ui/            # ShadCN-UI components\n│   └── features/      # Feature-specific components\n├── hooks/             # Custom React hooks\n├── lib/               # Utility functions\n├── styles/            # Global styles\nsrc-tauri/\n├── src/               # Rust source code\n│   ├── main.rs       # Entry point\n│   └── commands/     # Tauri commands\n├── Cargo.toml        # Rust dependencies\n└── tauri.conf.json   # Tauri configuration\n```\n\n## TypeScript Guidelines\n\n### Code Style\n- Use functional components with TypeScript\n- Define proper interfaces for all data structures\n- Use async/await for asynchronous operations\n- Implement proper error handling\n\n### Tauri Integration\n```typescript\nimport { invoke } from ''@tauri-apps/api/tauri'';\n\n// Call Rust commands from frontend\nconst result = await invoke<string>(''my_command'', { arg: ''value'' });\n\n// Listen to events from Rust\nimport { listen } from ''@tauri-apps/api/event'';\nawait listen(''event-name'', (event) => {\n  console.log(event.payload);\n});\n```\n\n## Rust Guidelines\n\n### Command Definitions\n```rust\n#[tauri::command]\nfn my_command(arg: String) -> Result<String, String> {\n    // Implementation\n    Ok(format!(\"Received: {}\", arg))\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    tauri::Builder::default()\n        .invoke_handler(tauri::generate_handler![my_command])\n        .run(tauri::generate_context!())\n        .expect(\"error while running tauri application\");\n}\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n- Use Result types for fallible operations\n- Define custom error types when needed\n- Propagate errors appropriately\n- Log errors for debugging\n\n### Security\n- Validate all inputs from the frontend\n- Use Tauri''s security features (CSP, allowlist)\n- Minimize permissions in tauri.conf.json\n- Sanitize file paths and user inputs\n\n## UI Development\n\n### TailwindCSS\n- Use utility-first approach\n- Implement responsive design\n- Use dark mode support\n- Follow consistent spacing and sizing\n\n### ShadCN-UI Components\n- Use pre-built accessible components\n- Customize with TailwindCSS\n- Maintain consistent theming\n- Follow accessibility best practices\n\n## State Management\n\n- Use React Context for global state\n- Consider Zustand for complex state\n- Keep state close to where it''s used\n- Implement proper state synchronization with Rust\n\n## File System Operations\n\n```rust\nuse std::fs;\nuse tauri::api::path::app_data_dir;\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn read_file(path: String) -> Result<String, String> {\n    fs::read_to_string(&path)\n        .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n}\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn write_file(path: String, content: String) -> Result<(), String> {\n    fs::write(&path, content)\n        .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n}\n```\n\n## Building and Distribution\n\n- Configure proper app metadata\n- Set up code signing for distribution\n- Use Tauri''s updater for auto-updates\n- Test on all target platforms\n\n## Performance\n\n- Minimize IPC calls between frontend and Rust\n- Use batch operations where possible\n- Implement proper caching\n- Profile and optimize hot paths\n\n## Testing\n\n- Write unit tests for Rust commands\n- Test frontend components\n- Implement integration tests\n- Test on all target platforms\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:21.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing advanced desktop application development with TypeScript and Rust","zh":"适合需要使用TypeScript和Rust进行高级桌面应用开发的跨平台代理","ja":"TypeScriptとRustを使用した高度なデスクトップアプリケーション開発を必要とするクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript와 Rust를 사용하여 고급 데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio avanzadas con TypeScript y Rust","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plate-forme croisée nécessitant un développement d''applications de bureau avancé avec TypeScript et Rust","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die erweiterte Desktop-Anwendungsentwicklung mit TypeScript und Rust benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cross-Platform que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos de desktop avançados com TypeScript e Rust","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, которым необходим продвинутый разработка настольных приложений с помощью TypeScript и Rust","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعدد المنصات الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب متقدمة باستخدام TypeScript وRust"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance, secure, and maintainable cross-platform desktop applications using Tauri, leveraging TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS, and ShadCN-UI for frontend development, and Rust for backend development with Tauri APIs","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能、安全、可维护的跨平台桌面应用的能力，使用Tauri，利用TypeScript、React/Next.js、TailwindCSS和ShadCN-UI进行前端开发，并使用Rust和Tauri APIs进行后端开发","ja":"エージェントが高パフォーマンス、セキュア、メンテナンスの容易なクロスプラットフォームデスクトップアプリケーションを構築できるようにすることで、Tauriを使用し、TypeScript、React/Next.js、TailwindCSS、ShadCN-UIを使用したフロントエンド開発、およびRustとTauri APIsを使用したバックエンド開発","ko":"에이전트가 높은 성능, 보안 및 유지 관리가 가능한 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하는 것으로, Tauri를 사용하여 TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS 및 ShadCN-UI를 사용한 프론트엔드 개발 및 Rust와 Tauri APIs를 사용한 백엔드 개발","es":"Habilita a los agentes para crear aplicaciones de escritorio de plataforma cruzada de alto rendimiento, seguras y mantenibles utilizando Tauri, aprovechando TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS y ShadCN-UI para el desarrollo frontend, y Rust para el desarrollo backend con APIs de Tauri","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de bureau de plate-forme croisée à haute performance, sécurisées et maintenables en utilisant Tauri, en exploitant TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS et ShadCN-UI pour le développement frontend, et Rust pour le développement backend avec les API Tauri","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochleistungsfähige, sichere und wartbare Cross-Platform-Desktop-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie Tauri verwenden, TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS und ShadCN-UI für die Frontend-Entwicklung und Rust für die Backend-Entwicklung mit Tauri-APIs nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam aplicativos de desktop cross-platform de alto desempenho, seguros e mantidos usando Tauri, aproveitando TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS e ShadCN-UI para desenvolvimento frontend e Rust para desenvolvimento backend com APIs Tauri","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать высокопроизводительные, безопасные и поддерживаемые кроссплатформенные настольные приложения, используя Tauri, с использованием TypeScript, React/Next.js, TailwindCSS и ShadCN-UI для разработки frontend и Rust для разработки backend с API Tauri","ar":"يمكن للعميل بناء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات عالية الأداء وأمنة ومدارة باستخدام Tauri، واستخدام TypeScript وReact/Next.js وTailwindCSS وShadCN-UI لتطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية، واستخدام Rust لتطوير الخلفية مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات Tauri"},"useCases":{"en":["Building cross-platform desktop applications with Tauri and TypeScript","Implementing responsive and customizable UI components using TailwindCSS and ShadCN-UI","Developing high-performance backend services using Rust and Tauri APIs"],"zh":["使用Tauri和TypeScript构建跨平台桌面应用","使用TailwindCSS和ShadCN-UI实现响应式和可定制的UI组件","使用Rust和Tauri APIs开发高性能的后端服务"],"ja":["TauriとTypeScriptを使用したクロスプラットフォームデスクトップアプリケーションの構築","TailwindCSSとShadCN-UIを使用したレスポンシブでカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントの実装","RustとTauri APIsを使用した高パフォーマンスのバックエンドサービスの開発"],"ko":["Tauri와 TypeScript를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션 구축","TailwindCSS와 ShadCN-UI를 사용하여 반응형 및 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구현","Rust와 Tauri APIs를 사용하여 고성능 백엔드 서비스 개발"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de escritorio de plataforma cruzada con Tauri y TypeScript","Implementación de componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos y personalizables utilizando TailwindCSS y ShadCN-UI","Desarrollo de servicios backend de alto rendimiento utilizando Rust y APIs de Tauri"],"fr":["Création d''applications de bureau de plate-forme croisée avec Tauri et TypeScript","Mise en œuvre de composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs et personnalisables en utilisant TailwindCSS et ShadCN-UI","Développement de services backend à haute performance en ut