 headless mode."},"features":{"zh":["生成代码","修复bug","审查代码","添加测试","支持Node.js开发","支持交互式和无头模式"],"ja":["コード生成","バグ修正","コードレビュー","テスト追加","Node.js開発サポート","インタラクティブモードとヘッドレスモードのサポート"],"ko":["코드 생성","버그 수정","코드 검토","테스트 추가","Node.js 개발 지원","인터랙티브 모드와 헤드리스 모드 지원"],"es":["Generación de código","Corrección de errores","Revisión de código","Adición de pruebas","Modo interactivo y headless"],"fr":["Génération de code","Correction d''erreurs","Révision de code","Ajout de tests","Mode interactif et headless"],"de":["Code-Generierung","Fehlerkorrektur","Code-Überprüfung","Hinzufügen von Tests","Interaktiver und headless-Modus"],"pt":["Geração de código personalizado","Correção de bugs e revisão de código","Adição de testes e validação","Modo interativo e headless","Integração com Nodebridge"],"ru":["Генерация пользовательского кода","Исправление ошибок и проверка кода","Добавление тестов и валидация","Интерактивный и безголовый режим","Интеграция с Nodebridge"],"ar":["إنشاء رمز مخصص","تصحيح الأخطاء ومراجعة الرمز","إضافة اختبارات و التحقق","الوضع التفاعلي و بدون رأس","التكامل مع Nodebridge"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Neovate Code","add-nodebridge-handler","Node.js开发","代码生成","bug修复","代码审查","测试添加","如何使用Neovate Code"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Neovate Code","add-nodebridge-handler","Node.js開発","コード生成","バグ修正","コードレビュー","テスト追加","Neovate Codeの使い方"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Neovate Code","add-nodebridge-handler","Node.js 개발","코드 생성","버그 수정","코드 검토","테스트 추가","Neovate Code 사용법"],"es":["agente AI para desarrolladores","herramientas de desarrollo","Neovate Code","generar código","corregir errores","add-nodebridge-handler alternativa","add-nodebridge-handler vs competidores","instalar add-nodebridge-handler","guía de configuración de add-nodebridge-handler"],"fr":["outil IA pour développeurs","outils de développement","Neovate Code","générer du code","corriger des erreurs","add-nodebridge-handler alternative","add-nodebridge-handler vs concurrents","installer add-nodebridge-handler","guide de configuration de add-nodebridge-handler"],"de":["KI-Tool für Entwickler","Entwicklungstools","Neovate Code","Code generieren","Fehler korrigieren","add-nodebridge-handler Alternative","add-nodebridge-handler vs Wettbewerber","add-nodebridge-handler installieren","Konfigurationsanleitung für add-nodebridge-handler"],"pt":["como usar Neovate Code","o que é Nodebridge Handler","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para Nodebridge","guia de instalação do Neovate Code","configuração do Nodebridge"],"ru":["как использовать Neovate Code","что такое Nodebridge Handler","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для Nodebridge","руководство по установке Neovate Code","настройка Nodebridge"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Neovate Code","ما هو Nodebridge Handler","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل ل Nodebridge","دليل تركيب Neovate Code","إعداد Nodebridge"]}},"owner":"neovateai","repo":"neovate-code","repoPath":"neovateai/neovate-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.767Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-nodebridge-handler","description":"Use this skill when adding a new NodeBridge handler to src/nodeBridge.ts, including updating types in src/nodeBridge.types.ts and optionally testing with scripts/test-nodebridge.ts","bodyPreview":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  con","body":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n  \n  // Implementation logic here\n  \n  return {\n    success: true,\n    data: {\n      // Return data\n    },\n  };\n});\n```\n\n**Handler Naming Convention:**\n- Use dot notation: `category.action` (e.g., `git.status`, `session.send`, `utils.getPaths`)\n- Categories: `config`, `git`, `mcp`, `models`, `outputStyles`, `project`, `projects`, `providers`, `session`, `sessions`, `slashCommand`, `status`, `utils`\n\n**Common Patterns:**\n- Always get context via `await this.getContext(cwd)`\n- Return `{ success: true, data: {...} }` for success\n- Return `{ success: false, error: ''message'' }` for errors\n- Wrap in try/catch for error handling\n\n### 2. Add Type Definitions in `src/nodeBridge.types.ts`\n\nAdd input and output types near the relevant section:\n\n```typescript\n// ============================================================================\n// Category Handlers\n// ============================================================================\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  // other required params\n  optionalParam?: string;\n};\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    // return data shape\n  };\n};\n```\n\nThen add to the `HandlerMap` type:\n\n```typescript\nexport type HandlerMap = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  \n  // Category handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': {\n    input: CategoryHandlerNameInput;\n    output: CategoryHandlerNameOutput;\n  };\n};\n```\n\n### 3. (Optional) Add to Test Script\n\nUpdate `scripts/test-nodebridge.ts` HANDLERS object if the handler should be easily testable:\n\n```typescript\nconst HANDLERS: Record<string, string> = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': ''Description of what this handler does'',\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Test the Handler\n\nRun the test script:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --cwd=/path/to/dir --param=value\n```\n\nOr with JSON data:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --data=''{\"cwd\":\"/path\",\"param\":\"value\"}''\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Handler Addition\n\n### nodeBridge.ts\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''utils.example'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, name } = data;\n  try {\n    const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n    \n    // Do something with context and params\n    const result = await someOperation(name);\n    \n    return {\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        result,\n      },\n    };\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    return {\n      success: false,\n      error: error.message || ''Failed to execute example'',\n    };\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### nodeBridge.types.ts\n```typescript\ntype UtilsExampleInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  name: string;\n};\n\ntype UtilsExampleOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    result: string;\n  };\n};\n\n// In HandlerMap:\n''utils.example'': {\n  input: UtilsExampleInput;\n  output: UtilsExampleOutput;\n};\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Handlers are async functions that receive `data` parameter\n- Use `this.getContext(cwd)` to get the Context instance (cached per cwd)\n- Context provides access to: `config`, `paths`, `mcpManager`, `productName`, `version`, etc.\n- For long-running operations, consider using abort controllers (see `git.clone` pattern)\n- For operations that emit progress, use `this.messageBus.emitEvent()` (see `git.commit.output` pattern)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:18:48.658Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js-based AI Agents needing seamless communication between the UI layer and backend.","zh":"非常适合基于 Node.js 的 AI Agent，需要在 UI 层和后端之间实现无缝通信。","ja":"UI レイヤーとバックエンド間のシームレスな通信を必要とする Node.js ベースの AI Agent に最適です。","ko":"UI 레이어와 백엔드 간의 원활한 통신이 필요한 Node.js 기반 AI Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para AI Agents basados en Node.js que necesitan una comunicación fluida entre la capa de UI y el backend.","fr":"Parfait pour les AI Agents basés sur Node.js nécessitant une communication transparente entre la couche d''interface utilisateur et le backend.","de":"Ideal für Node.js-basierte AI Agents, die eine nahtlose Kommunikation zwischen der UI-Schicht und dem Backend benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Node.js que necessitam de comunicação perfeita entre a camada de UI e o backend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов на базе Node.js, которым требуется беспрепятственная связь между уровнем пользовательского интерфейса и бэкендом.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي القائمة على Node.js التي تحتاج إلى اتصال سلس بين طبقة واجهة المستخدم والواجهة الخلفية (backend)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend the NodeBridge system with custom message handlers, enabling robust communication protocols and data exchange between the UI and Node.js backend using the messageBus registerHandler method.","zh":"使 Agent 能够通过自定义消息处理器扩展 NodeBridge 系统，从而利用 messageBus registerHandler 方法在 UI 和 Node.js 后端之间实现强大的通信协议和数据交换。","ja":"カスタムメッセージハンドラーを使用して NodeBridge システムを拡張し、messageBus registerHandler メソッドを利用して UI と Node.js バックエンド間の堅牢な通信プロトコルとデータ交換を実現することを可能にします。","ko":"사용자 정의 메시지 핸들러로 NodeBridge 시스템을 확장하여, messageBus registerHandler 메서드를 사용하여 UI와 Node.js 백엔드 간의 강력한 통신 프로토콜과 데이터 교환을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extender el sistema NodeBridge con manejadores de mensajes personalizados, permitiendo protocolos de comunicación robustos e intercambio de datos entre la UI y el backend de Node.js utilizando el método messageBus registerHandler.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre le système NodeBridge avec des gestionnaires de messages personnalisés, permettant des protocoles de communication robustes et un échange de données entre l''UI et le backend Node.js en utilisant la méthode messageBus registerHandler.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, das NodeBridge-System mit benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtenhandlern zu erweitern, was robuste Kommunikationsprotokolle und Datenaustausch zwischen der UI und dem Node.js-Backend unter Verwendung der messageBus registerHandler-Methode ermöglicht.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estendam o sistema NodeBridge com manipuladores de mensagens personalizados, possibilitando protocolos de comunicação robustos e troca de dados entre a UI e o backend Node.js usando o método messageBus registerHandler.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять систему NodeBridge с помощью пользовательских обработчиков сообщений, обеспечивая надежные протоколы связи и обмен данными между пользовательским интерфейсом и бэкендом Node.js с использованием метода messageBus registerHandler.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من توسيع نظام NodeBridge مع معالجات رسائل مخصصة، مما يتيح بروتوكولات اتصال قوية وتبادل البيانات بين واجهة المستخدم والواجهة الخلفية Node.js باستخدام طريقة messageBus registerHandler."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom UI-backend communication protocols","Registering handlers for specific message categories","Enhancing NodeBridge functionality with additional message handlers"],"zh":["实现自定义的 UI-后端通信协议","为特定消息类别注册处理器","通过额外的消息处理器增强 NodeBridge 功能"],"ja":["カスタム UI-バックエンド通信プロトコルの実装","特定のメッセージカテゴリのハンドラーの登録","追加のメッセージハンドラーによる NodeBridge 機能の拡張"],"ko":["사용자 정의 UI-백엔드 통신 프로토콜 구현","특정 메시지 카테고리에 대한 핸들러 등록","추가 메시지 핸들러로 NodeBridge 기능 향상"],"es":["Implementación de protocolos de comunicación personalizados entre la UI y el backend","Registro de manejadores para categorías de mensajes específicas","Mejora de la funcionalidad de NodeBridge con manejadores de mensajes adicionales"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de protocoles de communication personnalisés entre l''UI et le backend","Enregistrement de gestionnaires pour des catégories de messages spécifiques","Amélioration de la fonctionnalité NodeBridge avec des gestionnaires de messages supplémentaires"],"de":["Implementierung benutzerdefinierter UI-Backend-Kommunikationsprotokolle","Registrierung von Handlern für spezifische Nachrichtenkategorien","Erweiterung der NodeBridge-Funktionalität mit zusätzlichen Nachrichtenhandlern"],"pt":["Implementação de protocolos de comunicação personalizados entre UI e backend","Registro de manipuladores para categorias de mensagens específicas","Aprimoramento da funcionalidade do NodeBridge com manipuladores de mensagens adicionais"],"ru":["Реализация пользовательских протоколов связи между пользовательским интерфейсом и бэкендом","Регистрация обработчиков для определенных категорий сообщений","Расширение функциональности NodeBridge с помощью дополнительных обработчиков сообщений"],"ar":["تنفيذ بروتوكولات اتصال مخصصة بين واجهة المستخدم والواجهة الخلفية","تسجيل معالجات لفئات رسائل محددة","تعزيز وظائف NodeBridge مع معالجات رسائل إضافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the NodeBridge system","Needs knowledge of the NodeHandlerRegistry class and messageBus registerHandler method","Limited to Node.js backend environments"],"zh":["需要访问 NodeBridge 系统","需要了解 NodeHandlerRegistry 类和 messageBus registerHandler 方法","仅限于 Node.js 后端环境"],"ja":["NodeBridge システムへのアクセスが必要","NodeHandlerRegistry クラスと messageBus registerHandler メソッドに関する知識が必要","Node.js バックエンド環境に限定される"],"ko":["NodeBridge 시스템에 대한 액세스 필요","NodeHandlerRegistry 클래스 및 messageBus registerHandler 메서드에 대한 지식 필요","Node.js 백엔드 환경으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema NodeBridge","Necesita conocimiento de la clase NodeHandlerRegistry y del método messageBus registerHandler","Limitado a entornos de backend Node.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système NodeBridge","Requiert une connaissance de la classe NodeHandlerRegistry et de la méthode messageBus registerHandler","Limité aux environnements backend Node.js"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das NodeBridge-System","Erfordert Kenntnisse der NodeHandlerRegistry-Klasse und der messageBus registerHandler-Methode","Beschränkt auf Node.js-Backend-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema NodeBridge","Necessita conhecimento da classe NodeHandlerRegistry e do método messageBus registerHandler","Limitado a ambientes de backend Node.js"],"ru":["Требует доступа к системе NodeBridge","Требует знаний о классе NodeHandlerRegistry и методе messageBus registerHandler","Ограничено средами бэкенда Node.js"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام NodeBridge","يحتاج إلى معرفة بفئة NodeHandlerRegistry وطريقة messageBus registerHandler","مقتصر على بيئات الواجهة الخلفية Node.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"344bb3080885a5297fd49c39d3995e884ec562f74c582a6235fec55e26fc3926","qualityScore":42}');
