,"ru":"ИИ Агенты: Java Архитектор для Super Hero Battle Arena","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: مهندس معماري جافا لمعرض المعارك","en":"java-architect"},"description":{"zh":"Java架构师AI工具，用于创建超级英雄战斗竞技场应用，适用于Talent Arena工作坊","ja":"JavaアーキテクトAIエージェントを使用してスーパーヒーローバトルアリーナアプリを作成","ko":"자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 슈퍼히어로 배틀 아레나 애플리케이션을 생성","es":"El agente ''java-architect'' es una aplicación Java desarrollada para el taller de Talent Arena, diseñada para la batalla de superhéroes.","fr":"L''agent ''java-architect'' est une application Java développée pour l''atelier de Talent Arena, conçue pour la bataille de super-héros.","de":"Der Agent ''java-architect'' ist eine Java-Anwendung, die für das Talent Arena-Workshop entwickelt wurde und für die Superhelden-Schlacht konzipiert ist.","pt":"O arquiteto Java é uma aplicação feita para a oficina Talent Arena, projetada para demonstrar habilidades em programação Java.","ru":"Java архитектор - это приложение, созданное для мастерской Talent Arena, предназначенное для демонстрации навыков программирования на Java.","ar":"مهندس معماري جافا هو تطبيق تم إنشاؤه لمعرض المواهب، مصمم لاظهار مهارات البرمجة جافا.","en":"Super Hero Battle Arena - Java Application made for the Talent Arena workshop"},"definition":{"en":"Super Hero Battle Arena - Java Application made for the Talent Arena workshop"},"features":{"zh":["使用Java创建超级英雄战斗竞技场应用","适用于Talent Arena工作坊","体验AI工具的强大","支持多种功能和特性","易于使用和扩展"],"ja":["Javaを使用してスーパーヒーローバトルアリーナアプリを作成","Talent Arenaワークショップ用","AIエージェントの力","複数の機能と特性をサポート","使いやすく拡張可能"],"ko":["자바를 사용하여 슈퍼히어로 배틀 아레나 애플리케이션을 생성","Talent Arena 워크샵을 위한","AI 에이전트의 강력한 기능","다양한 기능과 특성을 지원","사용하기 쉽고 확장 가능"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones Java","Arquitectura de software","Herramienta de código abierto","Diseñada para la batalla de superhéroes","Aplicación desarrollada para el taller de Talent Arena","Utiliza inteligencia artificial para el diseño de arquitecturas"],"fr":["Développement d''applications Java","Architecture logicielle","Outil open source","Conçue pour la bataille de super-héros","Application développée pour l''atelier de Talent Arena","Utilise l''intelligence artificielle pour la conception d''architectures"],"de":["Entwicklung von Java-Anwendungen","Software-Architektur","Open-Source-Tool","Für die Superhelden-Schlacht konzipiert","Anwendung entwickelt für das Talent Arena-Workshop","Verwendet künstliche Intelligenz für den Entwurf von Architekturen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Java","Arquitetura de software","Programação orientada a objetos","Integração com banco de dados","Desenvolvimento de interfaces gráficas"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Java","Архитектура программного обеспечения","Объектно-ориентированное программирование","Интеграция с базой данных","Разработка графических интерфейсов"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات جافا","هندسة البرمجيات","برمجة الكائنات المنحى","التكامل مع قاعدة البيانات","تطوير واجهات المستخدم الرسومية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java架构师AI工具","怎么使用Java创建应用","什么是AI工具","Java架构师AI工具替代","Java架构师AI工具安装","Java架构师AI工具设置指南"],"ja":["JavaアーキテクトAIエージェント","Javaを使用してアプリを作成する方法","AIエージェントとは","JavaアーキテクトAIエージェントの代替","JavaアーキテクトAIエージェントのインストール","JavaアーキテクトAIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트","자바를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 생성하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트의 대체","자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트의 설치","자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트의 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","arquitecto Java","desarrollo de aplicaciones Java","qué es un agente de AI","cómo usar herramientas de AI","alternativas a Java","Java vs Python","instalación de Java","guía de configuración de Java"],"fr":["outils IA","architecte Java","développement d''applications Java","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","comment utiliser des outils IA","alternatives à Java","Java vs Python","installation de Java","guide de configuration de Java"],"de":["KI-Tools","Java-Architekt","Entwicklung von Java-Anwendungen","was ist ein KI-Agent","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu Java","Java vs Python","Installation von Java","Konfigurationsanleitung für Java"],"pt":["como usar java","o que é arquiteto java","java vs python","guia de instalação java","alternativas para java","java para desenvolvedores","curso de java","java para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать java","что такое java архитектор","java vs python","руководство по установке java","альтернативы java","java для разработчиков","курс java","java для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام جافا","ما هو مهندس معماري جافا","جافا مقابل بايثون","دليل تثبيت جافا","بديل جافا","جافا للمطورين","دورة جافا","جافا للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"anyulled","repo":"superhero-battle-arena","repoPath":"anyulled/superhero-battle-arena","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.774Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"java-architect","description":"Use when building enterprise Java applications with Spring Boot 3.x, microservices, or reactive programming. Invoke for WebFlux, JPA optimization, Spring Security, cloud-native patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n-","body":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Spring Boot microservices\n- Implementing reactive WebFlux applications\n- Optimizing JPA/Hibernate performance\n- Designing event-driven architectures\n- Setting up Spring Security with OAuth2/JWT\n- Creating cloud-native applications\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Architecture analysis** - Review project structure, dependencies, Spring config\n2. **Domain design** - Create models following DDD and Clean Architecture\n3. **Implementation** - Build services with Spring Boot best practices\n4. **Data layer** - Optimize JPA queries, implement repositories\n5. **Quality assurance** - Test with JUnit 5, TestContainers, achieve 85%+ coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Spring Boot | `references/spring-boot-setup.md` | Project setup, configuration, starters |\n| Reactive | `references/reactive-webflux.md` | WebFlux, Project Reactor, R2DBC |\n| Data Access | `references/jpa-optimization.md` | JPA, Hibernate, query tuning |\n| Security | `references/spring-security.md` | OAuth2, JWT, method security |\n| Testing | `references/testing-patterns.md` | JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use Java 21 LTS features (records, sealed classes, pattern matching)\n- Apply Clean Architecture and SOLID principles\n- Use Spring Boot 3.x with proper dependency injection\n- Write comprehensive tests (JUnit 5, Mockito, TestContainers)\n- Document APIs with OpenAPI/Swagger\n- Use proper exception handling hierarchy\n- Apply database migrations (Flyway/Liquibase)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use deprecated Spring APIs\n- Skip input validation\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Use blocking code in reactive applications\n- Ignore transaction boundaries\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip proper logging and monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Java features, provide:\n1. Domain models (entities, DTOs, records)\n2. Service layer (business logic, transactions)\n3. Repository interfaces (Spring Data)\n4. Controller/REST endpoints\n5. Test classes with comprehensive coverage\n6. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSpring Boot 3.x, Java 21, Spring WebFlux, Project Reactor, Spring Data JPA, Spring Security, OAuth2/JWT, Hibernate, R2DBC, Spring Cloud, Resilience4j, Micrometer, JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito, Maven/Gradle\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack feature implementation\n- **API Designer** - REST API design and documentation\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Deployment and CI/CD\n- **Database Optimizer** - Query optimization and indexing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:22:27.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Enterprise Agents needing scalable Spring Boot application development and microservices architecture expertise.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的Spring Boot应用程序开发和微服务架构专业知识的企业代理。","ja":"エンタープライズエージェントがスケーラブルなSpring Bootアプリケーション開発とマイクロサービスアーキテクチャの専門知識を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 Spring Boot 애플리케이션 개발 및 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 엔터프라이즈 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Empresariales que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables de Spring Boot y experiencia en arquitectura de microservicios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''entreprise ayant besoin de développement d''applications Spring Boot évolutives et d''expertise en architecture de microservices.","de":"Perfekt für Enterprise-Agents, die eine skalierbare Spring Boot-Anwendungsentwicklung und Microservice-Architektur-Expertise benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Empresariais que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis Spring Boot e expertise em arquitetura de microsserviços.","ru":"Идеально подходит для корпоративных агентов, которым необходимы масштабируемые разработки приложений Spring Boot и опыт работы с микросервисной архитектурой.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المؤسسيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات Spring Boot القابلة للتحجيم وخبير في الهندسة المعمارية لمايكروسيرفس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement enterprise-grade Java applications using Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, and reactive programming with Project Reactor, while applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现企业级Java应用程序的能力，使用Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS和Project Reactor的响应式编程，同时应用Clean Architecture和SOLID原则。","ja":"エージェントに、Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS、およびProject Reactorのリアクティブプログラミングを使用して、エンタープライズグレードのJavaアプリケーションを設計および実装する能力を提供します。また、Clean ArchitectureとSOLID原則も適用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS 및 Project Reactor의 리액티브 프로그래밍을 사용하여 엔터프라이즈급 Java 애플리케이션을 설계하고 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 또한 Clean Architecture와 SOLID 원칙을 적용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar aplicaciones de Java de nivel empresarial utilizando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS y programación reactiva con Project Reactor, aplicando principios de Clean Architecture y SOLID.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des applications Java de niveau entreprise en utilisant Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS et la programmation réactive avec Project Reactor, en appliquant les principes de Clean Architecture et SOLID.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Unternehmensanwendungen in Java zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem sie Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS und reaktive Programmierung mit Project Reactor verwenden, wobei Clean Architecture- und SOLID-Prinzipien angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar aplicações Java de nível empresarial usando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS e programação reativa com Project Reactor, aplicando princípios de Clean Architecture e SOLID.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать корпоративные приложения Java с использованием Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS и реактивного программирования с Project Reactor, применяя принципы Clean Architecture и SOLID.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ تطبيقات Java من المستوى المؤسسي باستخدام Spring Boot 3.x و Java 21 LTS وبرمجة تفاعلية مع Project Reactor، مع تطبيق مبادئ Clean Architecture و SOLID."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable microservices with Spring Boot","Implementing reactive programming patterns with Project Reactor","Applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles to Java applications"],"zh":["使用Spring Boot构建可扩展的微服务","使用Project Reactor实现响应式编程模式","将Clean Architecture和SOLID原则应用于Java应用程序"],"ja":["Spring Bootを使用してスケーラブルなマイクロサービスを構築する","Project Reactorを使用してリアクティブプログラミングパターンを実装する","JavaアプリケーションにClean ArchitectureとSOLID原則を適用する"],"ko":["Spring Boot를 사용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스를 구축하는 것","Project Reactor를 사용하여 리액티브 프로그래밍 패턴을 구현하는 것","Java 애플리케이션에 Clean Architecture와 SOLID 원칙을 적용하는 것"],"es":["Construir microservicios escalables con Spring Boot","Implementar patrones de programación reactiva con Project Reactor","Aplicar principios de Clean Architecture y SOLID a aplicaciones de Java"],"fr":["Créer des microservices évolutifs avec Spring Boot","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de programmation réactive avec Project Reactor","Appliquer les principes de Clean Architecture et SOLID aux applications Java"],"de":["Skalierbare Microservices mit Spring Boot erstellen","Reaktive Programmierungsmuster mit Project Reactor implementieren","Clean Architecture- und SOLID-Prinzipien auf Java-Anwendungen anwenden"],"pt":["Construção de microsserviços escaláveis com Spring Boot","Implementação de padrões de programação reativa com Project Reactor","Aplicação de princípios de Clean Architecture e SOLID em aplicações Java"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых микросервисов с использованием Spring Boot","Реализация реактивных шаблонов программирования с Project Reactor","Применение принципов Clean Architecture и SOLID в приложениях Java"],"ar":["بناء مايكروسيرفس قابلة للتحجيم مع Spring Boot","تنفيذ أنماط برمجة تفاعلية مع Project Reactor","تطبيق مبادئ Clean Architecture و SOLID على تطبيقات Java"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java 21 LTS or higher","Specific to Spring Boot 3.x and microservices architecture"],"zh":["需要Java 21 LTS或更高版本","仅限于Spring Boot 3.x和微服务架构"],"ja":["Java 21 LTSまたは更高バージョンが必要","Spring Boot 3.xとマイクロサービスアーキテクチャに限定される"],"ko":["Java 21 LTS 또는更高 버전이 필요합니다","Spring Boot 3.x 및 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처에만 적용됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Java 21 LTS o superior","Específico para Spring Boot 3.x y arquitectura de microservicios"],"fr":["Nécessite Java 21 LTS ou supérieur","Spécifique à Spring Boot 3.x et à l''architecture de microservices"],"de":["Benötigt Java 21 LTS oder höher","Spezifisch für Spring Boot 3.x und Microservice-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige Java 21 LTS ou superior","Específico para Spring Boot 3.x e arquitetura de microsserviços"],"ru":["Требует Java 21 LTS или выше","Специфичен для Spring Boot 3.x и микросервисной архитектуры"],"ar":["يتطلب Java 21 LTS أو أعلى","محدد ل Spring Boot 3.x والهندسة المعمارية لمايكروسيرفس"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1f4bb89974e8761a2c0bed93dc46776f8f7ccd1e10d52174d1dd5ed8ad13752f","qualityScore":42}');
