вить Netlify","руководство по настройке Netlify"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Netlify","ما هو Netlify","بديل Netlify","Netlify مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت Netlify","دليل إعداد Netlify"]}},"owner":"mgd34msu","repo":"goodvibes-gemini","repoPath":"mgd34msu/goodvibes-gemini","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"netlify","description":"Deploys applications to Netlify including functions, forms, redirects, and edge functions. Use when deploying static sites, JAMstack applications, or serverless functions.","bodyPreview":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.n","body":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.netlify.com/drop` and drag your build folder.\n\n### netlify.toml Configuration\n\n```toml\n[build]\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  functions = \"netlify/functions\"\n\n[build.environment]\n  NODE_VERSION = \"18\"\n\n# Production context\n[context.production]\n  command = \"npm run build:prod\"\n\n# Preview context (branch deploys)\n[context.deploy-preview]\n  command = \"npm run build:preview\"\n\n# Branch-specific\n[context.staging]\n  command = \"npm run build:staging\"\n\n# Dev settings\n[dev]\n  command = \"npm run dev\"\n  port = 3000\n  targetPort = 5173\n\n# Headers\n[[headers]]\n  for = \"/*\"\n  [headers.values]\n    X-Frame-Options = \"DENY\"\n    X-XSS-Protection = \"1; mode=block\"\n\n# Redirects\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Setting Variables\n\n**Via Dashboard:**\nSite settings > Environment variables > Add variable\n\n**Via CLI:**\n```bash\nnetlify env:set MY_VAR \"value\"\nnetlify env:list\nnetlify env:get MY_VAR\nnetlify env:unset MY_VAR\n```\n\n### Context-Specific Variables\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[context.production.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://api.example.com\"\n\n[context.deploy-preview.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://staging-api.example.com\"\n\n[context.branch-deploy.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://dev-api.example.com\"\n```\n\n### Using Variables\n\n```javascript\n// In build process\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL;\n\n// In functions\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  const secret = process.env.API_SECRET;\n}\n```\n\n## Serverless Functions\n\n### Basic Function\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/hello.js\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n    body: JSON.stringify({ message: ''Hello, World!'' }),\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### TypeScript Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/users.ts\nimport type { Handler, HandlerEvent, HandlerContext } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nconst handler: Handler = async (event: HandlerEvent, context: HandlerContext) => {\n  const { httpMethod, body, queryStringParameters } = event;\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''GET'') {\n    const users: User[] = await getUsers();\n    return {\n      statusCode: 200,\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(users),\n    };\n  }\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''POST'') {\n    const data = JSON.parse(body || ''{}'');\n    const user = await createUser(data);\n    return {\n      statusCode: 201,\n      body: JSON.stringify(user),\n    };\n  }\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 405,\n    body: ''Method Not Allowed'',\n  };\n};\n\nexport { handler };\n```\n\n### Scheduled Functions\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/scheduled.ts\nimport { schedule } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\nconst handler = async () => {\n  console.log(''Running scheduled task'');\n  await runTask();\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n};\n\n// Run every day at midnight\nexport const handler = schedule(''0 0 * * *'', handler);\n```\n\n### Background Functions\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/background-task-background.js\n// Suffix with -background for async processing\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  // Long-running task (up to 15 minutes)\n  await processLargeDataset();\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### Basic Edge Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/geo.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const country = context.geo.country?.code ?? ''Unknown'';\n  const city = context.geo.city ?? ''Unknown'';\n\n  return new Response(\n    JSON.stringify({\n      message: `Hello from ${city}, ${country}!`,\n    }),\n    {\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n    }\n  );\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/geo'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function with Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/auth.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''Authorization'');\n\n  if (!token) {\n    return new Response(''Unauthorized'', { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  // Validate token\n  const user = await validateToken(token);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    return new Response(''Invalid token'', { status: 403 });\n  }\n\n  // Continue to origin\n  return context.next();\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/*'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function Declaration\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/geo\"\n  function = \"geo\"\n\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/*\"\n  function = \"auth\"\n```\n\n## Redirects & Rewrites\n\n### _redirects File\n\n```\n# Simple redirect\n/old-page /new-page 301\n\n# Wildcard redirect\n/blog/* /posts/:splat 301\n\n# Rewrite (proxy)\n/api/* /.netlify/functions/:splat 200\n\n# SPA fallback\n/* /index.html 200\n\n# Conditional redirect\n/country/* /us/:splat 200 Country=us\n/country/* /uk/:splat 200 Country=gb\n```\n\n### netlify.toml Redirects\n\n```toml\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/old\"\n  to = \"/new\"\n  status = 301\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"https://api.example.com/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n  force = true\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n  conditions = { Role = [\"admin\"] }\n```\n\n## Forms\n\n### HTML Form\n\n```html\n<form name=\"contact\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\">\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n  <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n  <textarea name=\"message\" required></textarea>\n  <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n### React Form\n\n```tsx\nfunction ContactForm() {\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState('''');\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const form = e.currentTarget;\n    const formData = new FormData(form);\n\n    try {\n      await fetch(''/'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'' },\n        body: new URLSearchParams(formData as any).toString(),\n      });\n      setStatus(''success'');\n    } catch (error) {\n      setStatus(''error'');\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      name=\"contact\"\n      method=\"POST\"\n      data-netlify=\"true\"\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n    >\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n      <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n      <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Form Notifications\n\nConfigure in Dashboard: Forms > [Form Name] > Settings > Notifications\n\n## Identity (Auth)\n\n### Setup\n\n```html\n<!-- Add to HTML -->\n<script src=\"https://identity.netlify.com/v1/netlify-identity-widget.js\"></script>\n```\n\n### JavaScript API\n\n```javascript\nimport netlifyIdentity from ''netlify-identity-widget'';\n\nnetlifyIdentity.init();\n\n// Open modal\nnetlifyIdentity.open();\n\n// Login\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''login'', user => {\n  console.log(''Logged in:'', user);\n});\n\n// Logout\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''logout'', () => {\n  console.log(''Logged out'');\n});\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = netlifyIdentity.currentUser();\n```\n\n## Large Media (Git LFS)\n\n```bash\n# Install\nnetlify lm:install\n\n# Setup\nnetlify lm:setup\n\n# Track files\ngit lfs track \"*.jpg\" \"*.png\" \"*.gif\"\n```\n\n## Blobs (Storage)\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/upload.ts\nimport { getStore } from ''@netlify/blobs'';\n\nexport async function handler(event) {\n  const store = getStore(''uploads'');\n\n  // Store blob\n  await store.set(''file-key'', event.body, {\n    metadata: { contentType: ''image/png'' },\n  });\n\n  // Get blob\n  const blob = await store.get(''file-key'');\n\n  // Delete blob\n  await store.delete(''file-key'');\n\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n}\n```\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\n# Start dev server\nnetlify dev\n\n# Start with specific port\nnetlify dev --port 3000\n\n# Link to site\nnetlify link\n\n# Pull environment variables\nnetlify env:pull\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use netlify.toml** - Version control your config\n2. **Set up branch deploys** - Preview before production\n3. **Use context-specific vars** - Different values per environment\n4. **Enable form spam filtering** - Protect forms\n5. **Use edge functions** - For low-latency operations\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Missing form-name input | Add hidden input with form name |\n| Wrong publish directory | Check framework output folder |\n| Functions not found | Use netlify/functions directory |\n| Redirects not working | Check order (first match wins) |\n| Build failures | Check build logs, Node version |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- [references/functions.md](references/functions.md) - Function patterns\n- [references/forms.md](references/forms.md) - Form handling\n- [references/edge.md](references/edge.md) - Edge functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:52:58.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing streamlined website deployment and hosting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化网站部署和托管能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"Webデベロッパーエージェントがストリームライン化されたWebサイトのデプロイとホスティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 웹사이트 배포 및 호스팅 기능을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una implementación y alojamiento de sitios web optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web nécessitant un déploiement et un hébergement de sites web rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Website-Bereitstellung und -Hosting benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de capacidades de implantação e hospedagem de sites simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности развертывания и хостинга веб-сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهات تطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات نشر مواقع الويب وتخزينها المبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and host websites on Netlify, utilizing the Netlify CLI for seamless integration with Git repositories and providing features like automatic build settings configuration and production deployment using protocols like npm.","zh":"赋予代理人员使用Netlify CLI将网站部署和托管在Netlify上与Git仓库实现无缝集成的能力，并提供自动构建设置配置和使用协议如npm的生产部署等功能。","ja":"エージェントがNetlify CLIを使用してNetlifyにWebサイトをデプロイおよびホストし、Gitリポジトリとのシームレスな統合と、npmなどのプロトコルを使用した自動ビルド設定構成やプロダクションデプロイなどの機能を提供することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 Netlify CLI를 사용하여 Netlify에 웹사이트를 배포하고 호스팅하며, Git 리포지토리와의 무缝 통합 및 npm과 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 자동 빌드 설정 구성 및 프로덕션 배포 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar y alojar sitios web en Netlify, utilizando el Netlify CLI para una integración sin problemas con los repositorios Git y proporcionando características como la configuración automática de la configuración de compilación y la implementación de producción utilizando protocolos como npm.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et d''héberger des sites web sur Netlify, en utilisant le Netlify CLI pour une intégration transparente avec les référentiels Git et en fournissant des fonctionnalités comme la configuration automatique des paramètres de build et le déploiement en production en utilisant des protocoles comme npm.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Websites auf Netlify zu bereitstellen und zu hosten, indem sie das Netlify CLI für eine nahtlose Integration mit Git-Repositorys verwenden und Funktionen wie die automatische Konfiguration der Build-Einstellungen und die Produktionsbereitstellung mithilfe von Protokollen wie npm bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e hospedar sites no Netlify, utilizando o Netlify CLI para integração sem problemas com repositórios Git e fornecendo recursos como configuração automática de configurações de build e implantação em produção usando protocolos como npm.","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать и хостить веб-сайты на Netlify, используя Netlify CLI для бесшовной интеграции с репозиториями Git и предоставляя функции, такие как автоматическая настройка параметров сборки и развертывание в производственной среде с использованием протоколов, таких как npm.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من نشر مواقع الويب على Netlify، باستخدام Netlify CLI من أجل التكامل السلس مع المستودعات الجيت، وتوفير ميزات مثل إعداد الإعدادات التلقائي وتنفيذ الإنتاج باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل npm."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating website deployment to Netlify","Configuring build settings for Git repositories","Deploying websites to production environments using Netlify CLI"],"zh":["自动将网站部署到Netlify","为Git仓库配置构建设置","使用Netlify CLI将网站部署到生产环境"],"ja":["NetlifyへのWebサイトの自動デプロイ","Gitリポジトリのビルド設定の構成","Netlify CLIを使用したプロダクション環境へのWebサイトのデプロイ"],"ko":["Netlify로 자동 웹사이트 배포","Git 리포지토리 빌드 설정 구성","Netlify CLI를 사용한 프로덕션 환경으로 웹사이트 배포"],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de sitios web en Netlify","Configurar la configuración de compilación para los repositorios Git","Implementar sitios web en entornos de producción utilizando el Netlify CLI"],"fr":["Automatiser le déploiement de sites web sur Netlify","Configurer les paramètres de build pour les référentiels Git","Déployer des sites web dans des environnements de production en utilisant le Netlify CLI"],"de":["Automatisieren der Website-Bereitstellung auf Netlify","Konfigurieren der Build-Einstellungen für Git-Repositorys","Bereitstellen von Websites in Produktionsumgebungen mithilfe des Netlify CLI"],"pt":["Automatizar a implantação de sites para o Netlify","Configurar configurações de build para repositórios Git","Implantar sites em ambientes de produção usando o Netlify CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание веб-сайтов на Netlify","Настроить параметры сборки для репозиториев Git","Развертывать веб-сайты в производственных средах с использованием Netlify CLI"],"ar":["تأتمة نشر مواقع الويب على Netlify","تكوين إعدادات البناء لمخازن الجيت","نشر مواقع الويب في بيئات الإنتاج باستخدام Netlify CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Netlify CLI installation via npm","Limited features available due to differences between Gemini CLI and Claude Code CLI","Not all features of the goodvibes plugin are available"],"zh":["需要通过npm安装Netlify CLI","由于Gemini CLI和Claude Code CLI之间的差异，功能有限","goodvibes插件的部分功能不可用"],"ja":["Netlify CLIをnpm経由でインストールする必要がある","Gemini CLIとClaude Code CLIの違いにより、機能が限定される","goodvibesプラグインのすべての機能が利用できない"],"ko":["Netlify CLI를 npm을 통해 설치해야 함","Gemini CLI와 Claude Code CLI의 차이로 인해 기능이 제한됨","goodvibes 플러그인의 일부 기능을 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del Netlify CLI a través de npm","Características limitadas disponibles debido a las diferencias entre Gemini CLI y Claude Code CLI","No todas las características del plugin goodvibes están disponibles"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du Netlify CLI via npm","Fonctionnalités limitées disponibles en raison des différences entre Gemini CLI et Claude Code CLI","Toutes les fonctionnalités du plugin goodvibes ne sont pas disponibles"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Netlify CLI über npm","Begrenzte Funktionen verfügbar aufgrund der Unterschiede zwischen Gemini CLI und Claude Code CLI","Nicht alle Funktionen des goodvibes-Plugins sind verfügbar"],"pt":["Requer a instalação do Netlify CLI via npm","Recursos limitados disponíveis devido às diferenças entre o Gemini CLI e o Claude Code CLI","Não todos os recursos do plugin goodvibes estão disponíveis"],"ru":["Требуется установка Netlify CLI через npm","Ограниченные функции доступны из-за различий между Gemini CLI и Claude Code CLI","Не все функции плагина goodvibes доступны"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Netlify CLI من خلال npm","ميزات محدودة متاحة بسبب الاختلافات بين Gemini CLI و Claude Code CLI","ليس جميع ميزات إضافة goodvibes متاحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"12801267febb6803d269096af6d9e493c1754abf6b439fb24c6302606d718708","qualityScore":42}');
