e trabajo de desarrollo listos para producción con Agentes de IA especializados para Claude Code","fr":"Flux de travail de développement prêts pour la production avec des Outils d''IA spécialisés pour Claude Code","de":"Produktionsbereite Entwicklungswerkflüsse mit spezialisierten KI-Agents für Claude Code","pt":"Desenvolvimento de fluxos de trabalho prontos para produção com Claude Code, impulsionado por agentes de IA especializados.","ru":"Готовые к производству потоки разработки с Claude Code, работающие на специализированных ИИ агентах.","ar":"سلاسل عمل جاهزة للإنتاج مع Claude Code، مدعومة بوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين.","en":"Production-ready development workflows for Claude Code, powered by specialized AI agents."},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready development workflows for Claude Code, powered by specialized AI agents."},"features":{"zh":["支持多种编程语言","提供实时代码提示","集成代码审查功能","支持CLI命令","兼容多种开发环境"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","リアルタイムコードヒントを提供","コードレビュー機能を統合","CLIコマンドをサポート","複数の開発環境をサポート"],"ko":["다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","실시간 코드 힌트 제공","코드 리뷰 기능 통합","CLI 명령어 지원","다중 개발 환경 지원"],"es":["Flujos de trabajo de desarrollo personalizables","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de software","Optimización del código con Agentes de IA","Implementación de principios de codificación sólidos","Colaboración en equipo con flujos de trabajo compartidos"],"fr":["Flux de travail de développement personnalisables","Intégration avec des outils de développement de logiciels","Optimisation du code avec des Outils d''IA","Mise en œuvre de principes de codage solides","Collaboration d''équipe avec des flux de travail partagés"],"de":["Anpassbare Entwicklungswerkflüsse","Integration mit Software-Entwicklungstools","Code-Optimierung mit KI-Agents","Umsetzung solider Codierprinzipien","Teamzusammenarbeit mit gemeinsamen Werkflüssen"],"pt":["Fluxos de trabalho personalizados","Integração com Claude Code","Otimização de desempenho","Segurança e conformidade","Suporte a linguagens de programação múltiplas"],"ru":["Пользовательские потоки работы","Интеграция с Claude Code","Оптимизация производительности","Безопасность и соответствие","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["سلاسل عمل مخصصة","التكامل مع Claude Code","تحسين الأداء","الأمان والمطابقة","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","coding-principles","Claude Code","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理与传统开发工具的区别","AI智能代理安装指南","AI智能代理设置教程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コーディングプリンシプル","Claude Code","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントと従来の開発ツールの違い","AIエージェントのインストール方法","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코딩 원칙","Claude Code","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트와 전통적인 개발 도구의 차이","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 설정 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es el desarrollo de software","Agentes de IA alternativos","Claude Code vs competidores","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["comment utiliser des Outils d''IA","quoi est le développement de logiciels","Outils d''IA alternatifs","Claude Code vs concurrents","installation d''Outils d''IA","guide de configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist Software-Entwicklung","KI-Agents-Alternativen","Claude Code vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Agents","Einrichtungsanleitung für Claude Code"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que são agentes de IA","Claude Code alternativa","Claude Code vs competidores","instalar agentes de IA","guia de configuração de agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de software com IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агенты","что такое ИИ агенты","Claude Code альтернатива","Claude Code vs конкуренты","установить ИИ агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ агентов","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","Claude Code بديل","Claude Code مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"claude-code-workflows","repoPath":"shinpr/claude-code-workflows","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.900Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-principles","description":"Language-agnostic coding principles for maintainability, readability, and quality. Use when implementing features, refactoring code, or reviewing code quality.","bodyPreview":"# Language-Agnostic Coding Principles\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n1. **Maintainability over Speed**: Prioritize long-term code health over initial development velocity\n2. **Simplicity First**: Choose the simplest solution that meets requirements (YAGNI principle)\n3. **Explicit over Implicit**: Make intentions clear through code structure and naming\n4. **Delete over Comment**: Remove unused code instead of commenting it out\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### Continuous Improvement\n- Refactor as you go - don''t accumu","body":"# Language-Agnostic Coding Principles\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n1. **Maintainability over Speed**: Prioritize long-term code health over initial development velocity\n2. **Simplicity First**: Choose the simplest solution that meets requirements (YAGNI principle)\n3. **Explicit over Implicit**: Make intentions clear through code structure and naming\n4. **Delete over Comment**: Remove unused code instead of commenting it out\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### Continuous Improvement\n- Refactor as you go - don''t accumulate technical debt\n- Improve code structure incrementally\n- Keep the codebase lean and focused\n- Delete unused code immediately\n\n### Readability\n- Use meaningful, descriptive names drawn from the problem domain\n- Avoid abbreviations unless they are widely recognized\n- Avoid single-letter names except for loop counters or well-known conventions (i, j, x, y)\n- Extract magic numbers and strings into named constants\n- Keep code self-documenting where possible\n- Write code that humans can easily understand\n\n## Function Design\n\n### Parameter Management\n- **Recommended**: 0-2 parameters per function\n- **For 3+ parameters**: Use objects, structs, or dictionaries to group related parameters\n- **Example** (conceptual):\n  ```\n  // Instead of: createUser(name, email, age, city, country)\n  // Use: createUser(userData)\n  ```\n\n### Single Responsibility\n- Each function should do one thing well\n- Keep functions small and focused (typically < 50 lines)\n- Extract complex logic into separate, well-named functions\n- Functions should have a single level of abstraction\n\n### Function Organization\n- Pure functions when possible (no side effects)\n- Separate data transformation from side effects\n- Use early returns to reduce nesting\n- Avoid deep nesting (maximum 3 levels)\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Error Management Principles\n- **Always handle errors**: Log with context or propagate explicitly\n- **Log appropriately**: Include context for debugging\n- **Protect sensitive data**: Mask or exclude passwords, tokens, PII from logs\n- **Fail fast**: Detect and report errors as early as possible\n\n### Error Propagation\n- Use language-appropriate error handling mechanisms\n- Propagate errors to appropriate handling levels\n- Provide meaningful error messages\n- Include error context when re-throwing\n\n## Dependency Management\n\n### Loose Coupling via Parameterized Dependencies\n- Inject external dependencies as parameters (constructor injection for classes, function parameters for procedural/functional code)\n- Depend on abstractions, not concrete implementations\n- Minimize inter-module dependencies\n- Facilitate testing through mockable dependencies\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n### Optimization Approach\n- **Measure first**: Profile before optimizing\n- **Focus on algorithms**: Algorithmic complexity > micro-optimizations\n- **Use appropriate data structures**: Choose based on access patterns\n- **Resource management**: Handle memory, connections, and files properly\n\n### When to Optimize\n- After identifying actual bottlenecks\n- When performance issues are measurable\n- Not prematurely during initial development\n\n## Code Organization\n\n### Structural Principles\n- **Group related functionality**: Keep related code together\n- **Separate concerns**: Domain logic, data access, presentation\n- **Consistent naming**: Follow project conventions\n- **Module cohesion**: High cohesion within modules, low coupling between\n\n### File Organization\n- One primary responsibility per file\n- Logical grouping of related functions/classes\n- Clear folder structure reflecting architecture\n- Avoid \"god files\" (files > 500 lines)\n\n## Commenting Principles\n\n### When to Comment\n- **Document \"what\"**: Describe what the code does\n- **Explain \"why\"**: Clarify reasoning behind decisions\n- **Note limitations**: Document known constraints or edge cases\n- **API documentation**: Public interfaces need clear documentation\n\n### When NOT to Comment\n- Avoid describing \"how\" (the code shows that)\n- Don''t include historical information (use version control)\n- Remove commented-out code (use git to retrieve old code)\n- Avoid obvious comments that restate the code\n\n### Comment Quality\n- Keep comments concise and timeless\n- Update comments when changing code\n- Use proper grammar and formatting\n- Write for future maintainers\n\n## Refactoring Approach\n\n### Safe Refactoring\n- **Small steps**: Make one change at a time\n- **Maintain working state**: Keep tests passing\n- **Verify behavior**: Run tests after each change\n- **Incremental improvement**: Don''t aim for perfection immediately\n\n### Refactoring Triggers\n- Code duplication (DRY principle)\n- Functions > 50 lines\n- Complex conditional logic\n- Unclear naming or structure\n\n## Testing Considerations\n\n### Testability\n- Write testable code from the start\n- Avoid hidden dependencies\n- Keep side effects explicit\n- Design for parameterized dependencies\n\n### Test-Driven Development\n- Write tests before implementation when appropriate\n- Keep tests simple and focused\n- Test behavior, not implementation\n- Maintain test quality equal to production code\n\n## Security Principles\n\n### General Security\n- Store secrets in environment variables or secret managers\n- Validate all external input\n- Use parameterized queries for databases\n- Follow principle of least privilege\n\n### Data Protection\n- Encrypt sensitive data at rest and in transit\n- Sanitize user input\n- Avoid logging sensitive information\n- Use secure random generators for security-critical operations\n\n## Documentation\n\n### Code Documentation\n- Document public APIs and interfaces\n- Include usage examples for complex functionality\n- Maintain README files for modules\n- Keep documentation in sync with code\n\n### Architecture Documentation\n- Document high-level design decisions\n- Explain integration points\n- Clarify data flows and boundaries\n- Record trade-offs and alternatives considered\n\n## Version Control Practices\n\n### Commit Practices\n- Make atomic, focused commits\n- Write clear, descriptive commit messages\n- Commit working code (passes tests)\n- Avoid committing debug code or secrets\n\n### Code Review Readiness\n- Self-review before requesting review\n- Keep changes focused and reviewable\n- Provide context in pull request descriptions\n- Respond to feedback constructively\n\n## Language-Specific Adaptations\n\nWhile these principles are language-agnostic, adapt them to your specific programming language:\n\n- **Static typing**: Use strong types when available\n- **Dynamic typing**: Add runtime validation\n- **OOP languages**: Apply SOLID principles\n- **Functional languages**: Prefer pure functions and immutability\n- **Concurrency**: Follow language-specific patterns for thread safety\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:49.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents like Claude Code, requiring adherence to language-agnostic coding principles for maintainable and efficient development workflows.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 这样的代码生成代理，需要遵循语言无关的编码原则，以实现可维护和高效的开发工作流程。","ja":"Claude Code のようなコード生成エージェントに適しており、維持可能で効率的な開発ワークフローを実現するために、言語非依存のコーディング原則に従う必要があります。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합하며, 유지 보수 가능하고 효율적인 개발 워크플로를 구현하기 위해 언어 중립적인 코딩 원칙을遵循해야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código como Claude Code, que requieren adherencia a principios de codificación independientes del lenguaje para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo mantenibles y eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code comme Claude Code, nécessitant l''adhésion à des principes de codage indépendants du langage pour des flux de travail de développement maintenables et efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die die Einhaltung sprachunabhängiger Codierungsprinzipien für wartbare und effiziente Entwicklungsworkflows erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Código como Claude Code, que exigem aderência a princípios de codificação independentes de linguagem para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento mantidos e eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, таких как Claude Code, требующих соблюдения языково-независимых принципов кодирования для поддерживаемых и эффективных рабочих процессов разработки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات إنتاج الشفرة مثل Claude Code ، التي تتطلب الالتزام بمبادئ برمجة غير معتمدة على اللغة لتدفقات عمل التطوير القابلة للصيانة والفعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prioritize maintainability over speed, embracing simplicity and explicitness in code structure, and continuously refactoring for improved code quality, leveraging principles like YAGNI and ''Delete over Comment'' to ensure clean and readable codebases.","zh":"赋予代理以维护性为优先，拥抱代码结构中的简单性和明确性，并不断重构以提高代码质量，利用 YAGNI 和 ''删除代替注释'' 等原则以确保代码库清洁可读。","ja":"エージェントに、速度よりもメンテナンス性を優先することを可能にし、コード構造におけるシンプルさと明確さを重視し、コードの品質を向上させるために継続的にリファクタリングを行い、YAGNI や ''コメントよりも削除'' などの原則を利用して、クリーンで読みやすいコードベースを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 유지 보수성을 속도보다 우선하도록 하며, 코드 구조에서 단순성과 명확성을 강조하고, 코드 품질 개선을 위해 지속적으로 리팩토링하고, YAGNI와 ''주석보다 삭제''와 같은 원칙을 활용하여 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 코드베이스를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a priorizar la mantenibilidad sobre la velocidad, abrazando la simplicidad y la explicitud en la estructura del código, y refactorizando continuamente para mejorar la calidad del código, aprovechando principios como YAGNI y ''Eliminar sobre Comentar'' para garantizar bases de código limpias y legibles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de donner la priorité à la maintenabilité plutôt qu''à la vitesse, en adoptant la simplicité et l''explicitation de la structure du code, et en refactorisant continuellement pour améliorer la qualité du code, en tirant parti de principes comme YAGNI et ''Supprimer au lieu de commenter'' pour garantir des bases de code propres et lisibles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Wartbarkeit gegenüber Geschwindigkeit zu priorisieren, indem sie Einfachheit und Explizitheit in der Code-Struktur verfolgen und kontinuierlich für eine verbesserte Code-Qualität refactorisieren, unter Nutzung von Prinzipien wie YAGNI und ''Löschen anstelle von Kommentieren'', um saubere und lesbare Codebasen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a priorizar a manutenção em relação à velocidade, adotando a simplicidade e a explicitação na estrutura do código, e refatorando continuamente para melhorar a qualidade do código, utilizando princípios como YAGNI e ''Delete over Comment'' para garantir bases de código limpas e legíveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов приоритетом поддерживаемости над скоростью, принимая простоту и явность в структуре кода, и不断но рефакторит для улучшения качества кода, используя принципы, такие как YAGNI и ''Delete over Comment'', чтобы обеспечить чистые и читаемые кодовые базы.","ar":"تمكين الوكيلات من إعطاء الأولوية للصيانة على السرعة، واعتماد البساطة والوضوح في هيكل الشفرة، وإعادة هيكلة مستمرة لتحسين جودة الشفرة، باستخدام مبادئ مثل YAGNI و ''Delete over Comment'' لضمان قواعد شفرة نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring legacy code for improved maintainability","Generating production-ready code with explicit naming conventions","Implementing continuous improvement workflows for code quality enhancement"],"zh":["重构遗留代码以提高维护性","生成具有明确命名约定的生产就绪代码","实现持续改进工作流以提高代码质量"],"ja":["メンテナンス性の向上のためにレガシーコードをリファクタリングする","明確な命名規約を持つプロダクションレディーコードを生成する","コード品質の向上のために継続的な改善ワークフローを実装する"],"ko":["유지 보수성을 개선하기 위해 레거시 코드를 리팩토링하는 것","명시적인 명명 규칙을 갖춘 프로덕션 준비 코드를 생성하는 것","코드 품질 개선을 위해 지속적인 개선 워크플로우를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de código heredado para mejorar la mantenibilidad","Generación de código de producción listo con convenciones de nomenclatura explícitas","Implementación de flujos de trabajo de mejora continua para la mejora de la calidad del código"],"fr":["Réorganisation de code hérité pour améliorer la maintenabilité","Génération de code de production prêt avec des conventions de nommage explicites","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail d''amélioration continue pour l''amélioration de la qualité du code"],"de":["Umstrukturierung von Legacy-Code zur Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit","Generierung von produktionsbereitem Code mit expliziten Benennungskonventionen","Implementierung von kontinuierlichen Verbesserungsworkflows zur Qualitätsverbesserung des Codes"],"pt":["Reestruturação de código legado para melhor manutenção","Geração de código de produção pronto com convenções de nomenclatura explícitas","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho de melhoria contínua para melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Рефакторинг устаревшего кода для улучшения поддерживаемости","Генерация готового к производству кода с явными соглашениями об именах","Реализация рабочих процессов непрерывного улучшения для повышения качества кода"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الشفرة القديمة لتحسين الصيانة","إنتاج شفرة جاهزة للانتاج مع اتفاقيات تسمية واضحة","تنفيذ سير عمل تحسين مستمر لتحسين جودة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific coding principles","May necessitate additional development time for initial setup","Focused on code quality and maintainability, potentially impacting initial development velocity"],"zh":["需要遵循特定的编码原则","可能需要额外的开发时间用于初始设置","注重代码质量和维护性，可能会影响初始开发速度"],"ja":["特定のコーディング原則に従う必要がある","初期設定のために追加の開発時間を必要とする可能性がある","コード品質とメンテナンス性に焦点を当てているため、初期の開発速度に影響を及ぼす可能性がある"],"ko":["특정 코딩 원칙을遵循해야 함","초기 설정을 위해 추가 개발 시간이 필요할 수 있음","코드 품질과 유지 보수성에 중점을 두고 있으므로 초기 개발 속도에 영향을 미칠 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a principios de codificación específicos","Puede necesitar tiempo de desarrollo adicional para la configuración inicial","Se centra en la calidad y mantenibilidad del código, lo que puede afectar la velocidad de desarrollo inicial"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à des principes de codage spécifiques","Peut nécessiter du temps de développement supplémentaire pour la configuration initiale","Se concentre sur la qualité et la maintenabilité du code, ce qui peut avoir un impact sur la vitesse de développement initiale"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung spezifischer Codierungsprinzipien","Kann zusätzliche Entwicklungszeit für die anfängliche Einrichtung erfordern","Konzentriert sich auf Code-Qualität und Wartbarkeit, was die anfängliche Entwicklungszeit möglicherweise beeinflussen kann"],"pt":["Exige aderência a princípios de codificação específicos","Pode necessitar de tempo de desenvolvimento adicional para configuração inicial","Focado na qualidade e manutenção do código, potencialmente impactando a velocidade de desenvolvimento inicial"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конкретных принципов кодирования","Может потребовать дополнительного времени разработки для первоначальной настройки","Сосредоточен на качестве и поддерживаемости кода, потенциально влияя на начальную скорость разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمبادئ برمجة محددة","يمكن أن يتطلب وقتًا إضافيًا للتنمية لتحضير أولي","يركز على جودة الشفرة والصيانة، ويمكن أن يؤثر على سرعة التطوير الأولية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b3be54c05376f3eed9bc0841e9a502ed1f35dcaa431593e2aa3b4eb9bd108a80","qualityScore":42}');
