,"Uso offline","Enfoque en la privacidad","Integración con github"],"fr":["Transcription et traduction en temps réel","Compatibilité avec macOS","Utilisation hors ligne","Focus sur la vie privée","Intégration avec github"],"de":["Echtzeit-Transkription und -Übersetzung","Kompatibilität mit macOS","Offline-Nutzung","Fokus auf den Datenschutz","Integration mit github"],"pt":["Transcrição em tempo real","Tradução para vários idiomas","Funciona totalmente offline","Prioriza a privacidade do usuário","Compatível com macOS"],"ru":["Перевод в реальном времени","Перевод на несколько языков","Работает полностью офлайн","Приоритет приватности пользователя","Совместим с macOS"],"ar":["ترجمة في الوقت الحقيقي","ترجمة إلى لغات متعددة","تعمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت","تحافظ على خصوصية المستخدم","متوافقة مع نظام ماك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-release AI工具","实时语音转录","macOS AI工具","完全离线AI工具","保护用户隐私AI工具","如何使用github-release AI工具","github-release AI工具安装","github-release AI工具设置指南"],"ja":["github-release AIエージェント","リアルタイム音声転写","macOS AIエージェント","完全オフラインAIエージェント","プライバシー優先AIエージェント","github-release AIエージェントの使い方","github-release AIエージェントのインストール","github-release AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["github-release AI 에이전트","실시간 음성 인식","macOS AI 에이전트","완전 오프라인 AI 에이전트","개인 정보 보호 AI 에이전트","github-release AI 에이전트 사용법","github-release AI 에이전트 설치","github-release AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","transcripción en tiempo real","traducción automática","github-release alternativa","cómo usar github-release","instalación de github-release","guía de configuración de github-release"],"fr":["outils d''IA","transcription en temps réel","traduction automatique","alternative à github-release","comment utiliser github-release","installation de github-release","guide de configuration de github-release"],"de":["KI-Tools","Echtzeit-Transkription","automatische Übersetzung","Alternative zu github-release","wie man github-release verwendet","Installation von github-release","Konfigurationsanleitung für github-release"],"pt":["como usar github-release","o que é github-release","github-release alternativa","github-release vs google translate","instalar github-release","guia de configuração do github-release"],"ru":["как использовать github-release","что такое github-release","альтернативы github-release","github-release vs google переводчик","установить github-release","руководство по настройке github-release"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام github-release","ما هي أداة github-release","بديل github-release","github-release مقابل مترجم جوجل","تثبيت github-release","دليل إعداد github-release"]}},"owner":"Cyronlee","repo":"TransFlow","repoPath":"Cyronlee/TransFlow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.908Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-release","description":"Publish a new GitHub Release for TransFlow with version bump, release notes, DMG build, and gh CLI. Use when the user asks to release a version, publish a release, create a GitHub release, or mentions 发布 vX.Y.Z.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Release\n\nPublish a new TransFlow version to GitHub Releases with DMG attachment.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth status`)\n- `create-dmg` installed (`brew install create-dmg`)\n- Xcode Command Line Tools\n- Working directory clean (no uncommitted changes unrelated to release)\n\n## Workflow\n\nParse the target version from the user''s request (e.g. \"发布 v1.2.0\" → `1.2.0`). Strip the `v` prefix for version strings used in code; keep `v` prefix for git tags.\n\n``","body":"# GitHub Release\n\nPublish a new TransFlow version to GitHub Releases with DMG attachment.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth status`)\n- `create-dmg` installed (`brew install create-dmg`)\n- Xcode Command Line Tools\n- Working directory clean (no uncommitted changes unrelated to release)\n\n## Workflow\n\nParse the target version from the user''s request (e.g. \"发布 v1.2.0\" → `1.2.0`). Strip the `v` prefix for version strings used in code; keep `v` prefix for git tags.\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Pre-flight checks\n- [ ] Step 2: Update version numbers\n- [ ] Step 3: Generate release notes\n- [ ] Step 4: Commit, tag, push\n- [ ] Step 5: Build DMG locally\n- [ ] Step 6: Create GitHub Release with DMG\n- [ ] Step 7: Verify release\n```\n\n### Step 1: Pre-flight checks\n\nRun in parallel:\n- `gh auth status` — confirm GitHub CLI is authenticated\n- `git status` — confirm working directory is clean (or only has expected changes)\n- `git log --oneline -20` — review recent commits for release notes\n\n### Step 2: Update version numbers\n\nUpdate `MARKETING_VERSION` in **all 6 locations** inside `project.pbxproj`:\n\n```bash\n# File: TransFlow/TransFlow.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj\n# Replace all occurrences:\nMARKETING_VERSION = <old>;  →  MARKETING_VERSION = <new>;\n```\n\nUpdate fallback version strings in Swift source:\n\n| File | What to change |\n|------|----------------|\n| `TransFlow/TransFlow/Models/JSONLModels.swift` | `?? \"X.Y.Z\"` fallback in `init` |\n| `TransFlow/TransFlow/Views/SettingsView.swift` | `?? \"X.Y.Z\"` fallback in `appVersionString` |\n\n### Step 3: Generate release notes\n\nCreate `release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md` based on `git log` since the last tag (or all commits if first release).\n\n> **Convention**: All release notes live in the `release-notes/` directory at the repo root, named `v<version>.md` (e.g. `release-notes/v1.0.0.md`).\n\nRelease notes template:\n\n```markdown\n# TransFlow vX.Y.Z\n\n[One-line summary of this release]\n\n## What''s New\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Improvements\n- Improvement 1\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Fix 1 (if any)\n\n## System Requirements\n- macOS 15.0 or later\n- Apple Silicon (arm64) or Intel (x86_64)\n```\n\nIf there is a previous tag, use `git log <prev-tag>..HEAD --oneline` to scope changes.\n\n### Step 4: Commit, tag, push\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"release: bump version to vX.Y.Z\"\ngit tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"TransFlow vX.Y.Z\"\ngit push origin main --tags\n```\n\n### Step 5: Build DMG locally\n\n```bash\n./scripts/build-dmg.sh --clean --sign\n```\n\n- `--sign` auto-detects signing identity and auto-loads project entitlements (microphone, etc.)\n- The build disables Xcode signing; the script handles signing separately for consistency\n- Signing identity: `5JNN9A6Z6X`, Team ID: `8RQVLSP2SC`\n- Set `block_until_ms` to 300000 (5 min) — build + DMG takes time\n- Output: `build/TransFlow-X.Y.Z.dmg`\n- Verify the DMG file exists and is non-empty before proceeding\n\n### Step 6: Create GitHub Release\n\n```bash\ngh release create vX.Y.Z \\\n  --title \"TransFlow vX.Y.Z\" \\\n  --notes-file release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md \\\n  ./build/TransFlow-X.Y.Z.dmg\n```\n\n### Step 7: Verify release\n\n```bash\ngh release view vX.Y.Z\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- Title and tag are correct\n- `draft: false`, `prerelease: false`\n- DMG asset is listed with non-zero size\n- Release notes render correctly\n\nReport the release URL to the user.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| `gh auth` fails | Ask user to run `gh auth login` |\n| `xcodebuild` fails | Check build errors, fix, retry |\n| `create-dmg` exit code ≠ 0 and ≠ 2 | Check script output for details |\n| `gh release create` fails | Check if tag already has a release; use `gh release delete vX.Y.Z` then retry |\n| DMG file missing after build | Check `build/` directory; re-run build script |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:59:52.813Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring automated GitHub release management with DMG attachments.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要自动化的 GitHub 发布管理，并带有 DMG 附件。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain のような AI エージェントに適しています。GitHub リリース管理を自動化し、DMG アタッチメントを必要とします。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 자동화된 GitHub 릴리스 관리와 DMG 첨부 파일이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una gestión de lanzamientos automatizada de GitHub con adjuntos DMG.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une gestion de version automatique de GitHub avec des pièces jointes DMG.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Release-Verwaltung mit DMG-Anhängen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem gerenciamento de lançamento automatizado do GitHub com anexos DMG.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих автоматизированного управления выпусками GitHub с вложениями DMG.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب إدارة إصدار GitHub آلي مع مرفقات DMG."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish new software versions to GitHub Releases with DMG attachments, leveraging the gh CLI and create-dmg tools for streamlined release workflows, while ensuring privacy-first and fully offline real-time speech transcription and translation capabilities for macOS.","zh":"赋予代理发布新软件版本到 GitHub Releases 中，带有 DMG 附件，利用 gh CLI 和 create-dmg 工具实现流线型的发布工作流，同时确保以隐私为首的完全离线实时语音转录和翻译功能用于 macOS。","ja":"エージェントは、gh CLI と create-dmg ツールを使用して、GitHub Releases に新しいソフトウェアバージョンを公開し、DMG アタッチメントを追加し、macOS でのプライバシー優先の完全オフラインリアルタイム音声トランスクリプションと翻訳機能を提供するためのストリーミングされたリリースワークフローを実現します。","ko":"에이전트는 gh CLI와 create-dmg 도구를 사용하여 GitHub Releases에 새로운 소프트웨어 버전을 게시하고 DMG 첨부 파일을 추가하여 macOS에서 프라이버시 우선의 완전 오프라인 실시간 음성 전사 및 번역 기능을 제공하는 스트리밍된 릴리스 워크플로우를 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar nuevas versiones de software en GitHub Releases con adjuntos DMG, aprovechando la CLI de gh y las herramientas create-dmg para flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento optimizados, al mismo tiempo que garantiza capacidades de transcripción y traducción de habla en tiempo real con prioridad a la privacidad y completamente sin conexión para macOS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier de nouvelles versions de logiciels sur GitHub Releases avec des pièces jointes DMG, en exploitant la CLI gh et les outils create-dmg pour des flux de travail de version optimisés, tout en garantissant des capacités de transcription et de traduction de la parole en temps réel avec priorité à la vie privée et entièrement hors ligne pour macOS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, neue Softwareversionen auf GitHub Releases mit DMG-Anhängen zu veröffentlichen, indem es die gh-CLI und die create-dmg-Tools für optimierte Release-Workflows nutzt, während es gleichzeitig Echtzeit-Sprachtranskriptions- und -übersetzungs-Funktionen mit Datenschutz als Priorität und vollständig offline für macOS gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar novas versões de software no GitHub Releases com anexos DMG, utilizando o gh CLI e as ferramentas create-dmg para fluxos de trabalho de lançamento otimizados, garantindo capacidades de transcrição e tradução de fala em tempo real com privacidade e totalmente offline para macOS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность публиковать новые версии программного обеспечения в GitHub Releases с вложениями DMG, используя gh CLI и инструменты create-dmg для оптимизированных рабочих процессов выпуска, обеспечивая функции транскрипции и перевода речи в режиме реального времени с приоритетом конфиденциальности и полностью в автономном режиме для macOS.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من نشر إصدارات برامج جديدة إلى إصدارات GitHub مع مرفقات DMG، باستخدام غ كلي و أدوات create-dmg للعملية المُيسرة لإصدار البرامج، مع ضمان القدرات الأولية للخصوصية و الترجمة الفورية و النصية للكلام في نظام التشغيل macOS."},"useCases":{"en":["Publishing TransFlow versions to GitHub Releases","Automating DMG attachment creation for macOS releases","Streamlining release workflows with gh CLI and create-dmg integration"],"zh":["将 TransFlow 版本发布到 GitHub Releases","为 macOS 发布自动创建 DMG 附件","使用 gh CLI 和 create-dmg 集成简化发布工作流"],"ja":["TransFlow バージョンを GitHub Releases に公開する","macOS リリースの DMG アタッチメントを作成を自動化する","gh CLI と create-dmg の統合を使用してリリースワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["TransFlow 버전을 GitHub Releases에 게시하는 것","macOS 릴리스를 위한 DMG 첨부 파일 생성 자동화","gh CLI와 create-dmg 통합을 사용하여 릴리스 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Publicar versiones de TransFlow en GitHub Releases","Automatizar la creación de adjuntos DMG para lanzamientos de macOS","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento con la integración de gh CLI y create-dmg"],"fr":["Publier des versions de TransFlow sur GitHub Releases","Automatiser la création de pièces jointes DMG pour les versions de macOS","Optimiser les flux de travail de version avec l''intégration de la CLI gh et create-dmg"],"de":["Veröffentlichung von TransFlow-Versionen auf GitHub Releases","Automatisierung der Erstellung von DMG-Anhängen für macOS-Veröffentlichungen","Optimierung von Release-Workflows durch Integration von gh-CLI und create-dmg"],"pt":["Publicação de versões do TransFlow para GitHub Releases","Criação automática de anexos DMG para lançamentos do macOS","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho de lançamento com integração do gh CLI e create-dmg"],"ru":["Публикация версий TransFlow в GitHub Releases","Автоматическое создание вложений DMG для выпусков macOS","Оптимизация рабочих процессов выпуска с помощью интеграции gh CLI и create-dmg"],"ar":["نشر إصدارات TransFlow إلى إصدارات GitHub","إنشاء تلقائي لمرفقات DMG لإصدارات macOS","تبسيط سير عمل الإصدارات باستخدام تكامل غ كلي و create-dmg"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh CLI installed and authenticated","Needs create-dmg installed via brew","Demands Xcode Command Line Tools and a clean working directory"],"zh":["需要安装并认证 gh CLI","需要通过 brew 安装 create-dmg","需要 Xcode Command Line Tools 和干净的工作目录"],"ja":["gh CLI がインストールされ認証されている必要がある","create-dmg が brew 経由でインストールされている必要がある","Xcode コマンドラインツールとクリーンなワーキングディレクトリが必要"],"ko":["gh CLI가 설치되고 인증되어야 함","create-dmg가 brew를 통해 설치되어야 함","Xcode 명령줄 도구와 깨끗한 작업 디렉토리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la CLI de gh instalada y autenticada","Necesita create-dmg instalado a través de brew","Exige las herramientas de línea de comandos de Xcode y un directorio de trabajo limpio"],"fr":["Nécessite la CLI gh installée et authentifiée","Nécessite create-dmg installé via brew","Exige les outils de ligne de commande Xcode et un répertoire de travail propre"],"de":["Benötigt die gh-CLI installiert und authentifiziert","Benötigt create-dmg, das über brew installiert wurde","Fordert die Xcode-Command-Line-Tools und ein sauberes Arbeitsverzeichnis"],"pt":["Exige o gh CLI instalado e autenticado","Necessita do create-dmg instalado via brew","Exige as Ferramentas de Linha de Comando do Xcode e um diretório de trabalho limpo"],"ru":["Требует установленного и аутентифицированного gh CLI","Требует установленного create-dmg через brew","Требует инструментов командной строки Xcode и чистого рабочего каталога"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت غ كلي و مصادقة","يتطلب تثبيت create-dmg من خلال brew","يتطلب أدوات سطر أوامر Xcode و دليل عمل نظيف"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"968edf87dd2a922cef2b6f62ab36d822f8138cec224a283e1e894086ecb4c4bd","qualityScore":42}');
